


translate chinese day_2_4a64635e:


    "这天终于到了。"


translate chinese day_2_69109f50:


    "我最害怕的上课第一天到了。"


translate chinese day_2_e455a3dd:


    "还有新的学校、新的老师、新的同学们。后者我最担心，因为对我来说跟同学处得来很不容易的。"


translate chinese day_2_8b078bd6:


    "可能大多数戴眼镜的学生都是这样。"


translate chinese day_2_68530f61:


    "我作出了很大努力，才能从床上起来。"


translate chinese day_2_a1a382ed:


    "以前父亲送我上学，可是今天父母的卧室里听起来挺安静的。"


translate chinese day_2_ee9d7d60:


    "难道他们还睡吗？"


translate chinese day_2_74379b13:


    "这还好，我不想一开始就被其他学生笑称为“爸爸的宝贝”。"


translate chinese day_2_f516153c:


    "父母还没起来。他们可能正在安全的梦境里做美梦。"


translate chinese day_2_245c85a2:


    "梦境虽然是美好的,但都是虚伪的。"


translate chinese day_2_4b8569f4:


    "为了不吵醒所有的家人，尤其是睡得很香的奥利娅，我偷偷地下了楼。"


translate chinese day_2_0333eb45:


    "我尽力踩在地板的中部上。"


translate chinese day_2_2dfc59fa:


    "住在城市的时候，我也玩过这个游戏，规则很简单：如果你不小心踩上了地板之间的缝隙，那你就输了。"


translate chinese day_2_943aa9b6:


    "时间飞快地流逝着。"


translate chinese day_2_8de4875e:


    "«{i}哎哟，我可真慢。快点，快点！{/i}»"


translate chinese day_2_c786074b:


    "我在走廊里开始太快地走来走去。"


translate chinese day_2_5ed81b15:


    "熔岩沸腾在地板之间的缝隙里。"


translate chinese day_2_ce3dfe22:


    "我必须小心点儿走。我一定要活下来。"


translate chinese day_2_2a3421c5:


    "我在地板上跳着，仿佛我是一个蛤蟆或者怕狼的小兔子。"


translate chinese day_2_5789e4c7:


    "我进了厨房，做了一个三明治，勉强把它吃了，用一杯冷茶送服下去。"


translate chinese day_2_833afc9f:


    "我胃口不好，仿佛我快要被处死的。"


translate chinese day_2_eaaa15da:


    "我突然发现，右脚同时踩上了两块地板。"


translate chinese day_2_f3781d62:


    "我输了。"


translate chinese day_2_d976edc9:


    "我改变了自己的位置。"


translate chinese day_2_513d8bfb:


    "受欺凌的恐惧仿佛是一团恶心的蛇一样蠕动在我的肚子里。"


translate chinese day_2_d68b2d95:


    "钟表指针又转动了一下。"


translate chinese day_2_93b4a5b7:


    "该走了……"


translate chinese day_2_fe359838:


    "冬天早晨天总是很黑。"


translate chinese day_2_2f0a6aab:


    "房子里的黑暗也不会彻底地消散。"


translate chinese day_2_4f13e332:


    "我系鞋带系得很久，扣上了羽绒服的所有的钮扣，这都是为了在家多待一会儿，为了尽可能晚地进入阴暗和危险的未知中。"


translate chinese day_2_d6da1875:


    "我擦了擦眼镜求好运，不过这个厚玻璃连一次都没救我。"


translate chinese day_2_89cef133:


    "天空仿佛是一个巨大的青肿似的。"


translate chinese day_2_cabb99c8:


    "黑色的大云朵在东方膨胀着。"


translate chinese day_2_652ae011:


    "它把所有的星星都舔光了，把红色的曙光都熄了。"


translate chinese day_2_5b2f484a:


    "黑暗粘满了树木。"


translate chinese day_2_fa83fe6a:


    "小鸟在森林里发出胆怯的叫声。"


translate chinese day_2_4367a956:


    "一把长钥匙挂在我脖子上，我用它把门锁上了。"


translate chinese day_2_b69b6d48:


    "父母一直让我这样带着它，因为他们恐怕我这个傻孩子会丢钥匙。"


translate chinese day_2_e3760854:


    "风在篱笆外吹着，叫我进入新的生活，叫我遇见新的危险。"


translate chinese day_2_b5ed99c3:


    "风像一个老朋友一样尾随着我，推着我往前走。"


translate chinese day_2_47909a50:


    "松树的影子把荒地的三分之一都吞没了。"


translate chinese day_2_2e531e60:


    "进森林时，我把鼻子埋进领子里。"


translate chinese day_2_6048fe40:


    "我冷得浑身发抖、瑟缩，但我继续顺着林班线走。"


translate chinese day_2_6759ca3a:


    "高高的大树围住了林间小路。"


translate chinese day_2_cb093434:


    "脚下的雪面发出沙沙声，树枝交错在一起，不让我看星星的微弱光。"


translate chinese day_2_2447d0a5:


    "黑夜不愿意离开这个地方。"


translate chinese day_2_e20515b2:


    "在黑暗中，树木看起来和头发乱蓬蓬的老太婆很像，而且闻起来像坟土一样。"


translate chinese day_2_3b7c736d:


    "树身变成了多张裂开的、有皱折的面孔，而树孔变成了其嘴。"


translate chinese day_2_895d36f7:


    "只要分神一会，长满青苔的巫婆就会抓住我，把我拖到深林中。"


translate chinese day_2_a89d0594:


    "后来父母只得在森林里徘徊，大声叫：“安东！安东！”"


translate chinese day_2_34f65a16:


    "死人不回应活人的呼喊。"


translate chinese day_2_278405ab:


    "还是会回应的吗？"


translate chinese day_2_637ea244:


    "我心里的慌张变大了。"


translate chinese day_2_021cb2a1:


    "我宁愿在父亲的怀里出现在学校里，而不见黑暗像黑色的面团一样从冲沟里发起来。"


translate chinese day_2_76df1dfc:


    "我转身，觉得仿佛有人潜入了灌木丛中。"


translate chinese day_2_9d084f36:


    "我一加快步子，后面的雪就发出了咯吱咯吱声。"


translate chinese day_2_deccaee2:


    "森林用自己的巨大的肺脏呼气着。被风吹倒树木喀嚓响起来了。"


translate chinese day_2_c6dbec35:


    "风和鸟都留在田野里。森林的杂声是我唯一的旅伴。"


translate chinese day_2_c52bd074:


    "我继续走着、听着，越来越确信这里除了我还有一个人。"


translate chinese day_2_ef99108f:


    "他仿佛一直跟着我走，尽力仿效我的步伐。"


translate chinese day_2_7064dff6:


    "我转头转得那么猛，脖子就咯吱咯吱响了。" with hpunch


translate chinese day_2_b142b6f1:


    "我背后的小路在黑暗中消失了。"


translate chinese day_2_15d22a72:


    "树枝在非人工的隧道上交错在一起。"


translate chinese day_2_414518c3:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Esttzdes.ogg"
    Ant "有人吗？"


translate chinese day_2_83f676f2:


    "这个问题一脱口而出，就在那些木头偶像的老松树发出的杂声中溶解了。"


translate chinese day_2_8d41dc73:


    "我怎么决定一个人通过森林去啊！"


translate chinese day_2_8ceebdf2:


    "我大概是疯了，还是……"


translate chinese day_2_ab48e614:


    "还是有谁故意地把我诱出来了。"


translate chinese day_2_02fc9cf0:


    "灯光现出在远方，给了我微弱的希望。"


translate chinese day_2_da33aebd:


    "这应该是农村公路！"


translate chinese day_2_462b9ddb:


    "我飞快地跑起来了，仿佛害怕这条小路会合拢起来，而一只大爪子会抓住我的肩膀，使我转过来，让我面对饿的森林怪物。"


translate chinese day_2_7b40a761:


    "但没有谁抓住我了。"


translate chinese day_2_744d6a54:


    "不相信好运，我简直是飞也似地跑到了一座破旧的桥。"


translate chinese day_2_f9f045c6:


    "像树脂一样深色的冰冷小溪流经桥墩。"


translate chinese day_2_a94b76ba:


    "我弯下腰，把手撑在膝盖上，看了看森林。"


translate chinese day_2_c7e68fd9:


    "然后我使呼吸均匀了。"


translate chinese day_2_e0a1fe4a:


    "森林装作自己睡着了。装作自己平和的。装作自己不是活的。"


translate chinese day_2_a4a7877b:


    "剩下的路沿着被雪覆盖的、稀有灯火的公路而过。"


translate chinese day_2_a1575e0e:


    "我把消极思想都打消了，尽快从一个被照亮的地方跑到另一个去，相信电灯能保护我的。"


translate chinese day_2_27e47e55:


    "仿佛这就是一种{u}儿童游戏{/u}，只要说出：“我在小房子里！”就赢了。"


translate chinese day_2_e7d4f413:


    "不过现在的这些小房子不结实，并且外面的黑暗越来越近。"


translate chinese day_2_62ecf647:


    "我突然发现了一个非常奇怪的东西。"


translate chinese day_2_19c9d821:


    "在灯光照不到的一个地方里有个蓬松的、驼背的影子。它突然活起来便开始低声咆哮着。"


translate chinese day_2_aae0cfae:


    "这个影子好像排斥灯光，它那个不自然的姿势让我害怕。"


translate chinese day_2_27f79253:


    "我瞪了眼睛，为了消除错觉快速地眨了一下眼。"


translate chinese day_2_88fa731e:


    "但这个影子没有消失，它反而更近了一步。"


translate chinese day_2_04d424cb:


    "恐惧让我肚子疼。我后退走，几乎摔倒雪堆里。"


translate chinese day_2_70f84ab6:


    "这个影子突然挺直身子，用温柔的声音问道："


translate chinese day_2_ef7a8781:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/01 Chego krad.ogg"
    Noname "你干嘛偷偷的走啊？希望偷我的灵魂吗？"


translate chinese day_2_ac1f1abe:


    "我惊讶得连一句话也说不出来。"


translate chinese day_2_2ec69fac:


    "是谁在说话呀？这种温柔的声音怎么会在森林和安静的村子之间发出的？"


translate chinese day_2_42a13568:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/02 Chego molch.ogg"
    Noname "傻孩子，你怎么不说话呀？"


translate chinese day_2_d81fb3bf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/03 Yazik.ogg"
    Noname "没有舌头吧？"


translate chinese day_2_13dc5602:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/04 Slushai.ogg"
    Noname "要不我咬掉你的鼻子啊？"


translate chinese day_2_aed2a0e3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/05 Budesh.ogg"
    Noname "让你知道，不是你的事，不要管！"


translate chinese day_2_f245ab3c:


    "声音和身材好像是一个女孩子的。"


translate chinese day_2_93c7905f:


    "我一想到“我真傻！那是一个女生啊！”，就发现了她的嘴巴张开，其里面的牙齿闪耀得很危险。"


translate chinese day_2_7012ee07:


    "我发呆了。"


translate chinese day_2_1bef4fc8:


    "从兜帽里盯着我的是恐吓的狐狸脸。"


translate chinese day_2_bdb15fe0:


    "但她的嘴巴和眼睛都呆板。"


translate chinese day_2_6c555dc0:


    "那是一副面具！"


translate chinese day_2_418d00da:


    "这是一个平凡的女孩子！她只是戴上了狐狸面具。"


translate chinese day_2_50fff986:


    "我至少希望是这样的。"


translate chinese day_2_b6d8144f:


    "我被吓了一跳后，脸上露出了局促不安的微笑。"


translate chinese day_2_fd776f95:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/01 A ya.ogg"
    Ant "我……"


translate chinese day_2_463e191f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/01.2 Prosto v shkolu.ogg"
    Ant "我只是去上学……见了你，就……"


translate chinese day_2_e838113a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/06 Chto ya.ogg"
    Fox "就什么？"


translate chinese day_2_7705fd7c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/07 Nikogda ne videl.ogg"
    Fox "从来没见过狐狸喂狗吗？"


translate chinese day_2_03a594fb:


    "狐狸女孩的脚下真的有一条小狗转来转去。这条狗好像是昨天追赶我的一群狗之一的。"


translate chinese day_2_ebbe58f7:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/002. Izvinite.ogg"
    Ant "不好意思，我不是故意地打扰了你……"


translate chinese day_2_a29f0b35:


    "小狗一听我说话，就叫了一声、贴双耳、闻来闻去，它的尾巴摇起来。"


translate chinese day_2_ccd112dd:


    "也许我身上还有一股香肠味，因为我早上吃了香肠。"


translate chinese day_2_9c3e25e8:


    "我看了小狗，看了女孩子。我已经不怕她，只是觉得她很奇怪。"


translate chinese day_2_4846dd9d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/08 Znachit.ogg"
    Fox "原来是这样……那好……"


translate chinese day_2_f0fd4629:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/09 Kak tebya zovut.ogg"
    Fox "你叫什么名字？"


translate chinese day_2_1ed3beb0:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/03 Menya Anton.ogg"
    Ant "我是安东……"


translate chinese day_2_92af4567:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/03.2 A tebya.ogg"
    Ant "你呢？"


translate chinese day_2_db917fdb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/10 A menya net.ogg"
    Fox "我不是安东！"


translate chinese day_2_771fae6b:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/11 A menya net.ogg"
    Fox "哈哈哈！"


translate chinese day_2_d59fc924:


    "她可真奇怪。可能大脑里有点不正常。"


translate chinese day_2_0adbab9b:


    "不过她的声音很好听。"


translate chinese day_2_b3ccfe7f:


    "惊慌变成了喜悦：这个女孩虽然很奇怪，可是她当然是人类的。"


translate chinese day_2_a6e32563:


    "还有我对自己有点儿不满意。"


translate chinese day_2_a98754a5:


    "这个狐狸女孩不怕在黑暗中徘徊，而我一听轻轻的任何声音就开始浑身发抖。"


translate chinese day_2_9be9a247:


    "我可以继续走，但是这女孩让我好奇。"


translate chinese day_2_a10de9a6:


    "如果下次警官问我有没有交新的朋友，我将回答：“对啊，我和会说话的狐狸交朋友了！"


translate chinese day_2_5e3c78a4:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/04 Ti zdes.ogg"
    Ant "你住在哪里？"


translate chinese day_2_2bb56445:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/04.2 V poselke.ogg"
    Ant "在这个村子里？"


translate chinese day_2_21739059:


    "狐狸哼笑了一声。"


translate chinese day_2_5b845613:


    "她猛地转身，她皮大衣的下摆旋转得看起来像圆顶一样。"


translate chinese day_2_d6303652:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/12 Net glupiy.ogg"
    Fox "不是啊，傻瓜。"


translate chinese day_2_b9334905:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/13 Foxes ne.ogg"
    Fox "狐狸怎么会住在村子里呢？"


translate chinese day_2_0249eda9:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/005. Hochesh.ogg"
    Ant "你的意思是你住在森林里吗？"


translate chinese day_2_4b4dd17a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/14 Iz kakoy.ogg"
    Fox "你怎么这么不懂事？"


translate chinese day_2_4aa617ac:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/15 Konechno lisam.ogg"
    Fox "在人中狐狸当然活不下去。"


translate chinese day_2_2ce37276:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/16 Poka oni.ogg"
    Fox "只要如果它们是真正的狐狸，就这样。"


translate chinese day_2_3de4d675:


    "她的笑话很奇怪。"


translate chinese day_2_aaeb6e63:


    "她的面具也很奇怪……这是一幅混凝纸面具，面上还有毛。"


translate chinese day_2_1ea41c14:


    "小狗用吠声刷存在感。"


translate chinese day_2_23e73012:


    "我打开了书包。"


translate chinese day_2_fadf3a54:


    "有时父亲把好吃的东西偷偷地放在我的书包里，那主要是饼干、苹果或者我最爱吃的蟹棒。"


translate chinese day_2_ea2ed902:


    "他经常会说：“这个是{u}森林里的小兔子{/u}送给你的。”"


translate chinese day_2_c3248724:


    "狗狗迈着碎步向我过来，舔了舔嘴唇。"


translate chinese day_2_a1a90eca:


    "狐狸显然已经给了它好吃的东西，不过看来这条狗还没吃饱。"


translate chinese day_2_5a0fd2b2:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/06 Zachem ti tak.ogg"
    Ant "你今天为什么穿得这么奇怪？"


translate chinese day_2_18e07141:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/06.2 Na utrennik.ogg"
    Ant "你要上早场戏吧？"


translate chinese day_2_ab9f552a:


    "女孩子抖抖身子，银白色的雪花从她鼻子上都掉了。"


translate chinese day_2_fed51f3e:


    "她仿佛摆脱了人形……"


translate chinese day_2_d70b00c9:


    "……变成了一只真实的野兽。"


translate chinese day_2_ffae7724:


    "变成了一只狡猾的、敏捷的、危险的狐狸。"


translate chinese day_2_bd3a17f2:


    "我只要分神一会，就死定了。她就会杀我、吃我，连骨头都不剩。"


translate chinese day_2_05141ac1:


    "我发呆了，仿佛被催眠的。"


translate chinese day_2_de3ddf3e:


    "然后我听到了她的被兽形伪装的好听声音。"


translate chinese day_2_375527fb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/17 Videl bi ti.ogg"
    Fox "要是你看一眼自己的面具，宝贝儿……"


translate chinese day_2_26ded833:


    "她……她刚才说什么了？"


translate chinese day_2_72004069:


    "我就害羞得不得了。脸都红了。"


translate chinese day_2_ff1c0352:


    "我曾经跟父亲去过动物园，在那里我见过一只灰色的狐狸，它很瘦，它的绒毛一片片脱落。"


translate chinese day_2_8c15024d:


    "而这个狐狸和童话中的狐狸很像：身体火色，毛茸茸的。"


translate chinese day_2_ceec5ed4:


    "我在书包里摸到了一个东西。"


translate chinese day_2_017dbe0c:


    "那个东西很软也是揉皱的。"


translate chinese day_2_163850a4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/18 Nichego.ogg"
    Fox "没关系。"


translate chinese day_2_b7824629:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/18 Skoro.ogg"
    Fox "真正的猛兽快要醒来。"


translate chinese day_2_459e4854:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/19 Sprosi-ka.ogg"
    Fox "你问它们一个问题吧，就是它们从哪里弄到了人面？"


translate chinese day_2_0fd9ac5a:


    "女孩子的影子在灯光下跳舞着。"


translate chinese day_2_a01ed281:


    "小狗叫了一声，仿佛赞同她说的话。"


translate chinese day_2_90020e5c:


    "我惊讶得把那个东西掉在雪堆里，来不及看出来那个东西到底是什么。"


translate chinese day_2_7e56891e:


    "冷风就吹了，把脚下的雪地用新雪覆盖了。"


translate chinese day_2_5dd21eea:


    "小狗可能以为那个东西就是食物，所以它开始刨土。"


translate chinese day_2_e3805f0c:


    "狐狸只轻蔑地哼了一声。"


translate chinese day_2_2d67a11b:


    "我吓得魂不附体。"


translate chinese day_2_8be6448b:


    "在灯光下的地方外天还没亮了，反而好像越来越黑。"


translate chinese day_2_d9ff757e:


    "旁边的房子在黑暗中都沉睡不醒。 "


translate chinese day_2_f7cef71c:


    "我试图继续和好奇怪的女孩聊天。"


translate chinese day_2_67611dd3:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/008. Tak ti v shkolu.ogg"
    Ant "你在上学吗？"


translate chinese day_2_ef92ec33:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/20 Oh nu kakoi.ogg"
    Fox "哎呀，真是个傻瓜！"


translate chinese day_2_b8ecc3f1:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/21 Tak nichego.ogg"
    Fox "难道你还不明白吗？"


translate chinese day_2_ddc879a3:


    "这不公平。我只是想和她交朋友，而她就开始欺负我。"


translate chinese day_2_b95eda34:


    "她还叫我傻瓜。"


translate chinese day_2_07a36595:


    "我最好继续走，不理她和她的傻狗。"


translate chinese day_2_03347eae:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/09 A chego ti.ogg"
    Ant "你干嘛骂我？"


translate chinese day_2_8344554c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/09.2 Ne hocshesh.ogg"
    Ant "不想回答就别回答。"


translate chinese day_2_f2badea1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/09.3 Nikto ne.ogg"
    Ant "没有人强迫你回答。"


translate chinese day_2_0ba01b1a:


    "不过我好像被她深深吸引了。"


translate chinese day_2_f9bca01f:


    "她的奥妙面貌和特别有磁性的甜美声音让我好奇。"


translate chinese day_2_8fdb25e6:


    "我激动得不得了。我看了她，仿佛看了火。"


translate chinese day_2_a62daf8e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/22 Da ne duysa.ogg"
    Fox "不要生我的气。"


translate chinese day_2_02bafc71:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/23 Glyadika.ogg"
    Fox "还是看一下吧。"


translate chinese day_2_40dbec55:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/24 Ti nrav.ogg"
    Fox "如利卡喜欢你。"


translate chinese day_2_44dcee7e:


    "小狗继续刨雪刨得非常快，不停地喘着粗气。"


translate chinese day_2_49ecdaaa:


    "狐狸看了看一个木头房子的窗户，其面起了层层薄雾。"


translate chinese day_2_68cc0fc9:


    "她的假鼻子尖端在灯光下亮闪闪的。"


translate chinese day_2_cc504fce:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/25 I ne tolko.ogg"
    Fox "除了如利卡还有一个人喜欢你。"


translate chinese day_2_2f06626e:


    "我脸又红了，仿佛我是一只螯虾似的。"


translate chinese day_2_48585a89:


    "她说自己还是别人？"


translate chinese day_2_41edbcde:


    "我希望在这片昏暗中，她看不出来我的那么害羞的样子。"


translate chinese day_2_2a641530:


    "我清了清嗓子，问了她："


translate chinese day_2_7b35a09d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/11.2 A komu eshe ya.ogg"
    Ant "还有谁喜欢我？"


translate chinese day_2_02f07287:


    "我等着，数着每一次心跳。"


translate chinese day_2_9406eb7f:


    "狐狸什么都没说。"


translate chinese day_2_f18b593d:


    "她调皮的眼神滑过窗户上的冰花。"


translate chinese day_2_82b1da84:


    "仿佛看了一本玻璃书。"


translate chinese day_2_7f6d8276:


    "我想知道，她在一月的霜花图案里都看得出些什么？"


translate chinese day_2_d3a2a92c:


    "小狗停止了刨雪。"


translate chinese day_2_4c9d50d5:


    "它向我走过来了，嘴里叼着一个东西。"


translate chinese day_2_2a3838ef:


    "那就是一只手套。"


translate chinese day_2_42e1d068:


    "难道是我在森里找到的那个？"


translate chinese day_2_848adfc4:


    "它怎么在我的书包里？"


translate chinese day_2_e35e209d:


    "但我仔细一看，就知道了这不过是我的手套。"


translate chinese day_2_04d9bc99:


    "可能当我睡觉的时候，母亲把它放在我的书包里。"


translate chinese day_2_a69df6f9:


    "我突然想起了迷踪的男孩。"


translate chinese day_2_3f91f6cb:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/012. Hey ti zhaesh.ogg"
    Ant "诶，你认识沃瓦吗？"


translate chinese day_2_27af52bc:


    "雪地上跳舞的影子出现在我眼前。"


translate chinese day_2_5715f2c5:


    "沃瓦迷踪的那个夜晚的情景。"


translate chinese day_2_b28a00e8:


    "假如我能找到他，我就会得到奖励，甚至会救我的家。"


translate chinese day_2_a3f70217:


    "我想起了自己的一个生日，父母答应带我和奥利娅去巴黎迪士尼乐园的那个……"


translate chinese day_2_91a4305b:


    "……不过，那天他们没有遵守诺言，他们只是有点羞耻地把一个掌上游戏机递给我了。"


translate chinese day_2_0cedd855:


    "那天我流了很多很多的眼泪，要求他们做到答应的事情。"


translate chinese day_2_48df92dc:


    "那天是爸妈第一次吵架。我任性的要求把他们的关系损害了。"


translate chinese day_2_adf44524:


    "只要能弥补我的错误……只要能带我的家人去迪士尼乐园……"


translate chinese day_2_3996f34c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/013. V noch kogda propal vova.ogg"
    Ant "沃瓦迷踪的那一夜，我的窗外好像有些跳舞着的人影，长得和你很像……"


translate chinese day_2_78bac12b:


    "虽然难以置信，但是她面具的表情真的越来越阴险。"


translate chinese day_2_88bec69a:


    "狐狸仿佛嗅来嗅去似的。"


translate chinese day_2_eea3bb6c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/26 A chto.ogg"
    Fox "那时你害怕极了吧？"


translate chinese day_2_8a7fc286:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/27 Za sebya.ogg"
    Fox "你为自己担心，还是为其他人担心？"


translate chinese day_2_0b22484c:


    "“奥利娅！”我一想到了妹妹会不安全，胸口就疼了，出了一身冷汗。"


translate chinese day_2_5a0f6dae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/28 Nu tak.ogg"
    Fox "那你听我说，安东小朋友。"


translate chinese day_2_eb50549e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/29 Eto.ogg"
    Fox "这个森林很大也很危险。"


translate chinese day_2_91feb1e0:


    "狐狸向前走了一威胁的步。"


translate chinese day_2_74bf2953:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/30 I ya.ogg"
    Fox "我不是这森林的唯一的居民。"


translate chinese day_2_77dd6e5c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/31 Drugie zveri.ogg"
    Fox "其它野兽已经知道你存在。"


translate chinese day_2_f6c39562:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/32 Beregis nas.ogg"
    Fox "当心！今夜我们再来……"


translate chinese day_2_02a7e87f:


    "我慌张起来了，对自己说：“我宁愿不认识这个装孩子的恶鬼。"


translate chinese day_2_66038c2f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/33 Poka ti.ogg"
    Fox "当你和你家人睡觉的时候，我们要悄悄地走近，就开始……"


translate chinese day_2_edd6bc83:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/34 Makarenu.ogg"
    Fox "……跳玛卡雷娜舞！"


translate chinese day_2_808d03fc:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/013. Che.ogg"
    Ant "什……什么？"


translate chinese day_2_c4243d59:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/35 Ei.ogg"
    Fox "嘿！玛卡雷娜！"


translate chinese day_2_694151b0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/36 U tebya pryamo.ogg"
    Fox "哈哈哈！安托沙，你真是目瞪口呆呀！"


translate chinese day_2_0daaba3d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/37 Videl on menya.ogg"
    Fox "你还敢说夜里见了我。胡说八道啊！"


translate chinese day_2_89480e74:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/38 A ti sluachaem.ogg"
    Fox "你是不是笨啊？"


translate chinese day_2_27accf0d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/39 Menya.ogg"
    Fox "我家人不允许我晚上出门。"


translate chinese day_2_f757799e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/40 Zdes.ogg"
    Fox "假如你不知道，我告诉你，这里的孩子很容易迷踪。"


translate chinese day_2_a5741d36:


    "她的笑话真让我为难。我摸了摸眼镜。"


translate chinese day_2_52ae95fd:


    "她吓了我一跳。"


translate chinese day_2_7550cb8e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/41 Oi da ne.ogg"
    Fox "哎呀，你别总摸你的眼镜啊。"


translate chinese day_2_1ed188ae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/42 Ya ranshe.ogg"
    Fox "以前我的视力也不好。"


translate chinese day_2_dc9e5aad:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/43 Poslush.ogg"
    Fox "你听我的话，可能会变得更聪明些。"


translate chinese day_2_f47facae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/44 Lisichku.ogg"
    Fox "狐狸一般用什么词来形容？"


translate chinese day_2_fca7587f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/014. Plutovka.ogg"
    Ant "嗯，狡猾的吧？"


translate chinese day_2_5f0e4894:


    "她突然埋怨说："


translate chinese day_2_f74b00c4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/45 Ah ti.ogg"
    Fox "你啊！你怎么这么对我呀？……"


translate chinese day_2_5d34cc3c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/017. Oi prosti.ogg"
    Ant "对不起。"


translate chinese day_2_d1c9ccfb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/46 Devochka.ogg"
    "女孩子笑了起来，听起来好像是银铃铛的声音。 "


translate chinese day_2_7b3f6a56:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/47 Da shuchu.ogg"
    Fox "我只是在开玩笑！"


translate chinese day_2_4abe5cae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/48 Konecnho.ogg"
    Fox "当然是狡猾的这个词。"


translate chinese day_2_5aed8c82:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/49 Esli ti.ogg"
    Fox "要是你一个敏捷和勇敢的人，而且不怕结交狡猾的狐狸，那我会帮你找到那个沃瓦。"


translate chinese day_2_46859107:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/50 Ti ze.ogg"
    Fox "你想找到他，一定是有原因的吧？"


translate chinese day_2_f451757e:


    "我耸了耸肩表示不知道。她的洞察力真让我警觉起来。 "


translate chinese day_2_67a9e7ee:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/51 I know.ogg"
    Fox "我知道为什么小朋友们都喜欢我们的森林。"


translate chinese day_2_ce9c4edf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/52 Poroi tam.ogg"
    Fox "因为有时在森林里可以找到很多有意思的东西。"


translate chinese day_2_9005d1ed:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/53  Ya vot.ogg"
    Fox "我曾经在那里找到了一大堆糖果，就在这个糖堆里开始游泳，甚至我的嘴唇都粘在一起了。"


translate chinese day_2_dd082064:


    "一大堆糖果？"


translate chinese day_2_09651b1c:


    "从她的语气判断，她信不信自己的话我不太明白。"


translate chinese day_2_54292519:


    "我又笑了，可是我的笑容是虚伪的了。"


translate chinese day_2_fc9e0d01:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/54 Posmotrite ka.ogg"
    Fox "哎呀，你怎么不相信我？"


translate chinese day_2_f51c9b72:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/55 Nu nu.ogg"
    Fox "看看这个吧！"


translate chinese dev_night_meet_fox_429b3c59:


    "她伸出戴着毛皮手套的手。"


translate chinese dev_night_meet_fox_c5f79f26:


    "她的手里放着一把各种各样的糖果。"


translate chinese dev_night_meet_fox_2ab95a6f:


    "在城市里，那些糖果可以买在市场上还是在{u}售货亭{/u}里。"


translate chinese dev_night_meet_fox_94e9c3b9:


    "在好吃的宝物中，我看见了我最爱吃的口香糖。"


translate chinese dev_night_meet_fox_8d7fdfd7:


    "色彩鲜艳的包装上有熟悉的一个词：“Turbo”"


translate chinese dev_night_meet_fox_67f21393:


    "狐狸的三角形头向我点了点。"


translate chinese dev_night_meet_fox_3fb80b79:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/56 Ugosh.ogg"
    Fox "来吧，随便吃。"


translate chinese dev_night_meet_fox_80269fcf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/56 Y menya ih.ogg"
    Fox "我有一口袋糖果。"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_3b2e79a0:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/018. Net spasibo.ogg"
    Ant "谢谢，不用了。我……"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_97c28925:


    "我不想粗鲁地对待她，因为她是我在这个陌生地方唯一的认识的人，不过拿这个奇怪女孩子的口香糖我也不想。"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_89aa6e80:


    "要是这些糖果她真的在雪堆里找到了，那会怎么样呢？"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_c3a69e7e:


    "说不定这些糖果都是假的。只要把包装纸撕下来，这“糖果”可能就会爆炸！"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_8b2a295c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/019. U menya na sladkoe.ogg"
    Ant "我对糖分过敏。"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_e3f94d82:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/57 Aller.ogg"
    Fox "过……过什么？"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_d5028089:


    "她看上去困惑不解。"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_9652b2f8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/57 Ti chego.ogg"
    Fox "那你住在药片世界里，对吧？"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_494f723b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/020.NuvcelomDa.ogg"
    Ant "说实话……你说得对。"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_ed1add6c:


    "狐狸打了个呼哨。"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_ade76418:


    "她掌上的糖果突然都消失了，她的手就开始在空中漂浮，她深思地把大雪花抓在手里。"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_76da18ac:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/59 I noviy god.ogg"
    Fox "还有，你们真的十二个月内只有一次过新年吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_252610cc:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/60 I est eti.ogg"
    Fox "还有那个……"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_e1812883:


    "她打了一下响指，试图想起。"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_ff16d7ca:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/61 Mondays.ogg"
    Fox "还有星期一吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_b2c74ac4:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/21.1Aga.ogg"
    Ant "对啊。"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_2f93a5a8:


    "我笑了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_17b98afa:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/62 Uu kak.ogg"
    Fox "哎呀，无聊透了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cancel1_37d4627c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/63 Vam bi.ogg"
    Fox "小伙子，我建议你吃一公斤巧克力，解除愁闷，摆脱无聊。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_34a66b32:


    "我拿了美味的东西，就感觉到了女孩子的气味，这气味包括毛味、烟火味、柑桔味……还有喜庆味。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_5492ee48:


    "我小心地把包装纸撕下来，指头有点刺痛。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_2430d9b4:


    "我闻到了桃子味。还有另一个不太熟悉的可是很好的味道。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_d2c75814:


    "我把水果口香糖放在嘴里。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_565cec3b:


    "然后开始用牙齿咀嚼。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_447258a4:


    "这好像是普通的土耳其的口香糖，只是舌头有点麻木。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_830bcc3c:


    "我看了看里面的{u}糖纸{/u}，就开心极了。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_4485be27:


    "糖纸上有梅赛德斯-奔驰的图像，这样的糖纸是一个珍品，也是每个男孩都想有的。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_3cdb0c74:


    "我的心碰了肋骨。我被这个小纸块吸引住了，不敢相信这一切都是真的。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_4cf01458:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/022. Eto ze.ogg"
    Ant "这……这就是……"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_a191b1e3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/64 Teper ponyal.ogg"
    Fox "森林里都可以找到什么，你现在知道了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_b4875e9a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/65 Tolko na tvoem.ogg"
    Fox "不过，假如我是你的话，我就不敢一个人去那里。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_04be4e51:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/66 Tebe von ot.ogg"
    Fox "你只看了一张口香糖的贴纸，就惊喜不已了。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_5273cb27:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/67 A predst.ogg"
    Fox "要是你找到一箱这样的东西，那你该怎么办呢？"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_cba80086:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/68 Golovu.ogg"
    Fox "你一定会发疯。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_c7b933ef:


    "这些糖果都是特殊的。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_0f8da800:


    "她也是。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_65a7c4bf:


    "她笑了一声，而我把贴纸放在书包里，仿佛把一只蝴蝶放到玻璃瓶里。"


translate chinese bunny2_take1_944a71a2:


    "这个早晨很不一样，和一般星期一的早晨根本不像！"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_60165612:


    "你到底是谁？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_3a3fce99:


    "直接问她没有用，因为她肯定不回答。即使回答，也一定会撒谎。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_8362ccae:


    "我特别想看一眼面具后面的脸。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_f434882e:


    "我越来越确信，躲在面具后的人不是一个小女孩。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_9e04e60a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/70 Mozet Vova.ogg"
    Fox "可能沃瓦也找到了一个糖堆，而且现在在那里玩儿吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_2093f378:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/71 Slushai.ogg"
    Fox "你觉得他会不会决定呆在森林里？……"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_c4af9d85:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/72 Togda navernoe.ogg"
    Fox "如果真的是这样，那他一定很冷，因为丢了一只手套……"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_4ba0c838:


    "风把她说的话吹到阴沉的森林里，仿佛那是篝火的烟。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_dde789ff:


    "背后的树木用自己的树枝骨头来发出嘎吱声。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_1d92fe5b:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/73 Ili s nim.ogg"
    Fox "也许……他路上出了什么事。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_accdaae3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/74 Chto-to scary.ogg"
    Fox "可怕的事……"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_8022bc34:


    "她的声音好像使森林活起来：森林开始像一个好奇的动物一样嗅来嗅去、留神细听。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_77229bac:


    "狐狸也留神细看森林。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_b7a01965:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/024. Dikie zveri.ogg"
    Ant "你的意思是野兽吃掉他的吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_e9a64b80:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/75 Eto po tvoemu.ogg"
    Fox "你觉得这是一件可怕的事吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_7897c010:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/025. Nu ne znay.ogg"
    Ant "我……我不知道。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_cdc8032c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/76 Ne znaet.ogg"
    Fox "你总是说不知道！"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_8efd2f80:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/77 Uz ne s.ogg"
    Fox "我的新朋友是不是一个不及格的学生？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_6a5a76a4:


    "“不及格的”这个词我不太喜欢，而她说的“朋友”还让我开心。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_126a9829:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/026. Ya horoshist.ogg"
    Ant "我的成绩差不多！"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_97eaae3d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/78 Bel da pus.ogg"
    Fox "还过得去，是吧？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_d9ca8a00:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/79 Poidesh so mnoi.ogg"
    Fox "成绩差不多的安东，要不你跟我走吧？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_edd08b87:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/80 Naidesh svoego.ogg"
    Fox "咱们找到那个沃瓦以后，你会直接问他，他在森林里都见到了什么。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_27c6ded4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/81 Ved poka mi vmeste.ogg"
    Fox "当我在你的身边，森林的居民都不会伤害你。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_52e73d60:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/82 Vot uvidish.ogg"
    Fox "我保证。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_93cfe323:


    "我浑身紧张起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_056a93c5:


    "内在的声音说：{i}“赶快走吧。”{/i}"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_ab629183:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/027. Ya tebe ne veryu.ogg"
    Ant "我不相信你。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_d38dea26:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/83 Ti dumaesh.ogg"
    Fox "你以为我是一个骗子吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_f868cbf8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/84 Da i poz.ogg"
    Fox "不足为奇！没有人相信我……"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_22ad9e93:


    "她听起来生气了。真的假的，我无法理解。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_e2dafc70:


    "狐狸扭过脸去，仿佛她对我不感兴趣了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_03df2dbb:


    "口香糖的味道变苦了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_bf099adb:


    "我想起了父亲常说的一句话：“儿子，你把你的礼貌丢到哪儿去了？”"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_6ca3efd7:


    "其实，她对我还好。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_b148834c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/28 Ne obiz.ogg"
    Ant "对不起，请别生我的气。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_d28911a6:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/28.2 Lisi bivaut.ogg"
    Ant "有的狐狸是善良的……"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_d7d086da:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/29 Nu kak v skazkah.ogg"
    Ant "就像儿童神话里的一样。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_da812178:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/29.2 Mne bi tolko.ogg"
    Ant "我只要理解，你是哪种的狐狸。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_f4ca043d:


    "女孩子双手蒙住了面具的鼻子，悦耳地哈哈一笑了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_7441e1a8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/95 Togda.ogg"
    Fox "那你跟我一起去森林吧，就有理解我的机会。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_6ab1d9bb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/96 No ne.ogg"
    Fox "但不是现在，晚一点再见吧，现在天还没亮，你全身都在颤抖。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_7e6db105:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/97 Togo i glyadi.ogg"
    Fox "你看起来快要吓死了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_aaa84190:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/98 Aida.ogg"
    Fox "我送你到学校去。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_c585db5b:


    "小狗一听她说的最后一句，就把手套从嘴里丢了，赞同地叫了一声。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_2eb44ccb:


    "我弯下腰来捡几乎没逃跑的手套。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_587ccbe2:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/030. Nu esli tebe po puti.ogg"
    Ant "好，要是咱俩同路，一块儿走吧……"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_224c192e:


    "我们迎着迷失的朝霞向学校走去。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_885a5fee:


    "每个窗户都透出了灯光，仿佛住在那些房子的人向我们发出无人知道的信号。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_81166c76:


    "窗帘后多人影儿闪现，院子不时传来看门狗吠。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_463e6304:


    "烟囱冒出袅袅的烟，厨房的电视机在不断地嘟哝着，餐具发出叮当声。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_99f44390:


    "我们小心地走在被雪覆盖的车辙上，目睹村子不乐意地醒来。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_d66efb50:


    "我走在左边，她走在右边，而狗跟着我们走。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_e8d220a1:


    "我等待狐狸会继续奇怪地聊，可是她一路上没说话，仿佛那是一场游戏，规则只有她知道。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_a0132a05:


    "雪花落在如利卡的胡子上，它就可爱地打喷嚏，狡猾的狐狸才笑了一声。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_b39fd445:


    "我当第一个打破沉寂的。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_d6914285:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/031. Tak kak tebya.ogg"
    Ant "那你叫什么名字呢？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_002a4078:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/100 Nu konechno.ogg"
    Fox "都是老一套。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_558f1adf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/101 Imena.ogg"
    Fox "名字，名字，都是名字啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_76672992:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/102 Ludyam.ogg"
    Fox "人们一定要给某事物贴上一种标签。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_0edf40a5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/103 Nu i kak bi.ogg"
    Fox "那你给我这样的狐狸会起个什么名子？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_fc1b8378:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/32 Daze ne znay.ogg"
    Ant "我不知道……"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_8fbf60bf:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/32.2 No ya chital.ogg"
    Ant "我读过一个关于阿狸萨狐狸的故事……”"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_99ecacc5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/104 A chto.ogg"
    Fox "好啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_11ccd93d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/105 Ya ne.ogg"
    Fox "我不介意。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_3d8cadc5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/106 Pust budet.ogg"
    Alis "阿狸萨就可以了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_614e6e75:


    "我不知道她是不是在开玩笑。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_f4f43e97:


    "我回过头去，向后望，仿佛希望狗狗或者黑暗的天空会给我一点线索。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_a2237f2c:


    "我说不出来的问题没有人回答。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_2e961d03:


    "学校已经可以看到的。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_95aaf467:


    "这不过是一个砖的大箱子，陷在无尽黑夜中。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_fccf13fc:


    "从学校窗户透出的灯光对我来说不是一个好兆头。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_222666fd:


    "一排树木像卫兵一样看守学校。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_181a77db:


    "喊叫、儿童笑声、哨声都打破了沉寂。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_ef50a5ef:


    "搬到这个村子以后，我已经跟母亲去过这里，那时学校显得比较舒适：走廊空着，还有擦光剂味，而且外面都是松雪……"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_7c51940e:


    "第二次我一个人去过，借了一些课本，试图想象几个情景: 与我同龄的学生坐着滑楼梯扶手、小学生向学校图书馆跑去、老师在走廊里趾高气扬地走来走去。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_ee5e82d3:


    "不过现在穿运动裤的高中生在校门口抽烟，他们的帽子滑到他们的后脑勺上去了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_7536f11f:


    "高中生的样子消除我对舒适学校的看法。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_0f5bd0ee:


    "他们恶毒的眼神、因吸烟而变黄的牙齿、恐怖的笑容都令我心情沮丧，就像寒冷灰暗的早晨一样。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_95048b38:


    "沉浸在自己的心思中，我差点儿忘记了同路人。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_a89bf231:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/107 Posle.ogg"
    Alis "下课后我在后院等你。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_b5ef17ac:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/108 Vozle.ogg"
    Alis "就在吊死者旁边。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_d568a13d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/033. Vozle kogo.ogg"
    Ant "什么？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_93a786a5:


    "她没有回答。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_e7f8449d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/109 Ne opazd.ogg"
    Alis "不要迟到。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_e6ba0b58:


    "我犹豫了一下。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_5c2a4301:


    "我难以选择的时候，母亲经常说“左右为难”。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_81776c54:


    "我一想到母亲，就知道了要说什么："


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_8b1569eb:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/034. Ya posle shkoli.ogg"
    Ant "下课后我该回家了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_33d65fc8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/110 Eh.ogg"
    Alis "安托沙安托沙，我是放你走的。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_b05ba69a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/111 Drugie ze.ogg"
    Alis "只有我这样，其他的呢，他们带着假笑会悄悄地走近你，然后紧紧地把你抓住不放。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_9a81bfca:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/112 Popomni.ogg"
    Alis "记住我的话吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_dad2209d:


    "狐狸张大了嘴巴，打了个哈欠。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_2756e5f7:


    "这是怎么一回事？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_ee0b4763:


    "在学校附近玩耍很多学生，其中一个大叫了我名字。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_f06d8671:


    "我一听到了，就转过头来 。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_2bf8a4a8:


    "一个雪球几乎擦着我的肩膀飞过，击中如利卡。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_77c6cfb1:


    "它就发出呜呜声，飞快地向小溪跑去了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_111157cd:


    "它在黑暗中消失了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_1b7dabba:


    "狐狸也不见了。她可能在冷空气中溶解了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_9abeaa76:


    "还是她躲在我的影子里吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_71e470a7:


    "我咽下了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_26093803:


    "把口香糖咽下了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_82a498ad:


    "糟了。"


translate chinese bunny2_cont1_5d487545:


    "我深深地吸了口气，走近学校的门口，看到了雪地上反射的灯光，闻到了肉圆面包的气味。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_gopniks_8e4ee35a:


    "群吵闹着的高中生。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_gopniks_c88b3af6:


    "一群吵闹着的高中生。不要让他们看到我。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_dog_bf4c135f:


    "黑色的伏尔加汽车。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_dog_f048a38e:


    "一辆新的伏尔加停在不远的地方，它的一个前轮正在结冰的马路牙子上。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_dog_6139d581:


    "它跟烟炱一样黑。它仿佛直接从父亲风雪之中喜欢讲的可怕的故事里出来的。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_dog_5d70a0d4:


    "我还记得，父亲提到那辆绑架小孩子的黑色的汽车时，苦笑了一下。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_dog_d6e9e5ae:


    "父亲说："


translate chinese bunny_school_night_dog_45ef1328:


    "\"它里面似乎是个柩车，还有白色的布帘。\""


translate chinese bunny_school_night_dog_90e42ab2:


    "\"车号是三个子：苏童死。知道是什么意思？苏联儿童死亡。\""


translate chinese bunny_school_night_dog_d408c533:


    "实在好笑，我也是在苏联出生的。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_witness_6c52b6a5:


    "一个高个子男人在那里抽烟，烟就飘散在风中。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_witness_f8cdae21:


    "他看起来不是一个老师。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_witness_8a1b1ebc:


    "除非他是个体育老师？"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_witness_02ac147c:


    "我偷偷地看了看他的兔唇和仿佛由一块花岗岩雕成的脸。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_witness_49d3ffd1:


    "男人拿着一条钥匙链仔细看了我们。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_witness_bcfeb3d4:


    "他深陷的眼睛里燃烧着火焰。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_witness_8ca60f6e:


    "我低头向下看。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_witness_32a666ca:


    "这个无赖就把视线从我身上懒洋洋地移开，盯着马路看。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_nest_e0a5e08d:


    "乌鸦巢。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_nest_aea897a3:


    "好奇，这是什么鸟的巢？"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_nest_63acb064:


    "说不定是窃鹊的吧？"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_nest_733c3ea6:


    "如果是的话，那它里面一定有很多闪亮闪亮的东西。"


translate chinese bunny_school_night_nest_30dc6a7e:


    "比如彩色的玻璃块、塑料瓶塞、抛光的硬币……或者儿童牙箍。"


translate chinese total_test_8f7d9d7f:


    "教室里面传来了别人谈话的声音。灯光忽隐忽现。"


translate chinese total_test_8c57e863:


    "窗外弥漫着黑暗，仿佛学校是一个在太空中迷失的星际飞船。"


translate chinese total_test_977fcae1:


    "我上了二楼，看见很多人站在课表前。"


translate chinese total_test_2204d5cc:


    "他们都在纷纷议论什么事。"


translate chinese total_test_3fece921:


    "我走近了，透过背包的墙中看得出了引起这种强烈兴趣的原因。"


translate chinese total_test_8df279be:


    "一张打印出来的告示贴在课表的左边。"


translate chinese total_test_d52d886a:


    "“悬常通告！孩子迷踪。”"


translate chinese total_test_573c005f:


    "沃瓦·马秋金。这就是他的名字。"


translate chinese total_test_3545f9f1:


    "小学四年级。"


translate chinese total_test_d5fd301f:


    "在复印出来的模糊的照片上，沃瓦看起来是一个黑嘴黑眼的死人。"


translate chinese total_test_9c6325ec:


    "也许是森林的黑暗透入了他的皮肤并弄伤了他的脸吗？"


translate chinese total_test_0b9abaf8:


    "玩具枪不能保护他免受树枝的耳语和冷风嗥叫。"


translate chinese total_test_6d583564:


    "迷踪孩子的眼睛凝视着我，仿佛乞求什么。"


translate chinese total_test_51c4fbba:


    "我受不了了这个眼神，转过来，走到窗口，坐在窗台上了。"


translate chinese total_test_2f7c69df:


    "越来越多的孩子进来，他们组建几个小组。"


translate chinese total_test_335938d4:


    "没有人注意到我。"


translate chinese total_test_fdeca0db:


    "站在低光照的洗手间旁边的孩子都在唱一首歌。"


translate chinese total_test_87b63541:



    voice "voice/Child/2day/Child_01.ogg"
    Childs "为了狐狸，为了熊，\n小兔子带来肉！"


translate chinese total_test_a53b4ad7:


    "我把头转向声音的方向，看了孩子们一眼，突然听到了高跟鞋着地声。"


translate chinese total_test_978b3ec6:


    "一个老师庄严地走过走廊，骄傲地抬起自己的下巴。"


translate chinese total_test_41c76830:


    "她的鞋子踩在地板砖上发出的声音像蹄声一样。"


translate chinese total_test_1cc27419:


    "一个走在她身边的女孩子模仿老师的步伐。"


translate chinese total_test_da48a8e9:


    "这个女孩子看上去很高傲。她停下来，附耳跟一个女同学说了些什么。"


translate chinese total_test_05d12286:


    "她可能是个班长，因为老师把教室日志递给她了。"


translate chinese total_test_eb0257f7:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/01 Ekaterina.ogg"
    Teacher "叶卡捷琳娜，拿着吧。"


translate chinese total_test_daa3b393:


    "老师开了教室门，一群吵闹的孩子们就开始进入教室里。"


translate chinese total_test_0177291a:


    "群中我看见了一个高个子的胖子，他的头发红色，脸上长满粉刺，我一看到了他的脸就不知不觉地想到了石榴。"


translate chinese total_test_c928b946:


    "一种不好的感觉使我后颈头发颤动。"


translate chinese total_test_2131fce7:


    "我曾经见过这样的人们，他们的眼睛总是鬼鬼祟祟的、笑声总是难听的。"


translate chinese total_test_ecdbdb66:


    "长得和老师一模一样的女孩子用手势制止了胖子便安静地进了教室里。"


translate chinese total_test_2fd6fefc:


    "一个男孩在门口前犹豫了一下，红头发的那个就把他推进了教室里。"


translate chinese total_test_425cf901:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/01 Topa.ogg"
    Noname "快一点，你这个笨蛋！"


translate chinese total_test_5a53ca0f:


    "男孩几乎摔到了，为了保持平衡他把两手挥来挥去。"


translate chinese total_test_2e7a2e4a:


    "胖子哈哈大笑起来了，他的几个朋友也挖苦地笑了。"


translate chinese total_test_3a469f16:


    "他们的笑声仿佛是剪刀咔嚓声，那是太吓人的大剪刀"


translate chinese total_test_69c189cf:


    "教室把所有的孩子都吸入了。走廊里空了。"


translate chinese total_test_00da5ea2:


    "我很想长入窗台里。"


translate chinese total_test_6ed3f277:


    "窗外的几个路灯与黑暗打斗，仿佛是几条发光鱼在海底里游动。"


translate chinese total_test_a04ece92:


    "要是我跑怎么样？"


translate chinese total_test_04a90d9d:


    "要是我出去，在黑暗中消失呢？"


translate chinese total_test_d532a38f:


    "我想象出自己在雪地上跑，鞋踩在雪上发出咯吱咯吱声，而我越来越轻。"


translate chinese total_test_cabbccc0:


    "上课铃声响起了，打破了这个幻象。"


translate chinese total_test_595543b6:


    "我不乐意地从窗台上下来了。"


translate chinese total_test_99b5895f:


    "为了让自己安静下来，我深深地吸了口气，然后进了教室里。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_20abb2c8:


    "骄傲的老师从她的眼镜后面冷冷地白了我一眼。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_21f5e34e:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/37 Ya novenkiy.ogg"
    Ant "我……我是新来的。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_4d094841:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/37.2 Mne vot skazali.ogg"
    Ant "我被告知要先去找您。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_6a422ec3:


    "被雪覆盖的林间小路出现在我眼前。松树枝发出的沙沙声是安乐的，并不是吓人的。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_f3fe97e5:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/02 Hm.ogg"
    Teacher "嗯……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_905c25bb:


    "她开始翻教室日志页。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_1be496a8:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/03 A fam.ogg"
    Teacher "那你姓什么呢？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_44e02a14:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/038. P-petrov.ogg"
    Ant "彼得罗夫……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_4588e27b:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/04 Gromche.ogg"
    Teacher "大声点儿！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_d4e69f0a:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/05 Chego.ogg"
    Teacher "别含含糊糊的！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_3e8850d8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/039. Petrov.ogg"
    Ant "我姓彼得罗夫！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_d5a4e171:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/06 Net.ogg"
    Teacher "嗯，没有这个人。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_ca38f934:


    "她严厉地看着我，仿佛以为我是个骗子。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_5b0c65f4:


    "我很想钻入地里去。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_98d2c2e2:


    "左边的模糊影子盯着我。教室里所有的人仿佛是一只危险的野兽呼吸着。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_588a34e4:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/08 Ty ne.ogg"
    Teacher "你确定吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_c9172a76:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/09 Net takogo.ogg"
    Teacher "列表里没有你的姓名。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_4f03fad1:


    "我的膝盖发抖了，我感到了头晕。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_46af784e:


    "我握紧了拳头，关节皮肤就发白。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_86aac762:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/040. Mne skazali 204.ogg"
    Ant "我被告知：204教室，班主任莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜，6B班。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_0f4d8e16:


    "同学们好像以为我在开玩笑，就哈哈大笑起来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_01d96308:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/10 Chto za.ogg"
    Teacher "怎么回事？！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_3a621d46:


    "他们就停止吵闹了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_b5125474:


    "好像打算后来利用好时机再笑。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_a94dc9b7:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/11 Ponaberut.ogg"
    Teacher "这都是因为那些新来的年轻人员们！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_a85f7b92:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/12 Tolko.ogg"
    Teacher "她们除了化妆什么都不会做！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_4cdcfaa4:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/13 A bumagi.ogg"
    Teacher "而她们的任务谁该做呢？难道是我吗？也不是第一次了！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_37512f7b:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/14 Podozdi.ogg"
    Teacher "等一下。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_b5e1fae1:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/15 Seychas.ogg"
    Teacher "我去把她们训斥一顿！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_1d596fb0:


    "老师愤怒地冲了出去。其他的同学都已经坐着，只有我一个人站着。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_f7312241:


    "他们都在嘲笑地看着我，我就不舒服了，仿佛我快要被枪决。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_e61b070d:


    "他们的眼神刺疼了我的脸，像激光束一样在皮肤上滑行。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_1793a86b:


    "我又想象出自己离这个地方跑了很远，跳过松树，不怕冷风。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_8fb0145a:


    "顺风是我唯一的同路伙伴。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_3e90f530:


    "从同学们的眼睛里可以看出来一个问题：“这个新来的我们能接受吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_cfe63c7b:


    "一个人低声说了些什么，教室里就发出了阵阵笑声。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_48830d25:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/03 Dosk.ogg"
    Noname "擦黑板！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_2fc8a06e:


    "同学们中最“幽默的”人是谁，很容易猜到。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_48ace0d8:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/04 Ei.ogg"
    Noname "嘿，小四眼！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_d5ccdfb5:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/05 Ty cz.ogg"
    Noname "你又瞎又聋吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_8c8df63b:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/06 Dosk.ogg"
    Noname "我说，擦黑板！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_738b68c7:


    "那时刻颤动的不是只有膝盖。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_9e7bf20d:


    "我浑身发抖，祈求上帝让老师快点回来。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_b17ebba1:


    "上帝回应了我的祈祷。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_c431201d:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/17 Nu chto.ogg"
    Teacher "这件事我该怎么处理啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_1b081236:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/18 Kuda saj.ogg"
    Teacher "我要让你坐在哪里啊？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_958539b7:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/19 Davai-ka.ogg"
    Teacher "那你坐在谢苗旁边吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_fdd0734e:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/20 On vse.ogg"
    Teacher "这个座位是空着的。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_08f24a18:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/07 Escze.ogg"
    Sem "不行！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_7828fab5:


    "胖子把背包放在空着的椅子上，挠了挠肚子。他脸上现出了一丝奸笑。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_d1577ab3:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/21 Ti opyat.ogg"
    Teacher "你怎么又不听话？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_0114a185:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/22 Snova.ogg"
    Teacher "我又要叫你祖母来一趟学校吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_27854818:


    "其他同学都安静了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_13f34d07:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/09 A cze.ogg"
    Sem "祖母不会骂我的。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_7900e344:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/23 Ne ona.ogg"
    Teacher "她不会，我会！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_459724b8:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/24 Bag.ogg"
    Teacher "你把背包快收起来！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_935dd0b2:


    "谢苗一动也不动。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_ebf7a471:


    "他以无聊的样子开始看挂在墙上的画像。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_166f9191:


    "我得做点什么。我得想出办法来挽救局势。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_7e70797b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/41 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_2840248c:


    "我清了清嗓子，压低了嗓音，以陌生的声音说："


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_a6a43aca:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/42.2 Ya mogu za posl.ogg"
    Ant "我会坐在后排的座位。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_4c50fa35:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/42.3 Tam kazetsa.ogg"
    Ant "好像没有人坐在那里。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_1849e564:


    "老师呼哧一声。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_339e9ac4:


    "她看了我，看了谢苗，又看了我一眼。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_4d0a40b5:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/26 Ladno.ogg"
    Teacher "好。坐在那里吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_d9623b27:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/27 A s toboy.ogg"
    Teacher "而你呢，谢苗·巴布林，听我说，我们还没完呢！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_5f5953f2:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/28 Chtobi.ogg"
    Teacher "下课后找我。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_7211a89f:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/29 Budesh.ogg"
    Teacher "还有，今天你必须打扫教室。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_001c0804:


    "谢苗的脸上露出了扭曲的笑容。他鼻子尖上有几个小脓疱。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_eb86836b:


    "我走到了书桌前，努力让自己不跌倒便不引发另一阵笑声。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_f732acfb:


    "我坐在教室后排的位置上，那张书桌上放着很多老招贴画。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_5268be80:


    "不合群的人座位都有人了，可以开始了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_b08ae83c:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/30 Vot i.ogg"
    Teacher "好啦，我们开始上课吧！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_1d429e67:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/31 Tema.ogg"
    Teacher "我今天说课的题目是：左琴科《不需撒谎》短篇小说中的俄国文学和世界文学的传统。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_47fc7fb6:


    "胖子转过身看了我一眼。他的那个眼神预示了长期的侮辱谩骂。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_9c7aa603:


    "他的水般的淡色眼睛仿佛对我说道：“你逃不掉的”。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_45b3c192:


    "上过几次课后，我发现自己的本子上有一大滴恶心的口水。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_c1bae452:


    "在学校食堂里，谢苗把{u}果汁{/u}泼到我衣服上了，还说了不是故意的。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_dd950d97:


    "在卫生间里，他用力甩手，手上的水就甩到了我的脸上。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_a89adfd3:


    "最后一课前，谢苗突然把我推到了一小群女学生中。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_127ec896:


    "她们又骂起来又走到了一边去，而我失去了平衡，脸朝下摔在班长女孩子的胸上。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_0cf0b377:



    voice "voice/kate/04 KA.ogg"
    Kate "哎哟！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_75713efb:


    "我羞愧地往后一跳了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_93b8f62f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/043. Prosti ti v.ogg"
    Ant "不好意思……你没事吧？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_4fa29942:


    Kate "我……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_14237df4:


    "她忽然把两手叉腰了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_1aca1a47:



    voice "voice/kate/06 KA.ogg"
    Kate "毫不知耻啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_28d02167:



    voice "voice/kate/07 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他还敢在大家面前对我动手动脚！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_f5ce3c05:



    voice "voice/kate/08 KA.ogg"
    Kate "我告诉我妈去！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_e116d69b:



    voice "voice/kate/09 KA.ogg"
    Kate "你这个变态，就被赶出学校了！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_df57f5d7:


    "她的眼睛充满了施虐的快感，仿佛她正在把一根火柴拿近一只不能自卫的金龟子前。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_ac4f308e:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/044. Ya nechayanno.ogg"
    Ant "我不是故意的！我是被推的……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_c66340cd:



    voice "voice/kate/10 KA.ogg"
    Kate "大家都看到了！我们不是瞎子！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_977b7ce1:


    "她盯着我的眼镜看，嘲弄地笑了笑。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_d8b383cf:


    "我怒不可遏，可是谢苗傻笑了起来使我冷静些。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_eb624fc8:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/10 Tolk.ogg"
    Sem "被推的是吧？真的吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_classroom1_75e51d5b:


    "他坚定地走近我，一股葵花子和坏呀的气味呛我的鼻子了，而谢苗忽然把我给撞倒了。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_semen_a1e509c9:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/11 Vot.ogg"
    Sem "就这样推了你吗？那你敢反击吗？"


translate chinese bunny_day2_semen_3f2cc123:


    "他俯身看着我，他的眼神仿佛表达："


translate chinese bunny_day2_semen_5fb007a3:


    "来吧，打我！打我一顿！"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_2cae11ee:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/048. Slushai ti.ogg"
    Ant "我告诉你……"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_036aa548:


    "我嗓子发干，嘴唇不听使唤，我的声音听起来比较尖细。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_334c0df1:


    "谢苗幸灾乐祸地笑了。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_8baaf7c0:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/12 Dava.ogg"
    Sem "来来来，小四眼。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_20da7407:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/13 CZo p.ogg"
    Sem "怎么不说话呀？"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_774aaf5e:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/14 Nam.ogg"
    Sem "我们都很想知道你是什么意思的。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_4f95a321:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/049. Esle eshe hot raz.ogg"
    Ant "你要是再碰我……"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_650a4cdb:


    "谢苗的一根手指上戴着一枚很重的印章戒指，他用那根手指捅了我额头。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_0df377f4:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/15 Nu t.ogg"
    Sem "我碰了，你怎么回答？"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_81aa11d2:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/50.1Eshohotraz.ogg"
    Ant "你要是再……"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_9ed44231:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/16 Tron.ogg"
    Sem "碰了。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_b4d52d12:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/17 A vo.ogg"
    Sem "再来一次吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_534ec0ef:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/18 I escz.ogg"
    Sem "又碰了！"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_b21cff91:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/19 I escz.ogg"
    Sem "又碰了！"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_cd1fd502:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/20 I escz.ogg"
    Sem "又碰了！"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_37aaa9f7:


    "他捅得太狠，把我的头往后推。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_e5108d03:


    "我千万不可哭。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_738c095e:


    "否则我就死定了！"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_1ed733dd:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/21 CZe t.ogg"
    Sem "你这个胆小鬼，还敢骂我吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_1a27b109:


    "我的眼睛里模糊了。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_737035c8:


    "我向前冲去，鞋底离开了地面。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_9069e541:


    "我胡乱地摇了摇拳头。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_c20ea4c3:


    "我眼前的情景又美又怕。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_6892a9c4:


    "谢苗吃惊地睁大了眼睛，抓着被碰伤的耳朵。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_348a606c:


    "难道我是第一个反对他绝对权力的人吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_2a160f10:


    "我最好逃跑，可是他的几个朋友围住了我。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_bc73e961:



    voice "voice/kate/11 KA.ogg"
    Kate "莉季娅·帕夫洛夫娜！"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_27681eb9:



    voice "voice/kate/12 KA.ogg"
    Kate "莉季娅·帕夫洛夫娜，彼得罗夫打了巴布林！"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_1961be53:


    "谢苗的两腮发红，他的小脓疱发白，仿佛那是一群小幼虫似的。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_fc0d7c21:


    "不过只有我发现他的脸上一瞬间内现出了一个奸笑。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_e968ad13:


    "他走近了我身边。一股强烈的龋齿臭味向我袭来。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_191ea168:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/23 Tebe.ogg"
    Sem "我……"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_9eb649ab:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/24 Pizd.ogg"
    Sem "……要杀了你。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_856169be:


    "他说话的声音危险可怕，如烧开的锅似的。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_b48a278a:


    "我以为他又要打我。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_a624da6c:


    "我都在数着自己的心跳，猜想着他下次会打我哪部。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_56050602:


    "太阳丛？下巴？鼻子？"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_729b62ba:


    "而他只是转过身去，就走了。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_defd716c:


    "我脑子里闪过一个清醒冷静的念头："


translate chinese bunny2_semen_fight_ffb84a00:


    "他今天要杀我。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_9611ee70:


    "放学后，我在走廊里短短待了一会儿，以免和其他同学在一起走。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_2f4a059f:


    "今天最后一课谢苗不在，我就有了希望：也许他为了不打扫教室而回家了，忘了我。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_bc34d2e6:


    "我松了一口气，仿佛知道了死刑推迟了一天。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_9ff06f1f:


    "但我不让自己忘记他的语气、想报复的眼神、带电的奸笑。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_2acfe66b:


    "这还好，我可不想在空荡荡的走廊里碰到他。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_ebdf6de6:


    "同学们的蹄铁般的奸笑还在我眼前。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_2d726005:


    "谢苗这样取笑我，使整班的孩子大笑，连当时不在的人都请目睹者把这件事情详详细细地告诉他们。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_3f59d217:


    "畸形人上的学校更适合我，因为我好像只在驼子与跛子中不会吸引过度的关注。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_1c0ded8b:


    "当其他学生笑着出去的时候，我站在窗户前，假装自己忙于整理书包。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_81f5d08b:


    "其实我仔细瞧窗外。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_daf0a700:


    "在学校庭院里和栅栏前我看不到了谢苗。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_5a69387d:


    "我不太相信运气，所以决定多待一会在越来越空的走廊里。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_97e33ae6:


    "二楼变安静了。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_4fabbc14:


    "从走廊里可见实验室里的骷髅模型，某个爱搞笑的人给骷髅戴上了印神鹰的便帽。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_1fe84169:


    "卫生间里面有哗哗的流水声。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_34ac41ac:


    "整个学校里好像只有我一个人。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_42c800a0:


    "我突然想到了：“不是只有我！”。"


translate chinese bunny2_meet_pol_03cb6c63:


    "我想起了迷踪的男孩，他的照片还挂在课表旁边。"


translate chinese test_polina_42c6ff1d:


    "我想到了他的笑容……"


translate chinese test_polina_006de54d:


    "……和他看我的眼神……"


translate chinese test_polina_5f0e7666:


    "……也想到了他最可能已经死了。"


translate chinese test_polina_5b6dc0fa:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/1 Privet.ogg"
    Noname "你好" with vpunch


translate chinese test_polina_e78a7c0b:


    "我哆嗦了一下，转过身来。"


translate chinese test_polina_c8be7c34:


    "首先我看到了黑色的小提琴盒子。"


translate chinese doehal_1_77843044:


    "然后发现，一个女同学拿着它。"


translate chinese doehal_1_6a66d915:


    "上课的时候，她坐在前排，往后看我两三次了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_2ca6bee0:


    "我也偷偷地看了她。"


translate chinese doehal_1_948d3bb9:


    "有时候，看什么漂亮的是很好的，比如看小溪、天空或者一个不喜欢谢苗的笑话女孩。"


translate chinese doehal_1_02e6a478:


    "她也不会与卡佳东拉西扯地闲聊着。"


translate chinese doehal_1_744ef1ba:


    "课间休息时候，她一般和我一样在教室里坐着，瞧窗外或者画在绿色的笔记本上。"


translate chinese doehal_1_ec44091a:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/052. Zdravstvui.ogg"
    Ant "你好！"


translate chinese doehal_1_b6acc600:


    "我脸上泛起了红晕，我装作自己忙着看着地上。"


translate chinese doehal_1_0fb5d652:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/02 Kruto ti emu.ogg"
    Noname "你打了他真棒！"


translate chinese doehal_1_ec630a39:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/053.Eto vishlo slych.ogg"
    Ant "我不是故意的，这是个意外。差不多。"


translate chinese doehal_1_d7c3947a:


    "为了掩盖自己的窘态，我开始把已拿出来的书放在书包里。"


translate chinese doehal_1_fa85fc10:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/40 Ya videka.ogg"
    Noname "我看到巴布林推了你。"


translate chinese doehal_1_1f034e16:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/41 Ti v poryadke.ogg"
    Noname "你没事吧？"


translate chinese doehal_1_082addb0:


    "后脑勺还有一点痛，不过我忍得住。"


translate chinese doehal_1_16f67fe6:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Vporyadke.ogg"
    Ant "我没事。"


translate chinese doehal_1_d452eb08:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Pustyak.ogg"
    Ant "这也不算什么。"


translate chinese doehal_1_460ff58e:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/42 Aga.ogg"
    Noname "怎么可能啊！"


translate chinese doehal_1_76483979:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/43 Etot.ogg"
    Noname "那个笨蛋的脾气越来越坏了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_606adcc2:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/44 Vrezal.ogg"
    Noname "下次你还是应该还手的。"


translate chinese doehal_1_2331f9a0:


    "我什么都没说。"


translate chinese doehal_1_c8e43769:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/03 Vrode semen.ogg"
    Noname "谢苗以前好像不是这个样子的。"


translate chinese doehal_1_2cfbc2bf:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/04 On k nam.ogg"
    Noname "他来这个学校比你早一些。"


translate chinese doehal_1_b5901d25:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/05 Babushka.ogg"
    Noname "他的祖母对我说过，谢苗转到了我们的学校后，就变成了这样。"


translate chinese doehal_1_c0809c35:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/06 Semena daze.ogg"
    Noname "连高中生都怕谢苗！"


translate chinese doehal_1_8ff06ee5:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/07 A ti vot.ogg"
    Noname "只有你敢打了他。"


translate chinese doehal_1_bf535004:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/08 Ne strusil.ogg"
    Noname "真勇敢。"


translate chinese doehal_1_2331f9a0_1:


    "我什么都没说。"


translate chinese doehal_1_ec98f73e:


    "我哪里勇敢！"


translate chinese doehal_1_bcbfd781:


    "我在窗户前已经浪费了半个小时，怕回家的路上会出事。"


translate chinese doehal_1_d7c3947a_1:


    "为了掩盖自己的窘态，我开始把已拿出来的书放在书包里。"


translate chinese doehal_1_77cf359a:


    "这个女孩子用清澈的眼神看着我。"


translate chinese doehal_1_14d6dbdc:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/09 A ti za rekoi.ogg"
    Noname "你住在哪里？"


translate chinese doehal_1_72e23da9:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/10 V tom dome.ogg"
    Noname "在河那边的一座木头房子吧？"


translate chinese doehal_1_85ec85e1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/055. Nu da.ogg"
    Ant "是的……"


translate chinese doehal_1_5a305d38:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/11 Tam navernoe.ogg"
    Noname "住在那里一定很可怕。"


translate chinese doehal_1_2ad71960:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/11 Da esche.ogg"
    Noname "还要常常走过森林……"


translate chinese doehal_1_23a7a60a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/12 Ya bi tak.ogg"
    Noname "我绝对不会这样生活。"


translate chinese doehal_1_8d60e38f:


    "我一听到了“森林“这个词，就畏缩了一下。"


translate chinese doehal_1_5f90f5d7:


    "交织在一起的树枝、蜿蜒的小路、倾斜树林中的无尽黑暗我都想起了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_fa8138ea:


    "接下来说了一个谎："


translate chinese doehal_1_16f0d2d2:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/56 Da ne tak uzh.ogg"
    Ant "其实也没有那么可怕。"


translate chinese doehal_1_427f3bfd:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/56.2 A chto tebya.ogg"
    Ant "你怕什么呢？"


translate chinese doehal_1_62a45ecc:


    "她什么都没说，只是微笑了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_8354c230:


    "隐形的妖魅就消失了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_35e2a47b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/13 Da tak.ogg"
    Noname "没什么……"


translate chinese doehal_1_5003b418:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/14 Menya kstati.ogg"
    Pol "对了，我叫波琳娜。"


translate chinese doehal_1_5d2b690d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/057. A menya Anton.ogg"
    Ant "我叫安东。"


translate chinese doehal_1_d5186d42:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/15 Nu eto ya znayu.ogg"
    Pol "我知道。"


translate chinese doehal_1_a309072a:


    Pol "……"


translate chinese doehal_1_f13fc8b4:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/16 Slushai.ogg"
    Pol "安东，我想问一下……"


translate chinese doehal_1_1ae1c214:


    "波琳娜犹豫了一会儿，看起来不太确定该不该问。"


translate chinese doehal_1_53327191:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/17 A chto ti.ogg"
    Pol "下课后你干什么？"


translate chinese doehal_1_774ec3d5:


    "她的这个问题让我心有种刺痛的感觉，可是这种感觉很好。"


translate chinese doehal_1_aea8a46d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/058. Nichego takogo.ogg"
    Ant "没有什么……"


translate chinese doehal_1_9ce490d6:


    "我停顿了一下。"


translate chinese doehal_1_3d4cf095:


    "阿狸萨面具上的狐媚笑容闪在我眼前。"


translate chinese doehal_1_368f3b93:


    "还有她的嘲笑的眼神，最可能被我臆想出来的。"


translate chinese doehal_1_b68a4c1a:


    "难道那个狐狸女孩正在等我吗？"


translate chinese doehal_1_f36f4914:


    "或者她那时只是在开玩笑吗？"


translate chinese doehal_1_f796dfbf:


    "她的皮大衣里面有没有红色的狐狸尾巴？"


translate chinese doehal_1_e8ceb904:


    "这个思想让我浑身出汗，如我刚刚上完体育课似的。"


translate chinese doehal_1_2f9856e1:


    "我很想冲个澡，仿佛光是想着狐狸女孩让我感觉到自己很肮脏、让我迷路便进入森林的怀抱。"


translate chinese doehal_1_281cd472:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/18 Y meanya seychas.ogg"
    Pol "我还有一节音乐课要上，然后我就有空儿。"


translate chinese doehal_1_738ff75a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/19 Ded mne.ogg"
    Pol "我爷爷请了音乐老师辅导我学习小提琴。"


translate chinese doehal_1_98164afb:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/20 Nash uchitel.ogg"
    Pol "我们学校的音乐老师是个小提琴手……在村子里也只有我想学小提琴的。"


translate chinese doehal_1_7fcde81a:


    "她模仿握弓的姿势，如正在弹小提琴似的。"


translate chinese doehal_1_01da2f8d:


    "我好像听到了音乐。"


translate chinese doehal_1_27248510:


    "把阿狸萨就忘在脑后了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_75ccaaa4:


    "我盯着波琳娜的嘴唇看，全神贯注地听她的每一句话，异样的感觉让我心停止跳动。"


translate chinese doehal_1_787f6563:


    "不过这种感觉挺好的、温暖的。"


translate chinese doehal_1_43f479d6:


    "还有瘙痒的感觉。"


translate chinese doehal_1_143de9e3:


    "我感觉像我很小，而我的感情很大，在胸中发闷。"


translate chinese doehal_1_713bb406:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/21 Tut govoryat.ogg"
    Pol "有人说，我们的村子里有了个凶手。"


translate chinese doehal_1_2bbb6461:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/22 Ranshe.ogg"
    Pol "以前爷爷接我回家，可是最近他身体不好了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_dcf4d5b8:


    "我看了一眼沃瓦的照片。"


translate chinese doehal_1_31d01f39:


    "他的水井似的眼睛察看我，他的嘴唇仿佛被涂成黑色的。"


translate chinese doehal_1_01421e0f:


    "这张照片和墓碑人像也没有什么不同。"


translate chinese doehal_1_9842b712:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/24 Ti ne.ogg"
    Pol "我不是胆子小，我只是……"


translate chinese doehal_1_1771d8a1:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/25 Prosto mne.ogg"
    Pol "我只是觉得，和你在一起安全多了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_3df0c262:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/26 Anton ti.ogg"
    Pol "安东，你能送我回家吗？"


translate chinese doehal_1_ed0f5016:


    "梦想成真了！"


translate chinese doehal_1_e607107a:


    "冒险小说中我最喜欢的内容终于开始进入我的生活……"


translate chinese doehal_1_1dbb5584:


    "神秘的罪行、美丽的女孩、英勇的决斗。"


translate chinese doehal_1_f25a4311:


    "决斗……"


translate chinese doehal_1_2bebbff2:


    "我一想到了谢苗，就回到了现实世界；脚下的地面突然开始摇晃如甲板似的。"


translate chinese doehal_1_0c8584af:


    "我不想在波琳娜的面前摔个嘴啃泥。"


translate chinese doehal_1_24432b60:


    "毕竟，无论我多么勇敢，我们俩都知道：那个大块头我打不过。"


translate chinese doehal_1_ac3de96a:


    "我害怕的不是他打倒我。"


translate chinese doehal_1_7311f11b:


    "我害怕的是波琳娜会看到那情景的。"


translate chinese doehal_1_6eadd510:


    "我害怕的是她会跟着谢苗笑……"


translate chinese doehal_1_4373a861:


    "那可不行，我不能让她亲眼目睹我丢脸。"


translate chinese doehal_1_eaeae510:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/59 Segonya vryad li.ogg"
    Ant "今天我送不了你回家。"


translate chinese doehal_1_c0c1b440:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/59.2 You know.ogg"
    Ant "谢苗大概在庭院里等着我。"


translate chinese doehal_1_8cd54096:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/60. Better mne.ogg"
    Ant "我最好跟他一对一地谈谈。"


translate chinese doehal_1_bb0bbf07:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/27 Gluposti kakie.ogg"
    Pol "胡说。"


translate chinese doehal_1_7a6d859a:


    "波琳娜把头发放一边，我就闻到了轻微的黑莓味。"


translate chinese doehal_1_241347bd:


    "波琳娜如好喝的水似的，无论喝多少，都觉得口渴。"


translate chinese doehal_1_9ba6540f:


    "我还记得 郊外 的夏夜：炊烟缕缕上升，邻居的浆果挂在篱笆上，一层落下的松针如地毯软。"


translate chinese doehal_1_62ffa3d8:


    "那些平静的日子里，我都觉得安全。"


translate chinese doehal_1_d680be66:


    "一个情景还浮现在我眼前：母亲在吊床上休息，父亲把肉用铁钎串。"


translate chinese doehal_1_bcaef86f:


    "要是我有远见，我在篝火噼啪声、父母的笑声、转瞬即逝的七月味中能预见祸事吗？"


translate chinese doehal_1_01793e98:


    "我那时明不明白这世界有多脆弱？"


translate chinese doehal_1_72409e26:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/28 Dumaesh.ogg"
    Pol "你以为那个混子会一对一打架吗？"


translate chinese doehal_1_0f3a0e94:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/29 So svoimi.ogg"
    Pol "他一定会叫他的朋友帮忙，那你麻烦就大了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_b69404b0:


    "波琳娜突然狡黠地笑了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_6f23d1fc:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/30 No esli mi.ogg"
    Pol "不过，要是咱们一起去，就把他们难住了！"


translate chinese doehal_1_8ca7b144:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/31 Ya ze ne tolko.ogg"
    Pol "因为我不仅是这村子里最好的提琴手，我是一个女孩！"


translate chinese doehal_1_3f525a87:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/32 Slishala.ogg"
    Pol "一个认识的流氓对我说过，要是有女孩在他就不去打人。"


translate chinese doehal_1_53d5e758:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/33 Predstavlyaesh.ogg"
    Pol "这就是他们的原则之一！"


translate chinese doehal_1_cc5f8c38:


    "“一个认识的流氓” 这一句话让我紧张。"


translate chinese doehal_1_eba80c9d:


    "他比我好吗？帅吗？"


translate chinese doehal_1_312de3fc:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/34 Oi mne.ogg"
    Pol "哎呀，我该走了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_922e2192:


    "她走了几步就停了下来。"


translate chinese doehal_1_b5f7d4c1:


    "波琳娜和杂志上的美女或者电影中的女演员一点都不像。"


translate chinese doehal_1_3c44a57d:


    "不过，在闪烁的灯光下，她比所有的美女还美。"


translate chinese doehal_1_7853fe0f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/35 A ti.ogg"
    Pol "你会乐器吗？"


translate chinese doehal_1_7cde66ed:


    "两年前父母给我买了一把吉他。"


translate chinese doehal_1_b46d39cf:


    "我就想起了，学吉他的自己有多么可怜。"


translate chinese doehal_1_477b4ec2:


    "Am-Em……《变化，我们都在等待变化》……"


translate chinese doehal_1_678e6540:


    "{u}维克多·崔{/u}的这首歌符合我对任何变化的愿望。"


translate chinese doehal_1_5141b18b:


    "我不知道那个吉他在哪里，它好像不愿意搬到森林中的老房子里。"


translate chinese doehal_1_5182a5f1:


    "也许父母把它送给别人了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_e83ac275:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/61. Uvy ne.ogg"
    Ant "真可惜，我不会。"


translate chinese doehal_1_fa83e76c:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/36 Eh.ogg"
    Pol "算了吧。"


translate chinese doehal_1_41d966d8:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/37 Nu ladno.ogg"
    Pol "好的，我先走了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_c424224f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/38 Poka.ogg"
    Pol "拜拜！"


translate chinese doehal_1_292d00a7:


    "“拜拜！”一声在走廊里回响着。"


translate chinese doehal_1_328deaa0:


    "走廊里传来了一阵脚步声。"


translate chinese doehal_1_41ef594c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/62.Poka.ogg"
    Ant "拜拜"


translate chinese doehal_1_6e49bc48:


    "不知道她听到了没有。"


translate chinese doehal_1_97afc316:


    "我又看了窗外。"


translate chinese doehal_1_98d42e8d:


    "学校庭院里很安静，只有两个小学生玩雪球。"


translate chinese doehal_1_e15d462b:


    "肥胖的谢苗和他的朋友好像已经走了。"


translate chinese doehal_1_2b403ae7:


    "这给了我希望。"


translate chinese doehal_1_bafaa53a:


    "我到底该怎么办呢？"


translate chinese doehal_1_59bb6cd1:


    "在这个学校里，破琳娜会成为我的第一个朋友。"


translate chinese doehal_1_9cea7441:


    "此外，要是她路上真的遇到凶手，有我这个侠士在，她就安全点。"


translate chinese doehal_1_e33c60fd:


    "虽然内心小声音让我对自己没有信心，而且建议我谨防森林里徘徊的凶手，我就知道："


translate chinese doehal_1_8715fa8d:


    "波琳娜值得我冒这个险。"


translate chinese doehal_1_c4229e8b:


    "可是神秘的狡猾狐狸也吸引了我。"


translate chinese doehal_1_357f744e:


    "此外，她答应来帮我找到沃瓦，这就意味着我会得到奖金。"


translate chinese doehal_1_ecb34966:


    "有了很多钱大概能保证家庭平安。"


translate chinese doehal_1_f72825f8:


    "加上可以给奥利娅买很多礼物……"


translate chinese doehal_1_70d4b1df:


    "我想象我妹妹获奖，就像那些参加{u}苏波涅夫{/u}《成功时刻》节目的女孩子一样快乐。"


translate chinese doehal_1_c9fa5e5f:


    "流行歌手和她跳舞，也许{u}Ivanushki International{/u}这个受欢迎的新演唱组合会来。"


translate chinese doehal_1_8d33f57b:


    "父母在奥斯坦金诺摄影棚里互相拥抱着。"


translate chinese polfox_test_5db2a3d1:


    "接下来我们都去迪士尼乐园。"


translate chinese bucket_see_fd226cd4:


    "这是一个装满污水的桶，一块破布躲在桶底。"


translate chinese bucket_see_da4be1ad:


    "它闻起来有股臭味，这让我特别不舒服。我往后退了一步，心里想自己不用做清扫工作是太好的。"


translate chinese bucket_see_c72bdb8a:


    "臭水桶。"


translate chinese airplane_see_0b81c32f:


    "“如果想知道谁是笨蛋，把我翻过来。”我确定在背面上写的是一样的俏皮话。"


translate chinese airplane_see_89827d33:


    "好奇，谢苗把这个东西会翻来翻去多久啊？"


translate chinese airplane_see_5d5a5d17:


    "纸飞机。"


translate chinese shoes_see_9445ba4f:


    "某个人把自己的制服鞋忘在窗台上了。这是有点磨损的一脚蹬鞋。从鞋号来看，这属于和我一样大的男孩。"


translate chinese shoes_see_5598add4:


    "制服。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_win_2a12072d:


    "我拉上了书包的拉链，跑着下了楼。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_win_eb01af05:


    "在学校前厅里我又向窗外看去。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_win_ec60805a:


    "好像没有人。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_win_d18c62cf:


    "我打开前门时，它就吱吱作响。这声音听起来像是惊悚片中的，就是恐怖场景前用的那个高音。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_win_b3d2144e:


    "我很快就出去了，不想被别人发现。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_win_91d5e0fc:


    "从学校食堂里传来了面食和焦糖的味道。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_win_194e5258:


    "我看到二楼的窗外有个人影，就站住了：可能是波琳娜，她微微低头，琴弓在小提琴的弦上拉过。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_win_b853592c:


    "可惜我听不到了音乐，也看不到了波琳娜，因为在黄色的窗户背景下她不过是一个深色的轮廓。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_win_f345bfff:


    "我很不乐意地走了下去。"


translate chinese mold_test_9aca36d7:


    "运动场上足球门网随风摆动。"


translate chinese mold_test_337a5bdf:


    "风吹过田径场，扬起雪花。"


translate chinese mold_test_05afaebf:


    "远处传来了拖拉机运转的声音，把一群乌鸦吓飞了。"


translate chinese mold_test_8ace68aa:


    "发动机的声音使我想起饥饿的野兽在雪原上追逐我而发出的吼声。"


translate chinese mold_test_054dc6d8:


    "我也想起了那奇怪的阿狸萨和她的面具。"


translate chinese mold_test_ca2764f2:


    "在大白天里，很难相信她真的存在。"


translate chinese mold_test_125d77b5:


    "她是怎么说的呢？"


translate chinese mold_test_ae5964ff:


    "在后院里……就在吊死者旁边……"


translate chinese mold_test_6a0b1112:


    "是不是胡说啊？那到底是什么……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near2_73325047:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Ezvinite.ogg"
    Ant "不好意思……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near2_2870004b:


    "人影走过拐角就不见了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near2_584bf47b:


    "香烟烟雾随着他消失了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near2_14d3bd17:


    "是个大人。说不定是个老师？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near4_410836a0:


    "吊死者。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near4_6e7afd0a:


    "我看了墙上的图画：一个跳舞的小人，绞索套在他脖子上。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near4_75b50baa:


    "看起来某人在这里玩过上吊游戏。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near4_4b029d01:


    "小人旁边用俄语写的几个词：《逃跑》、《恐怖》、《真理》。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near4_b2bdc362:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/114 Blize.ogg"
    Noname "宝贝，过来……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near4_11183ab1:


    "我没有马上明白声音是从哪里传来的。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near4_d5b1380a:


    "我的目光迅速掠过校园的一个角落、反射太阳光的窗户和雪地。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near5_b1502ab3:


    "注射器。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near5_396c79ff:


    "在地上的很多的烟头中有一个用过的注射器……我希望用它的人只是要注射胰岛素的。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near6_c946d655:


    "松鼠。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near6_79b60857:


    "一只松鼠积极地啃着瓜子。说不定是某个学生喂熟了它。真棒！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_c7bf2262:


    "一个雪堆摇晃起来，如快要爆发的火山似的。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_0483c714:


    Alis "放弃你的心！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_6c2e8ee6:


    "在我意识到之前，白色的冰壳忽然爆裂了，狐狸从雪堆里跳出来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_20c9ecfd:


    "她优雅地鞠了一躬，享受着印象深刻的出场。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_535b7487:


    "雪花在她的皮大衣上银光闪闪。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_65816506:


    "真没想到，在我的脑海里狐狸女孩会如此……不知道怎么形容。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_29a5c9af:


    "如此着迷呢？又毒又甜呢？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_fb00d248:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/116 Otpor.ogg"
    Alis "打好反击来不及，就把你的心放弃！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_32ca8c7c:


    "她笑得多活泼，不知不觉地我也笑了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_a585c782:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/63. Da nu tebya.ogg"
    Ant "得了吧！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_4b3c017d:


    "我抓起了一把雪，把它捏成雪球，朝阿狸萨扔过去。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_37f306de:


    "她试图闪身躲开，可是来不及了，雪球就打中了她的肩膀。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_19f7c455:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/118 Ah ti.ogg"
    Alis "你啊！真是个坏男孩！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_eb2dac10:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/66. Da vot takoy ya.ogg"
    Ant "是！我就是坏！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_de67e1ea:


    "狐狸平稳地退了一步，抓了一把雪。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_a0b0ab88:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/119 Ti hiter.ogg"
    Alis "你聪明，我更聪明！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_133ae8ea:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/120 Lovok.ogg"
    Alis "你敏捷，我更敏捷！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_8fcd5ab7:


    "为报复而扔的雪球在雪地和头顶上盘旋着的乌鸦之间划出了一道弧线。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_1ee61357:


    "我试图躲开，结果滑倒了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_97b732c4:


    "我站起来时，雪球打了我的脸上，我就感到了脸颊发冷。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_114ae85f:


    "我生气了，大声骂几句。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_aad7e231:


    "这就是{u}《加沙地带》{/u}的歌曲中的骂人话，那个朋克乐队的歌曲我一般偷偷地听。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_44da6806:


    "要是父亲在这里的话，他就会好好教训我一顿。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_44c3e26e:


    "他最不能容忍脏话，他是一个很有礼貌的人。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_40e914d7:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/121 Da ladno.ogg"
    Alis "别骂人了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_2b56e4f8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/122 Ne bolno.ogg"
    Alis "一点也不疼啊。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_5eef5d37:


    "她同情地把我大衣上的雪抖掉了，扶着我帮我站起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_9b6e6e58:


    "她关切地看了我一眼，小心翼翼地把我的眼镜摘下来，吹掉了玻璃面上的雪花，然后把眼镜还给我了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_96de3992:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/123 Vot tak.ogg"
    Alis "1比1，托沙。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_d2bfb6e5:


    "只有家人叫我托沙。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_b8f74985:


    "而她呢，我没见过她的脸，不知道她姓什么，不知道她是哪一级的，连她皮大衣里面有没有尾巴都不知道。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_22b8fafb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/124 Zelaes.ogg"
    Alis "你想赢吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_6e446fa8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/68. Mi hoteli poiskat.ogg"
    Ant "我们还要找到沃瓦，你记得吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_2858deb4:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/69. Lucshe potorop.ogg"
    Ant "咱们得抓紧时间。要是我晚上不在家，父母就担心。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_2246f84a:


    "狐狸打了个哈欠表示无聊。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_2980a5d3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/125 Parents.ogg"
    Alis "父母啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_0c9a9a40:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/126 Kak skuchno.ogg"
    Alis "无聊透了！你别这样！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_c8e9224d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/127 Davai.ogg"
    Alis "我们还是玩一会吧！不管怎样，你家里都很无聊。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_9ed5ae82:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/70. A ti otkuda znaesh.ogg"
    Ant "你怎么知道的？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_d11f2fa5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/128 Toze mne.ogg"
    Alis "这不难猜到的。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_225fbe5e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/129 So vzrosl.ogg"
    Alis "老是待在四面墙壁里，还有大人控制你 – 真难受！没有例外！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_41643732:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/130 Y menya.ogg"
    Alis "墙壁和大人都让我紧张。就这样！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_f5997f37:


    "她的狐狸眉毛动了一下。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_d2a446a9:


    "我发出了一阵神经质的笑声。我还没有确定，这样来动面具的一个部分有没有什么可笑的呢？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_368edce2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/131 Nu ze.ogg"
    Alis "来吧，托沙，我们玩一下！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_267c8f66:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/132 Ya ze.ogg"
    Alis "我都可以看出你很想玩。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_08bf7411:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/133 I esli.ogg"
    Alis "要是你赢了……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_9cdff5b8:


    "小狐狸走近了我，踮起脚尖，她粗糙的鼻子尖几乎碰到了我的脸。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_c8908314:


    "她的眼里闪着激动的光彩。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_530a3911:


    "她的气味很好，让我想到野果。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_ca698964:


    "也许独立和真正的自由就有这样的气味。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_060efdc8:


    "在这种生活中，除了玩耍和吃糖以外，什么都不重要。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_d3590815:


    "热的低声流入了我的耳朵："


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_dadb7f43:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/134 Esli.ogg"
    Alis "要是你赢了，我就当你的向导。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_83c6de63:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/135 Pover.ogg"
    Alis "相信我，森林里有很多要给你看的……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_e5bcb459:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/136 Naidem.ogg"
    Alis "哈哈哈！我们一定会找到那个沃瓦！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_ff06ec97:


    "我身体里面仿佛有一个隐形的大弹簧压缩了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_bef2c7e2:


    "我的肚子里有了一种很奇怪的感觉，也不能说是不舒服的一种。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_8787b458:


    "怪事：不久以前我和波琳娜聊天，而现在呢，阿狸萨就陪着我。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_9e74f922:


    "我觉得自己快要分裂似的，就像那可怕的新闻报道中的十字架一样。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_2f3b367b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/72. A esli.ogg"
    Ant "嗯……要是我输了呢？"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_1ce68ecb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/137 Dushu.ogg"
    Alis "那我就挖掉你的软心！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_bf76920e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/138 Ahaha.ogg"
    Alis "哈哈哈哈哈！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_35e72517:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/139 Skoree.ogg"
    Alis "来吧，快点！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_7ba09c67:


    "她笑起来了，转过身去，朝我们早上走的路跑去了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_735d0eac:


    "她的诺言……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_672ba8ee:


    "……也可以说是威胁……"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_8d18615f:


    "……把我吸引住了。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_df488ee5:


    "我弯下腰去抓一把雪。"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_6742a9d6:


    "我要是有一种测谎装置来辨别阿狸萨的真假话，那就好了！"


translate chinese bunny2_school_near1_0e4e1fe0:


    "或者像她这样的人一直有第三选择吗？"


translate chinese ttt_7dbd8ee5:


    "不管是真的还是假的、响亮的笑声还是温柔的耳语……"


translate chinese ttt_dc99eca9:


    "我特别想赢。"


translate chinese ttt_2c7e867a:


    "我想惩罚她，因为她的自由和思维敏捷对一个一般的女孩来说是太多了。"


translate chinese ttt_8052524a:


    "兴奋、好奇心和一种前所未有的感觉吸引住了我，使我陶醉。"


translate chinese ttt_806f4824:


    "就像我吃了{u}露酒{/u}中的几颗樱桃的那次；闭着眼睛躺在床上时，我头晕特别厉害，觉得床都在转圈圈。"


translate chinese ttt_5a000e80:


    "我吐了口痰，擦了擦嘴唇。"


translate chinese ttt_732bb2f4:


    "小狐狸，你想玩吗？"


translate chinese ttt_cf3708cb:


    "那我们玩吧！"


translate chinese ttt_d1d1f7ef:


    "我拿着雪球跟着她跑了。"


translate chinese test_run_1c07ec15:


    "一条熟悉的街道出现在了眼前，木头电杆不再可怕了。"


translate chinese test_run_9657edaf:


    "那不过是被雪覆盖的几根木头。只要喊一声，看门狗就会叫起来，人家就会立即出现。"


translate chinese test_run_dc29a7c8:


    "阿狸萨的身影在前面远处引逗我，不过，这么远的距离，我估计扔雪球都扔不到。"


translate chinese test_run_f2b8d2c2:


    "小路两边可见被严寒而冻伤的白桦。"


translate chinese test_run_b820e5e1:


    "树旁边有一个巨大的雪堆。"


translate chinese test_run_a61fe338:


    "看来，那拖拉机把村子里所有的雪运到了这个地方里。很多狐狸会躲在这么大的雪堆中。"


translate chinese test_run_3da79944:


    "{i}“不会”{/i}，我想，{i}“这狐狸只有一个，不会有第二个。其实，一个也太多了{/i}。”"


translate chinese test_run_d4dc60b3:


    "我早上认识的另一个动物在森林边跑来跑去，那就是阿狸萨的狗。"


translate chinese test_run_74ec9501:


    "它闻来闻去，在光秃秃的灌木丛上撒了尿，就跑到了其它灌木丛边。"


translate chinese test_run_905e2c02:


    "阿狸萨突然从小丘后出现了。"


translate chinese test_run_dc78e967:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/140 Zulka.ogg"
    Alis "如利卡！快跑！"


translate chinese test_run_03335fa6:


    "狗狗的耳朵就竖了起来，它得意洋洋地叫了一声，跟着阿狸萨跑了。"


translate chinese test_run_a2e163c4:


    "我们跑得越来越远，路上不时互相扔雪球，跌跌撞撞地跑着，哈哈大笑。"


translate chinese test_run_9be8a727:


    "冬天的森林在前面出现，其树木长到了低云。我们跑动了森林的阴影，那阴影看起来有爪子，而且可以被人触摸到的。"


translate chinese test_run_d7e389ff:


    "狐狸很快就躲在大松树的后面。很明显，她打算悄悄地从我背后靠近我，接下来把雪塞进我脖子后面的衣领里。"


translate chinese test_run_bb2fe06b:


    "这计划还算不错，不过如利卡一直在她旁边跑来跑去，就暴露了阿狸萨藏身的位置。"


translate chinese test_run_963a7086:


    "我打算表现得比她还狡猾。我折下了一根干树枝。"


translate chinese test_run_da2455a4:


    "然后把自己的帽子挂在树枝上便拿近松树。"


translate chinese test_run_1d41b204:


    "让她想这就是我的头在树身后面。"


translate chinese test_run_b7a97d8b:


    "我咬住嘴唇以免笑出来。接下来我从另一边跳出来，把雪球朝阿狸萨扔去了。"


translate chinese test_run_8a432146:


    "阿狸萨可能早就看透了我的诡计，不过她让我赢，3比1。"


translate chinese test_run_745a8ee3:


    "我腿受伤了，而她的胃和胸被“枪”打伤了，她流着臆想出来的血。"


translate chinese test_run_8484ce3f:


    "她忍不住笑了，而且向我恳求饶恕。"


translate chinese test_run_292c310e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/142 Molu.ogg"
    Alis "哈哈哈！怜悯我吧！"


translate chinese test_run_eaa942f2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/142 Pomirayu.ogg"
    Alis "哈哈！我快要死了！"


translate chinese test_run_d8cdd8fa:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/75. Da vse vse.ogg"
    Ant "好，活下去吧！"


translate chinese test_run_10241457:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/143 Spasibo.ogg"
    Alis "谢谢你，好侠客！"


translate chinese test_run_8a000119:


    "她装作自己鞠个躬，同时抓起了一把雪，朝我扔了，仿佛那就是垂死的战士最后的报复。"


translate chinese test_run_5076c6b8:


    "我成功地躲开了。委屈地笑着，我扔了两个雪球，就把那个女勇士打死了。" with hpunch


translate chinese test_run_c2e66df3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/145 Zivizivi.ogg"
    Alis "活下去，活下去……"


translate chinese test_run_5f1d27c2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/145 Nauchil.ogg"
    Alis "你要是这么聪明，那就教我怎么活下去呢。"


translate chinese test_run_64ceb2c8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/77. Molchi ti.ogg"
    Ant "别出声！你已经死了！"


translate chinese test_run_3a260aaf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/146 Toze mne.ogg"
    Alis "这不算什么！"


translate chinese test_run_479fc7d6:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/147 Davai.ogg"
    Alis "我们来玩更有意思的游戏吧。"


translate chinese test_run_380b90e1:


    "她乱扔了一个雪球，然后冲到了树木后。"


translate chinese test_run_4f79255c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/149 Razdva.ogg"
    Alis "“一、二，猫头鹰，"


translate chinese test_run_0de9f036:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/150 Trichetire.ogg"
    Alis "三四五，来玩吧。"


translate chinese test_run_f13cf0e2:


    "我去找她，感到焦虑不安。"


translate chinese test_run_57109f6f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/151 Shest.ogg"
    Alis "六、六，为了狼……"


translate chinese test_run_fdeff52d:


    "一瞬间内，我好像真的看到了一条狐狸尾巴穿过灌木丛中。"


translate chinese test_run_6ac0677d:


    "我冲到了树枝交织的地方，以为阿狸萨就在那里躲起来了。"


translate chinese test_run_97b73568:


    "我只得把那些树枝拨开、撕破，仿佛那是一片蜘蛛网。"


translate chinese test_run_2f97151d:


    "树枝弹回而不打我脸上，却轻轻抚摸我的脸颊似的。"


translate chinese test_run_3a784784:


    "我浑身出汗，不过我一点也不累了。"


translate chinese test_run_fbd7e175:


    "小狐狸，我一定要抓住你。"


translate chinese test_run_91380b3c:


    "阿狸萨的声音在树干和矮树间漂浮着。"


translate chinese test_run_15e0ff91:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/152 Semvosem.ogg"
    Alis "七、八，为了羊……"


translate chinese test_run_171c058c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/153 Haha.ogg"
    Alis "哈哈！"


translate chinese test_run_cc6cfb46:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/154 A ya tebya.ogg"
    Alis "原来我低估了你！"


translate chinese test_run_ab3b8776:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/155 Dumala.ogg"
    Alis "我以为你只是个普通的男孩！"


translate chinese test_run_eb5a6963:


    "我以为她站在枯萎的白杨后，所以我就跑到了那里。"


translate chinese test_run_cc40e884:


    "可是那地方的可听度骗了我：阿狸萨的声音突然开始在左边听着："


translate chinese test_run_902ce09e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/156 A ti.ogg"
    Alis "而你是一个小兔子！"


translate chinese test_run_702011cf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/157 Shustr.ogg"
    Alis "一个伶俐可爱的小兔子！"


translate chinese test_run_5247cfa7:


    "一个雪球从黑暗的藏身处里飞出来，嗖的一声从我耳边飞过。"


translate chinese test_run_159a487c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/77. Ya tebe dam.ogg"
    Ant "我要让你看看一个小兔子啊！"


translate chinese test_run_7a2048ed:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/158 Dai mne.ogg"
    Alis "让我看看，让我看看！"


translate chinese test_run_6cc6bf0e:


    "火红的狐狸大衣在一个腐烂的树墩旁边闪了一下。"


translate chinese test_run_d8066e75:


    "我跳过了一条沟，朝那里奔去了。"


translate chinese test_run_9b8ff26a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/159 Zaichik.ogg"
    Alis "小兔子快出来，\n请给野兽带来肉！"


translate chinese test_run_543cdc7d:


    "那时，对我来说，最重要的是下一棵树后闪了的红色毛皮领子。"


translate chinese test_run_48466ecc:


    "我的嘴唇抖动着，我就像一个追踪猎物的猎人一样。"


translate chinese test_run_6fa8bbc6:


    "往前一冲，就把狐狸抓到了，她这么光滑、这么妩媚。"


translate chinese test_run_7e628661:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/160 Vse v.ogg"
    Alis "好好好，你赢了！"


translate chinese test_run_754c770d:


    "她靠在粗糙的树干上，气喘吁吁地说："


translate chinese test_run_33ac3fdd:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/163 Poz.ogg"
    Alis "让我休息一下吧。"


translate chinese test_run_280ca336:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/164 Ti slishkom.ogg"
    Alis "你太快了、太强了……也很美味啊。"


translate chinese test_run_f0c139f7:


    "我的心里洋溢着自满，我双手叉腰站着，像一个胜利者等待战败者的礼品。"


translate chinese test_run_b76d3689:


    "但是我没得到礼品，而是得到了一个卑鄙的雪球打了我高傲的脸上。"


translate chinese test_run_a0e30972:


    "世界最狡猾的生物哈哈大笑起来了，向前猛冲了，而我一点都不生气了。"


translate chinese test_run_a1f2b3d8:


    "我唯一的愿望是追上阿狸萨、把她按在地上。"


translate chinese test_run_18c6be05:


    "然后把她的面具扯下来，看见她的真脸！"


translate chinese test_run_cb55a86d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/166 Bend.ogg"
    Alis "可怜的小兔子……"


translate chinese test_run_fd335979:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/166 Vozle.ogg"
    Alis "在大雨中跑着，"


translate chinese test_run_8d9af6bb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/166 Strashno.ogg"
    Alis "怕灰色的狼会吃掉它……"


translate chinese test_run_d626348b:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/166 Dumaet o lete.ogg"
    Alis "兔子想念夏天，两耳向后一抿，"


translate chinese test_run_c7980ad7:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/166 Na nebo.ogg"
    Alis "兔子想看天空，看不到天……"


translate chinese test_run_a1b85339:


    "我真的看不到天空，因为树冠把整个天空都遮盖起来了。"


translate chinese test_run_7061ea8b:


    "我只能靠如利卡的叫声继续跑，那条傻狗一直紧跟在阿狸萨的后面。"


translate chinese test_run_47fb37d1:


    "这样一来，我快要抓住她。"


translate chinese test_run_4c8e2052:


    "我跑在小路上，就我在学校想象的那条。"


translate chinese test_run_264369b8:


    "原来快速地奔跑那么容易！"


translate chinese test_run_a845c83a:


    "{i}更快！更高！更强！{/i}"


translate chinese test_run_61d0082a:


    "我觉得一个藏着新能力的箱子在里面打开了。"


translate chinese test_run_b9169049:


    "我的肌肉放松，肺增大了，我好像变了更强。"


translate chinese test_run_f8bb7afc:


    "连我的视力都更敏锐了：雪地上的每一根小树枝、树皮上的每一条裂缝我都看见。"


translate chinese test_run_ce8a5dc4:


    "灌木丛旁边乱扔着一件鲜艳的衣服。"


translate chinese test_run_1bd54c85:


    "右边还有一件。"


translate chinese test_run_4b8fef78:


    "阿狸萨跑着把自己的衣服脱掉。仿佛蜕掉了皮。"


translate chinese test_run_e373b83d:


    "想到这个，我就欢欣鼓舞，用牙齿咬下手套。"


translate chinese test_run_af701ada:


    "我想脱下所有的衣服，投身风中！"


translate chinese test_run_c5ccb7f9:


    "{i}更快！{/i}"


translate chinese test_run_5aca3243:


    "我伸手来摘下帽子，阻碍我跑在无尽森林里的东西我都想扔去。"


translate chinese test_run_500e4f3f:


    "书包制止我，我就把它扔在雪地里。笔盒、钢笔、铅笔、色彩的笔记本、页边上的画儿都在里面，还有奥利娅的恐龙……"


translate chinese test_run_149abfac:


    "奥利娅！"


translate chinese test_run_e73b3120:


    "突然我脑子里闪了一个情景："


translate chinese test_run_ba3ff56a:


    "夕阳光下，我的妹妹站在窗前。"


translate chinese test_run_7337e379:


    "她用暖和的小手掌在窗玻璃上化开两个小洞。"


translate chinese test_run_a6c950d9:


    "这样她能温暖整个世界。"


translate chinese test_run_bb24a80e:


    "奥利娅盯着泰加森林，一遍又一遍地重复着我的名字。"


translate chinese test_run_c02a0ad7:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/01 Tosha.ogg"
    Oly "托沙！"


translate chinese test_run_634a6664:


    "我停下来了，深深地吸了一口气，就意识到了，在森林里脱衣服、追赶狐狸有多么糊涂。"


translate chinese test_run_676f115d:


    "我回去拿书包，仿佛它是我自己的被扔下来的一部分。"


translate chinese test_run_4a40e9ba:


    "我又想起了，我不在家，妹妹很不开心，她总求我快点回来。"


translate chinese test_run_ac759af7:


    "我到底是什么样的哥哥呢？"


translate chinese test_run_362a4dd3:


    "曾经我用这片森林来恐吓妹妹，而现在我在这片森林里跑来跑去。"


translate chinese test_run_0704c86d:


    "父母不让她出去，而我总是不管，仿佛对她说：没关系，奥利娅，你待在这个笼子里吧，重新播放百遍看过的动画片吧。"


translate chinese test_run_e26cf374:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/02 Tosha.ogg"
    Oly "托沙！"


translate chinese test_run_0a2ac27e:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/78. Da olenka.ogg"
    Ant "什么，奥利娅？"


translate chinese test_run_5357a747:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/03 ToshaA.ogg"
    Oly "托沙，你……"


translate chinese test_run_5e315b1b:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/03 Kuda А.ogg"
    Oly "你跑哪儿去了，笨蛋？"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_0028055c:


    "我倒吸了一口气。按摩着后脑勺站起来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_a9c205b2:


    "谢苗嘲弄地笑了笑，仿佛无声地问了我：“你怎么答复？”"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_1a62d659:


    "我看了他的红色的拳头（那时显得真大）就明白了：要是我发出一声他就打我。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_1e7cdd6a:


    "他会打我直到我哭着求饶，也许即使这样，他也会继续打下去。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_1b956393:


    "此外，没有人会救我的。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_269d65e1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/45 Prostite.ogg"
    Ant "不……不好意思。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_250cbfcf:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/45.2 Ya spotknulsya.ogg"
    Ant "我只是绊了一下。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_5683b641:


    "太可怜了。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_1957e9bb:


    "要是人羞得会起火，那我那时就会像煤块一样燃烧着的。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_0c7ef33b:



    voice "voice/kate/13 KA.ogg"
    Kate "走路要带带眼！"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_a352cc92:



    voice "voice/kate/14 KA.ogg"
    Kate "瞎子……"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_71de7ef4:


    "我低下了头，从谢苗身边挤了过去。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_2542c79c:


    "一股强烈的龋齿臭味向我袭来。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_62d4067b:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/26 Poka.ogg"
    Sem "拜拜，兔崽子。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_e9d19344:


    "他在我背后大声地擤了擤鼻子。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_7a066277:


    "我的肌肉变得僵硬，我就感到了他在我背上擦了擦自己的手。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_7d770b9b:


    "我沿着走廊走了下去，遭四面八方的嘲笑。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_17b0099e:


    "事情比预想的还糟。"


translate chinese bunny2_semen_lose_a20cefa7:


    "……"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_29c76304:


    "有一天谢苗把我从楼梯上推了下去，幸好我没摔断了脖子，而谢苗他只是说：“不好意思啊！”"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_83101fdf:


    "另一天他在学校食堂里把果汁泼到我的衣服上了，接下来他说：“我不是故意的！”"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_0667240b:


    "每天都会发生这样的事情。"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_0fded371:


    "由于连续的“我不是故意的”，我每天都感觉特别紧张。"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_500e4043:


    "我惊恐地意识到这一切仅仅只是个开始，这个问题只会变得越来越糟，但我什么都做不到。"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_09a79826:


    "我在学校里一直低头走着、一直等着下课。"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_7bde5fba:


    "有的时候，我发现波琳娜看我一眼，我就羞得不得了。她的眼神鼓励我去打架，但偏巧那时什么都没发生。"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_cbc69f4e:


    "我的怒气平息下来后，就老一套了。"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_b48f5c14:


    "放学后我一个人走路回家。"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_6751716f:


    "我的路线一般经过村子、河上的桥和森林。"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_9c6039c9:


    "我得十分钟左右走在树丛里。"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_4d6491a9:


    "一般路上没有人，只有几辆车慢慢地前行，仿佛害怕陷进雪里。"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_d8ac9f82:


    "我想尽快回家，因为被白雪覆盖的树枝和黑色的树干都造成一种奇怪的错觉：似乎有人在森林里游荡着。"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_8dc1f235:


    "似乎那个人很高，神出鬼没，也随时准备装扮成树木或者雪堆，然后他会等一会儿便继续沿着路走……"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_1170abd4:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/28 Nu z.ogg"
    Sem "好久不见了，安东！"


translate chinese bunny2_solo_win_ca0c41f9:


    "我的心一下子停跳了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_21b0e312:


    "雪花在窗外飘扬着，仿佛在外面传来的音乐伴奏下跳舞着。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_861172c3:


    "强烈的好奇心让我从窗台上下去，顺着走廊走。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_f469782c:


    "我只等了半个小时，却以为过了很长时间。我特别想再见波琳娜一次。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_aa5e3fa8:


    "音乐声更大，音乐从走廊尽头半开着的门里流动。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_afa0999b:


    "我一般会喜欢的音乐主要是{u}莱托夫{/u}和舍甫丘克的歌曲，《怀旧金曲》音乐节目。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_199138f4:


    "还有电视中插播的流行歌曲或者电影前播放的音乐短片"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_d7d25630:


    "可是小提琴旋律让我心醉。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_407fd83d:


    "这旋律使我联想到典雅优美的雕刻艺术品，精制玻璃玩具，一阵暖风。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_7ccbf4f3:


    "我靠到了门框上。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_a391a4db:


    "教室的深处把波琳娜藏起来，不过我还能看见她的影子，拿着提琴旋的那个。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_e72f64d5:


    "她的手与琴弓动弹得那么优雅，我就如飘在音乐波浪似的。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_e096a362:


    "仿佛我那激动的心从胸膛跳出来了，奔跑如飞。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_18f7da2d:


    "跑得越来越快，经过白茫茫的雪野，经过枯枝断树，跑到火红的太阳。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_35963926:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/53 Zaskuchal.ogg"
    Pol "想着谁呀？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_131c5ac6:


    "沉浸在自己的思想中，我没听见脚步声。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_d1dbf048:


    "在音乐里沐浴的波琳娜变得更神奇。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_235af5b8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/80 Da net net.ogg"
    Ant "我……我没有。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_609e3387:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/80.2 Ya mmm.ogg"
    Ant "我只是……"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_edf15b12:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/81. Ya o komikse.ogg"
    Ant "我只是在想自己的漫画。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_785e811e:


    "我无缘无故地撒谎了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_c287b8e8:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/54 Ti komiksi.ogg"
    Pol "你会画漫画吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_4b26a882:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/82 Da nu to est.ogg"
    Ant "是……也不是……"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_d46f594d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/82.2 Planiruy.ogg"
    Ant "我只是打算开始。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_cfba2590:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/55 Aga.ogg"
    Pol "知道了！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_72f5cec0:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/55 I pro chto.ogg"
    Pol "你的漫画是关于什么？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_b2438fa1:


    "关于这恐怖之地中最美丽、最善良的女小提琴手。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_72d9fe70:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/83. Pro lisu.ogg"
    Ant "关于一只狐狸。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_27a244a2:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/84.Oi.ogg"
    Ant "具体来说，关于住在森林中的会说话的动物，它们帮迷路的孩子回家。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_cfab20aa:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/85 A potom oni.ogg"
    Ant "然后呢……"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_cc943816:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/85.2 Oni plyashut.ogg"
    Ant "……它们在月光下跳舞。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_a1058fc7:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/56 Ogo.ogg"
    Pol "哇！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_3db13eed:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/56 Kak interesno.ogg"
    Pol "多有意思！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_f9f96dba:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/56 Sam pridumal.ogg"
    Pol "是你自己想出来的吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_93d315a4:


    "我往下看。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_9ff1a722:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/86. Vdohnovilsya.ogg"
    Ant "窗外的风景激发了我的灵感……"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_39140bdd:


    "我们下到了第一层楼。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_c7d7f635:


    "我为波琳娜开了门。父亲经常说作为一个有礼貌的男生很重要。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_b22ddb81:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/57 Znachit.ogg"
    Pol "那可以说，你是一个善于创作的人。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_26ca7483:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/57 Ya dogad.ogg"
    Pol "我早就知道你和其他人不一样。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_dfcf8bd5:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/57 Osoben.ogg"
    Pol "你是特别的。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_4588221c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/88 Shutish.ogg"
    Ant "你说我吗？你在开玩笑吧？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_f2370591:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/88.2 Ya samiy.ogg"
    Ant "我很一般。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_3b3cdabf:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/58 Eto Semen.ogg"
    Pol "是谢苗很一般……"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_5ffc71b4:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/58 V smisle.ogg"
    Pol "具体来说，他是一个坏蛋。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_28d0d2da:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/58 A v tebe.ogg"
    Pol "而你呢，你的心肠很软,很善良。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_955fc770:


    "我们过学校庭院的时候，突然很近听见了吠叫一声。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_5856111a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/59 Ai.ogg"
    Pol "哎呀！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_aa67fcd3:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/89. Ne boyisya.ogg"
    Ant "别怕，别怕，这是如利卡！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_7991dd38:


    "我跪了一条腿，挠一挠狗的耳朵后边。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_f3dc9ef9:


    "狗很快摇尾巴，如它的尾巴是一个螺旋桨。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_cbb204fd:


    "我以为阿狸萨离这里不远，所以看了看周围。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_87fad9e5:


    "不过，狐狸女孩在庭院、在路上哪里都不见了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_ff7547ec:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/60 Bros.ogg"
    Pol "你别和它玩。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_71c13fd3:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/60 Ti chto.ogg"
    Pol "这是一条野狗，你知道吗！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_6bcdef11:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/60 Klesh.ogg"
    Pol "你会得蜱虫。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_50612368:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/90 Net u nee.ogg"
    Ant "它不是，它有主人。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_6aec83c5:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/90.2 Vrode.ogg"
    Ant "应该有。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_11c08c04:


    "波琳娜用手帕把嘴巴遮住，厌恶地看着高兴起来的狗。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_73febfb1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/91. U tebya.ogg"
    Ant "你有没有吃的？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_1a639764:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/61 Kazetsya.ogg"
    Pol "可能有。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_d4d9b13a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/61 Pokormim.ogg"
    Pol "咱们给它吃的，然后就走，好吗"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_fa6ba9bb:


    "她把一个三明治从书包里拿出来了，给如利卡扔了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_87c513fd:


    "它就贪婪地吃起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_ebf3ddb9:


    "它用鼻子把面包片扔开，开始吃香肠。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_02a17a9c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/92 kakaya privered.ogg"
    Ant "那么挑剔啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_5a5c371c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/92.2 Esh vse.ogg"
    Ant "连面包都不吃，快吃吧！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_1ae4b4c2:


    "波琳娜扯了扯我的衣袖，催促我走。" with hpunch


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_a6aff5d4:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/93. Ti chego.ogg"
    Ant "怎么了？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_d893a7bc:


    "她大声笑了起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_d6377cec:


    "这女小提琴手把我从学校庭院里拖出来，忍不住发出笑声。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_a752a2ef:


    "我回头看了看。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_8389fff3:


    "被遗弃的如利卡用埋怨的眼神看着我们，它在雪堆的背景下显得很孤独。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_5723948e:


    "波琳娜就不笑了。一瞬内她变得冷淡了，目光失去了神采。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_db637148:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/62 Nechego.ogg"
    Pol "养肥这些废物也没有什么用！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_cb832140:


    "这一句话听起来有点粗暴。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_6631c313:


    "这条狗没有家难道是它的错吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_8182c5d4:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/63 Oni potom.ogg"
    Pol "它们长大以后会向人扑过去。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_bd67deed:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/63 Proshloy.ogg"
    Pol "去年冬天一群野狗几乎咬死我爷爷。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_9743dc48:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/94. Kakoi.ogg"
    Ant "我的天哪！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_2f4e9d4e:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/94.2 Emu s.ogg"
    Ant "他就从那时身体不好吧？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_e91b0571:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/64 Ego.ogg"
    Pol "他瘫痪了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_a6b8254f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/64 On.ogg"
    Pol "他再也不能自己走路了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_3be1a543:


    "我想起了几条野狗追赶过我，心里就不安全。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_bf70a4af:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/95. Mne ochen.ogg"
    Ant "我……我很遗憾。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_5f300c25:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/65 Nichego.ogg"
    Pol "没事，没事。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_1f758747:


    "波琳娜眯缝了一下眼睛，她的脸上又浮起了迷人的微笑。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_98388a3f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/66 Glavnoe.ogg"
    Pol "咱们相互理解是最重要的。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_43bbca77:


    "她的话使我忘记如利卡。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_ae6fdce3:


    "在围墙旁边玩的三年级小学生们一边打雪仗，一边大声唱："


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_9932d8e7:



    voice "voice/Child/2day/Child_02.ogg"
    Childs "一、二，猫头鹰……"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_3695de1c:


    "猫头鹰？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_149abfac:


    "奥利娅！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_44e46825:


    "我就想到了妹妹，我不在她肯定很寂寞，向窗外望，等我从昏暗中走出。 "


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_8d781815:


    "我决定不迟延：一送波琳娜回家就自己回家。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_19bfe36e:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/96. A chto.ogg"
    Ant "他们在唱什么歌呀？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_8be3ee44:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/97. Uze.ogg"
    Ant "这首歌我今天已经听了一次。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_0a9435ec:


    "我们走在大路上。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_c26d69f4:


    "不远传来了拖拉机运转的声音。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_463fbead:


    "乌鸦在灰色的天上盘旋。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_7a986e92:


    "一群黑色的鸟在我们的头顶上环绕着飞，仿佛是从坟墓上飞去的可怕的十字架似的。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_396785e4:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/67 Pro sovu.ogg"
    Pol "关于猫头鹰的这个？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_08f87c99:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/67 Eto.ogg"
    Pol "这是当地数数歌。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_6bb0582f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/67 Mne.ogg"
    Pol "我小时候，爷爷常常会给我唱这首歌。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_a79e0cea:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/67 On interes.ogg"
    Pol "他对家乡历史很感兴趣，也很了解本地民俗。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_ed1ff05a:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/98. I chto tam za.ogg"
    Ant "那这首数数歌是怎么唱的？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_d81a92e1:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/69 Slushai.ogg"
    Pol "听我唱！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_4f49065b:


    "她倒退着走，用快乐的眼神看着我。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_0d8b4b55:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/70 Raz dva.ogg"
    Pol "一、二，猫头鹰"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_97f0f280:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/70 Three.ogg"
    Pol "三四五，来玩吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_ba1cf233:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/70 Six.ogg"
    Pol "六、六，为了狼，"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_446a1f07:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/70 Seven.ogg"
    Pol "七、八，为了羊，"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_75b70df0:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/70 Bear fox.ogg"
    Pol "为了狐狸，为了熊"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_f1e01d35:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/70 Bunny.ogg"
    Pol "小兔子带来肉！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_1717b27e:


    "我就想起了今天早上的那只狐狸。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_93f8728b:


    "可巧那只是一只狐狸，而不是狼，也不是熊。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_7693b5ec:


    "欣赏同路人时，我突然感到了自己大胆起来说："


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_dc148e39:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/99. U tebya.ogg"
    Ant "你的声音听起来真美。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_79e2dd93:


    "妩媚的波琳娜整理了一下刘海儿发。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_6a5d9878:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/71 Spasibo.ogg"
    Pol "谢谢你。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_1743558b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/100 I chto ze.ogg"
    Ant "那这首歌的最后一句是什么？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_3e582960:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/100.2 Prines im zayac.ogg"
    Ant "小兔子终于给了那些动物吃的东西吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_33201ef5:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/72 Podi.ogg"
    Pol "我怎么会知道啊。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_6fcc145e:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/73 Sprosit.ogg"
    Pol "没有人知道，这首歌很旧了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_7ef468ea:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/74 Drevnaya.ogg"
    Pol "也可以说是古老的。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_1ad1e32f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/75 S nei.ogg"
    Pol "其实，有一个故事和它有关系。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_d24de7bb:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/76 Esli tebe.ogg"
    Pol "如果你觉得有意思，那我会给你讲。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_b09da256:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/101. Konechno.ogg"
    Ant "很有意思！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_e9c5f047:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/77 Tut v taige.ogg"
    Pol "很久以前，很多部落住在这儿的森林里。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_2b3bcd10:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/78 Dedushka.ogg"
    Pol "爷爷说他们经常进行各种仪式……主要为了男孩会变成为男人这类的仪式。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_bc574a05:


    "我竖起耳朵来听。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_6ea92e78:


    "因为我也要……变。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_72d2b4ae:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/79 Young.ogg"
    Pol "青年男子必须在森林里过三天三夜，也必须在那里打猎。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_c64aa4c8:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/80 Po legende.ogg"
    Pol "据说，一个男生去了森林就迷路了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_ebd6108f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/81 A vernulsya.ogg"
    Pol "部落人找他很久了，然后不再找了，不过他自己回来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_a94839e0:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/82 Nagryanul.ogg"
    Pol "他的样子真可怜：受伤、肮脏、冻僵。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_0578c1d2:


    "我设想他在森林的松树和熊窝之间过漫漫长夜。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_649def4b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/83 Rodnie.ogg"
    Pol "他的家人跑到了他身边，而他呢，他就昏倒了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_da7b7430:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/84 Priveli.ogg"
    Pol "家人请萨满来看他……"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_2809a062:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/85 Tot.ogg"
    Pol "萨满看了他就忧郁起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_e7a0c25b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/86 Skazal.ogg"
    Pol "他说：不好了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_662ad837:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/87 Du utra.ogg"
    Pol "一直到早上，这个男生都在全身痉挛，不停地说出这首数数歌的词……"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_e74151b3:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/88 Snova.ogg"
    Pol "一遍又一遍……"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_75d6d7e1:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/89 Raz dva.ogg"
    Pol "“一、二，猫头鹰”…… 这些话他应该是向森林的怪物教的。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_cf7d25eb:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/90 A k rassvetu.ogg"
    Pol "太阳升起，他就死了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_3e211b2a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/91 Tolko.ogg"
    Pol "不过萨满说，这个男生早就死了：他从森林里走出来的时候他的身体已经死了，他在低声说出数数歌的词他也是死的。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_8f0584ec:


    "这个故事让我大吃一惊。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_3c7cc4f4:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/102. Eto tochno.ogg"
    Ant "这好像是一部恐怖片的情节。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_0406b10b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/92 Folklor.ogg"
    Pol "一些民间故事比任何恐怖片还可怕！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_5116e95f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/93 Dedushka.ogg"
    Pol "爷爷说，男生死了以后，那些部落人赶紧迁移到南方了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_93fca796:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/103 Oni bili.ogg"
    Ant "如果他们敢在这里住过，"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_6b5cae73:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/103.2 Esli.ogg"
    Ant "这就证明那些人很勇敢。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_c67f94c6:


    "波琳娜踢了一次雪堆。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_fa1e2d96:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/94 Smelimi.ogg"
    Pol "很勇敢也很傻。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_0cba432b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/94 Neuzeli.ogg"
    Pol "难道只有死人从森林里走出，人们才能明白吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_8e752f57:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/104. Doshlo chto.ogg"
    Ant "明白什么？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_c0e3d2b0:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/95 Chto nuzno.ogg"
    Pol "明白我们都要离开这里。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_f79b69cc:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/95 Est.ogg"
    Pol "有大世界。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_2bbf462d:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/95 A est.ogg"
    Pol "还有我们的村子。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_0075ad78:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/96 Mir.ogg"
    Pol "大世界……"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_e9828f00:


    "说出这个词，她两臂向两侧平伸。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_a22b188d:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/97 Poselok.ogg"
    Pol "村子。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_cdb1400b:


    "她用大拇指和食指来表现出微小的距离形容村子。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_d1caa6f9:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Ya chasto.ogg"
    Pol "我很想去大城市生活。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_7745e9a5:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Mogu.ogg"
    Pol "我一般会长时间看地球仪。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_c4b72a08:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Ili zurn.ogg"
    Pol "或者《环绕世界》杂志。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_4bb0a9ad:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Kakie ze tam.ogg"
    Pol "大城市的名称听起来那么美！你听吧："


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_007cf489:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Reik.ogg"
    Pol "雷克雅未克。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_08b872d0:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Telaviv.ogg"
    Pol "特拉维夫。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_b89dae69:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Eto ze.ogg"
    Pol "这不是词，这是音乐啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_831552b6:


    "她眯起眼来，如进入幻想似的，开始旋转。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_ed2e8060:


    "前面出现了高大的森林，接触天上的云朵。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_d89d53d7:


    "森林小路陷入松树中间的阴暗。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_46b6a3fd:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/99 Ya bi mogla.ogg"
    Pol "我会成为一名演员！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_5ce593a5:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/99 Vistupat.ogg"
    Pol "我会在万人面前演奏！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_1b519abc:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/105. A ya scene.ogg"
    Ant "我怕上台。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_fd8d1e50:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/100 Tak ti.ogg"
    Pol "那你不用上台，你的特长是绘画！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_ddcc66e2:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/100 U nas.ogg"
    Pol "你有未来，我有未来，谢苗呢？"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_4a7ee2da:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/100 Nu stanet on.ogg"
    Pol "他只能变得更胖。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_1f98c953:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/100 Nu.ogg"
    Pol "或者……"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_c96b95f1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/106. Cakes.ogg"
    Ant "他会卖馅饼！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_6226c69c:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/101 Aga.ogg"
    Pol "对啊，狗肉馅饼！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_3b065988:


    "我们大声笑了，无忧无虑的快乐使恐慌消失。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_b704b50a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/102 Esli emu.ogg"
    Pol "这世界没有这样的老板会把馅饼委托给谢苗！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_f986c69c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/108 Naverno.ogg"
    Ant "没错！"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_075db58b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/108.2 On ih.ogg"
    Ant "要不然，他会把所有的馅饼一下子都吃掉。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_2d370775:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/103 Ya tak i.ogg"
    Pol "我早就知道，两个人在森林里一点也不害怕。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_09f1b085:


    "我环顾四周。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_38ef6527:


    "雪地上都在闪闪发光，反射着最后一缕阳光。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_9cea0f6c:


    "一想到在这里只有我们两个人，我的脉搏就跳得太快了。"


translate chinese bunny2_polina_win_0dba9375:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/109. Da ti.ogg"
    Ant "对啊。"


translate chinese polwit_c12677a7:


    "突然我听见了灌木丛中有沙沙的声，灌木丛上的雪就掉下来了。"


translate chinese polwit_9dc407dc:


    "一个无赖从灌木丛中出来，关了裤子的拉链。"


translate chinese polwit_5d30dd15:


    "今天早上我在学校旁边见了他。"


translate chinese polwit_e4e72947:


    "他漫不经心地看了我们一眼就走了。"


translate chinese polwit_1348e99f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/104 Nu i tip.ogg"
    Pol "吓了我一跳！"


translate chinese polwit_1b8c24ef:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/104 Horosho.ogg"
    Pol "辛亏你在我身边，安东。"


translate chinese polwit_546e2c2b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/105 Kto znaet.ogg"
    Pol "要是我一个人在这里，谁知道这个强盗会做什么。"


translate chinese polwit_370fc6b9:


    "她用赞赏的目光看着我。"


translate chinese polwit_9d539f1d:


    "无赖走远时，她伸了舌头，大声地笑了。"


translate chinese polwit_857f9658:


    "真是一个调皮的女孩。"


translate chinese polwit_48ec9118:


    "波琳娜顺着林班线走得更快。"


translate chinese polwit_88bdfafe:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/106 Ne ots.ogg"
    Pol "你别落在后面！"


translate chinese polwit_195486cb:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/110. Nikogda.ogg"
    Ant "永远不会……"


translate chinese polwit_b476cf02:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/107 Ti znaesh.ogg"
    Pol "你这样说……"


translate chinese polwit_e3c41d84:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/107 Kak pers.ogg"
    Pol "像一个奇遇小说中的人物一样。"


translate chinese polwit_62713ced:


    "她在恭维我吗？还是在嘲笑我吗？"


translate chinese polwit_b579a1e5:


    "其实，我不想找圈套。我只想享受这神奇的时刻。"


translate chinese polwit_b0ca7352:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/111. Nu da.ogg"
    Ant "也许是因为我很喜欢看书。"


translate chinese polwit_1e0710e9:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/108 Ogo.ogg"
    Pol "嗯，喜欢看书的男人？"


translate chinese polwit_fbe9ea69:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/108 Zvuchit.ogg"
    Pol "真厉害！"


translate chinese polwit_67ce7162:


    "男人？我吗？"


translate chinese polwit_a9f258ec:


    "我羞得脸红了，可是我多次感谢命运让我和波琳娜在一起去森林散步。"


translate chinese polwit_b255c159:


    "她突然打住不说了，看了一排排暗色的高树木，沉思起来。"


translate chinese polwit_5d342243:


    "她好似在等待着什么。"


translate chinese polwit_475af4b4:


    "我就觉得不安全了。"


translate chinese polwit_168dc53b:


    "然后她冷谈地问道："


translate chinese polwit_dc126a8c:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/Te bul.ogg"
    Pol "你去过那里吗？"


translate chinese polwit_e10e0e6d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/112. Gde v.ogg"
    Ant "哪里？森林里吗？"


translate chinese polwit_5e99b1b6:


    "波琳娜笑了，我就如释重负。"


translate chinese polwit_dafb3d59:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/110 Da net.ogg"
    Pol "不是！"


translate chinese polwit_6af67c51:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/110 V bolshom.ogg"
    Pol "我是说大世界！"


translate chinese polwit_55241f66:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/110 V gorodah.ogg"
    Pol "有好听名称的城市你去过吗？"


translate chinese polwit_c261144f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/113 A razve.ogg"
    Ant "莫斯科算是个好听的名称吗？"


translate chinese polwit_84a26135:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/113.2 Bolshe pohoze.ogg"
    Ant "我觉得听起来和蛤蟆的叫声很像。"


translate chinese polwit_58d8b660:


    "波琳娜站住了，用不信任的目光睃了我一下。"


translate chinese polwit_f8819d31:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/111 Ti bil.ogg"
    Pol "你……真的……"


translate chinese polwit_73fd5d2b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/111 V moskve.ogg"
    Pol "……去过莫斯科吗？"


translate chinese polwit_d0e6050b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/114 Nu da.ogg"
    Ant "是啊。"


translate chinese polwit_738751ab:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/114 V detstve.ogg"
    Ant "小时候去过。"


translate chinese polwit_5b1f2df7:


    "波琳娜的眼睛闪闪发光了。"


translate chinese polwit_bbac3451:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/112 I kakaya.ogg"
    Pol "莫斯科是什么样子的？"


translate chinese polwit_6073fe82:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/115 Nu krasivaya.ogg"
    Ant "莫斯科，它是……漂亮的。"


translate chinese polwit_0ec7af38:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/115.2 Shumnaya.ogg"
    Ant "热闹的。"


translate chinese polwit_7e936c00:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/115.3 Neonovaya.ogg"
    Ant "霓虹的。"


translate chinese polwit_3e0de948:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/113 Neon.ogg"
    Pol "霓虹的……"


translate chinese polwit_92c139c9:


    "她好像很喜欢说出这个词。"


translate chinese polwit_e737f6c7:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/114 A na krasn.ogg"
    Pol "那你参观了红场吗？"


translate chinese polwit_61652f84:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/116.1Konechno.ogg"
    Ant "当然了。"


translate chinese polwit_a5ae539a:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/116.2Onatakaya.ogg"
    Ant "红场挺突出的……"


translate chinese polwit_b95b07f8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/117 I v TSUMe.ogg"
    Ant "我还参观了{u}莫斯科中央百货商店{/u}、{u}全俄展览中心{/u}。"


translate chinese polwit_c05b63cc:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/117.2 Mne bolshe vsego.ogg"
    Ant "地铁我最喜欢。"


translate chinese polwit_222f5d05:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/117.3 Tam tak.ogg"
    Ant "地铁上有一种气味……"


translate chinese polwit_4c23a3ee:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/115 Kak.ogg"
    Pol "什么气味？"


translate chinese polwit_ba53a904:


    "她抓住了我的袖子，用求知的眼神看了我。"


translate chinese polwit_cf42bc1b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/118. Ne mogu opisat.ogg"
    Ant "不知道怎么形容它……"


translate chinese polwit_0b5fc37e:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/116 A naris.ogg"
    Pol "你能把它画出来吗？"


translate chinese polwit_89a40157:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/119. Chto zapah.ogg"
    Ant "画什么？画气味吗？"


translate chinese polwit_6ec79742:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/117 Velikie.ogg"
    Pol "伟大的音乐家能演奏气味。"


translate chinese polwit_c7d68fe0:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/120. Ne mozet bit.ogg"
    Ant "怎么可能啊！"


translate chinese polwit_93ea3734:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/118 Ya dam tebe.ogg"
    Pol "我给你几盒录音带，自己去听。"


translate chinese polwit_5c57a48c:


    "她又开始在降雪下旋转着。"


translate chinese polwit_901e57b7:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 ya obyaz.ogg"
    Pol "我一定要去莫斯科。"


translate chinese polwit_43fcacb7:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 A glavnoe.ogg"
    Pol "也一定要去维也纳。"


translate chinese polwit_0068501e:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 Vena.ogg"
    Pol "维也纳是我的理想。"


translate chinese polwit_18689434:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 eto ze.ogg"
    Pol "维也纳是音乐之城！"


translate chinese polwit_8686b5f8:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 mozart.ogg"
    Pol "莫扎特，贝多芬，施特劳斯！"


translate chinese polwit_10a448c4:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 fil.ogg"
    Pol "维也纳爱乐乐团！"


translate chinese polwit_45620cbe:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 gos.ogg"
    Pol "维也纳国家歌剧院！"


translate chinese polwit_23be8083:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 ya budu.ogg"
    Pol "我要成为一名演员，你要成为一名画家！"


translate chinese polwit_b5b0994e:


    "她的狂喜传给了我。"


translate chinese polwit_8739e7ef:


    "我很想做任何伟大的事，越快越好！"


translate chinese polwit_115de91d:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/120 A ti kuda.ogg"
    Pol "你想去哪里？"


translate chinese polwit_60d84e0f:


    "我长叹了一声。"


translate chinese polwit_f725c3bd:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/121.2Vdisney.ogg"
    Ant "迪士尼乐园。"


translate chinese polwit_dcc0d083:


    "我想起了《成功时刻》节目。"


translate chinese polwit_88f252b4:


    "对奥利娅来说，她当然更喜欢《丛林召唤》，而我每个星期一都坐在电视机面前。"


translate chinese polwit_8c9461b3:


    "我很喜欢看《成功时刻》中的颜色不同的桌子，牌子上的数字，有吸引力的苏波涅夫主持人。"


translate chinese polwit_52281a2a:


    "还有奖品！"


translate chinese polwit_8b14e1f2:


    "巧克力蛋、电视录像设备……不过，最珍贵的是迪士尼乐园票。"


translate chinese polwit_31b79b0f:


    "以前父母答应带我去米奇王国，一开始我相信他们会履行诺言，可能他们也相信。"


translate chinese polwit_81ef2d3c:


    "过了一段时间，我问他们什么时候可以去，而他们只默不作声，这让我感到非常委屈。"


translate chinese polwit_6ee57dc7:


    "一句话从我嗓子里冲出："


translate chinese polwit_8c45de4d:


    "你们不是答应我了吗！！！"


translate chinese polwit_77866be3:


    "波琳娜好像猜透了我的思想。"


translate chinese polwit_f2136c99:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/121 Dobr.ogg"
    Pol "“其实，到那里去也很容易。"


translate chinese polwit_3c105d21:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/121 Kazd lepit.ogg"
    Pol "每个人都是自己命运的主宰者。"


translate chinese polwit_ea43b118:


    "她抓起一把雪，用两手攥成雪球。"


translate chinese polwit_f64fb93a:


    "她突然忘记了一切，偷偷地笑了，仿佛有阴谋。"


translate chinese polwit_b1f85583:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/122 A davai.ogg"
    Pol "咱们堆雪人吧！"


translate chinese polwit_e775cd50:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/122. Davai.ogg"
    Ant "好！"


translate chinese polwit_70497e60:


    "我回家的时候一定给奥利娅堆一个好看的雪人，让她开心！"


translate chinese polwit_d095638e:


    "现在呢……"


translate chinese polwit_75be5b2b:


    "我们在一起滚着一个大雪球。"


translate chinese polwit_5279da36:


    "波琳娜大声地笑着。"


translate chinese polwit_035edfcf:


    "她的卷发落在她脸上。"


translate chinese polwit_80ae2bbe:


    "她那么优美地撩开它们。"


translate chinese polwit_a584779f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/123. Perviy gotov.ogg"
    Ant "第一个做好了！"


translate chinese polwit_fbaad398:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/123 Ha-ha.ogg"
    Pol "哈哈哈！"


translate chinese polwit_0784aa2d:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/123 Chego u tebya.ogg"
    Pol "安东，你的雪球为什么这么小！"


translate chinese polwit_bd6479e0:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/123 Maksimum.ogg"
    Pol "这只是雪人的头。"


translate chinese polwit_b48b1597:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/123 Bolshe.ogg"
    Pol "不行，多点滚吧！"


translate chinese polwit_2e212c7a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/123 Ne lenis.ogg"
    Pol "别偷懒啊！"


translate chinese polwit_5b3d982b:


    "我已经忘记了，上次这么开心是什么时候了。"


translate chinese polwit_31fee177:


    "波琳娜用手套擦了一下鲜红的嘴唇。"


translate chinese polwit_cbc67648:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/124 Ti mechtal.ogg"
    Pol "你想不想在其他行星上居住？"


translate chinese polwit_05d20f7b:


    "她的眼神里微微露出了一种意味……我看不出来了。"


translate chinese polwit_87db763e:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/124. I daze v.ogg"
    Ant "想。我想在别的宇宙居住。"


translate chinese polwit_75c73913:


    "波琳娜好像轻松了一些。"


translate chinese polwit_cbc6bc24:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/125 Togda.ogg"
    Pol "那你能理解我。"


translate chinese polwit_b3548851:


    "我的手掌在雪球上滑动，使它变得平滑。"


translate chinese polwit_b2be2a2f:


    "几乎完善的白球出现在林中旷地中。"


translate chinese polwit_012895b9:


    "然后我们做好了第二个雪球。"


translate chinese polwit_07d826e5:


    "我们把它拿起来，放在最大的雪球上。"


translate chinese polwit_3f34225e:


    "终于波琳娜把第三个雪球搬到雪人的身体上。"


translate chinese polwit_eb1e6099:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/126 Stavit golovu.ogg"
    Pol "我最善于把雪人的头部插在它身体上！"


translate chinese polwit_65ccbf43:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/127 U tebya.ogg"
    Pol "你有没有胡萝卜？"


translate chinese polwit_2b97436c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/125. Uvi.ogg"
    Ant "没有啊！"


translate chinese polwit_477d2def:


    "在这个地方没有恐惧，也没有惊慌。"


translate chinese polwit_77340426:


    "为了折下树枝，我毫不犹豫地跑到了一排灌木丛。"


translate chinese polwit_a79879ee:


    "我刚扳断了一根树枝时，就听到了波琳娜叫我。"


translate chinese polwit_6f3f9132:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/128 Anton.ogg"
    Pol "安东！"


translate chinese polwit_d1753637:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/123 Tam kto-to.ogg"
    Pol "有人在那里。"


translate chinese polwit_ba085bd5:


    "我回头了，十分慌张。"


translate chinese polwit_5ec5eb86:


    "波琳娜看了我……不……她看了我背后。"


translate chinese polwit_c6adadf6:


    "一边看，一边皱眉。"


translate chinese polwit_247c210f:


    "愉快心情彻底地消失了。"


translate chinese polwit_8afc8acc:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/126. Polin.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜，你怎么了？"


translate chinese polwit_1b46e1e0:


    "她慢慢地伸出手，指树木后边的黑暗。"


translate chinese polwit_852dfe47:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/129 Vperedi.ogg"
    Pol "有一个人在那里站着。"


translate chinese polwit_a6248685:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/130 Temnaya.ogg"
    Pol "驼背的黑色人影，你看到了吗？"


translate chinese polwit_255c9712:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/131 I ruch.ogg"
    Pol "还用大手摸着松树……"


translate chinese polwit_0f5ff8d8:


    "我转过来了，看了看她指的方向。"


translate chinese polwit_4da3df4f:


    "那里只是一簇干枯的悬钩子丛。"


translate chinese polwit_56515183:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/128. Tam nikogo.ogg"
    Ant "没有人在那里。"


translate chinese polwit_75c7fb6b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/132 Ono spr.ogg"
    Pol "他躲起来了……"


translate chinese polwit_1342b00f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/132 Za derevom.ogg"
    Pol "躲在树后了。"


translate chinese polwit_a1fe7e9c:


    "我突然觉得不舒服。我不由自主地使领口变松一点。"


translate chinese polwit_e2e32f11:


    "焦虑让我肚子疼。"


translate chinese polwit_6b204546:


    "我对波琳娜不自信地笑了，带着微弱的希望问道："


translate chinese polwit_0597318f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/129. Eto chto.ogg"
    Ant "你在开玩笑吧？"


translate chinese polwit_ad57de9b:


    "波琳娜好像发呆了，她目不转睛地看着黑暗的森林。"


translate chinese polwit_efdeaf20:


    "我判断这是一次“勇气的考验”，就向发亮的黑色树身迈步，波琳娜的眼神好像推着我似的。"


translate chinese polwit_a402947c:


    "我尽量勇敢一点，不过内心的声音叫我发呆、蜷成一团、甚至装死，为了不去那片黑暗，任何办法都可以。"


translate chinese polwit_94623773:


    "黄昏环绕着我，每一秒更加紧贴在我身边。"


translate chinese polwit_7c8496ba:


    "这片林中旷地仿佛是一口几乎没有阳光的水井。"


translate chinese polwit_88b1023a:


    "我听见空气发出鸣叫声。或是我耳朵里有鸣叫的声音。"


translate chinese polwit_0b5edcd3:


    "一步。"


translate chinese polwit_c4ac9dab:


    "另一步。"


translate chinese polwit_7d6046f8:


    "为了避免失声尖叫，我闭紧嘴唇了。"


translate chinese polwit_a20cefa7:


    "……"


translate chinese polwit_b0abf2df:


    "松树后没有人。"


translate chinese polwit_b4d8ae49:


    "我松了一口气。"


translate chinese polwit_9653394c:


    "我又向波琳娜回头了。"


translate chinese polwit_900f8b71:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/131. Polina zdes.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜，这里什么都没……"


translate chinese polwit_1170abd4:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/28 Nu z.ogg"
    Sem "好久不见了，安东！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_01d7ef1c:


    "冷笑的谢苗和他的叽叽嘎嘎着的匪帮，像一群野蛮人一样，从松树后面的黑暗中走出来。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_1170abd4:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/28 Nu z.ogg"
    Sem "好久不见了，安东！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_8735b32d:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/02 Opaczki.ogg"
    Noname "又是你啊！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_74d32c97:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/01 Haha.ogg"
    Noname "哈哈，逃不了了，是吧？"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_009f2b9f:



    voice "voice/byasha/01 Ochkarik.ogg"
    Noname "哼，你这个屌丝！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_efaaa9d1:


    "他们不使波琳娜退步时，我听见她吓得发出啊呀声。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_de66bb9e:


    "他们像一群猛兽一样环绕我，使我后退。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_713f245e:


    "肥胖的谢苗用自己的脚把雪人的肚子撞破。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_569e76f4:


    "雪人就摔倒了，变成一片雪堆，其上面还竖立着一根被折断的树枝。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_88558ff9:


    "波琳娜委屈得叫了一声。我眼里冒出怒火。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_5da9838b:


    "我闻到了一股汗臭味和烟味。嘴里突然变酸了，如我舔了一节干电池似的。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_be43a959:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/132. Polin ne.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜，别怕！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_6daf3eb8:


    "听到自己的声音，我打了个颤抖。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_89a7099b:


    "我的声音听起来很不自然、很威胁。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_e8dfa7ab:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/Polinketoche.ogg"
    Sem "波琳娜有什么可怕的？"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_477fece6:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/Luchshezasebya.ogg"
    Sem "你担心自己吧。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_2d735436:


    "胖子往地上吐痰了，然后他用力把我推开了，我就撞到树上了。" with vpunch


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_2ed49e99:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/Nukak.ogg"
    Sem "怎么样？"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_cd866394:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/Strashno.ogg"
    Sem "你这个王八蛋，害怕吧？"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_21bc91aa:


    "波琳娜生气地说："


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_82b88b71:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/133 Ne trogaite.ogg"
    Pol "放开他！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_f927f816:


    "我宁愿波琳娜不在这个地方。我宁愿她没看见我蒙受耻辱。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_2180734f:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/04 Gljadite1.ogg"
    Noname "哥们儿你们看！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_98ef1af6:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/08 Devczonk.ogg"
    Noname "女孩还保护他！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_8b16d569:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/79. Alisa.ogg"
    Ant "阿狸萨！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_c1d97656:


    "说出来她的名字时，我嗓子像被勒住似的。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_be7dcc4f:


    "松树像一排不说话的守卫者在风中摇摆。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_1e0d4913:


    "我的目光迅速向四边移动掠过。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_a4265965:


    "我希望小狐狸就在树木后，我希望她会来救我的。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_cfc8d94e:


    "不过，只有冷风在我身边。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_f060e551:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/79 Gde Alisa.ogg"
    Ant "阿狸萨呢？！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_5050f261:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/79.2 Chto vi s nei.ogg"
    Ant "你们都对她做了些什么？！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_6daf3eb8_1:


    "听到自己的声音，我打了个颤抖。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_89a7099b_1:


    "我的声音听起来很不自然、很威胁。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_34b67724:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/29 Kaka.ogg"
    Sem "你说什么？"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_69eacfc0:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/30 U te.ogg"
    Sem "你疯了吧?"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_f5b0b29f:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/31 Ne s.ogg"
    Sem "那我们来治好你。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_2d735436_1:


    "胖子往地上吐痰了，然后他用力把我推开了，我就撞到树上了。" with vpunch


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_74fc2e4c:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/33 Nu k.ogg"
    Sem "怎么样？好多了吧？"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_32fd4ca3:


    "难道……"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_7d3d00b8:


    "难道阿狸萨故意地把我诱入这些混蛋的陷阱吗？"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_13ec2d9e:


    "不，我不信，我不愿意信！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_252ee034:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/04 Gljadite.ogg"
    Noname "伙计们，你们看他现在的样子！他现在没有以前那么勇敢吧。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_8f4ab773:



    voice "voice/byasha/07 Aga syk.ogg"
    Noname "“对啊，他是个懦夫。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_ad3a4118:



    voice "voice/byasha/08 Aga vylit.ogg"
    Noname "“对啊，他真是个懦夫。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_96fb8776:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/35 Ty.ogg"
    Sem "外来的混蛋，我告诉你，你扬手想打我，就该死！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_534cfe4b:


    "他向我迈步，扬起手要打我。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_8db0f518:


    "穿运动裤子的流氓突然吹了大声口哨，谢苗就把手放下。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_ef72abb2:


    "我忽然明白了，这团伙的头子不是巴布林。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_45d2d9e9:


    "其实他们都听从这个牙齿尖的小伙子，他和一只小猛兽很像。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_ef9a6549:


    "他们先不打我。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_29155e29:


    "也许他们打算先在波琳娜的眼前侮辱我一会儿。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_ee4931cf:


    "糟了！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_306f9e66:


    "也许他们打算先侮辱我一会儿。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_2b1a839c:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/09 Slysh G.ogg"
    Noname "彼得罗夫傻屄！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_b552cc76:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/11 A eto k.ogg"
    Noname "这是谁呀？另一个女朋友吧？"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_1433f935:



    voice "voice/byasha/09 Da y tebya.ogg"
    Noname "哼，他有好几个情妇啊！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_87ac0945:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/10 Eto czt.ogg"
    Noname "这就是你的阿狸萨吧？"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_eed0bde3:


    "我发现，浑身发抖的如利卡站在我身边, 雪花粘在它的毛上。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_f85fd728:


    "它可能根据气味找到了我们。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_e4228ec2:


    "流氓蹲下去了，叫它过来。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_2640caea:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/12 Oi ty.ogg"
    Noname "哎呀，有跳蚤的婊子！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_72b0ce06:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/Ko mne.ogg"
    Noname "你过来，过来！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_48c566b1:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/13 Alisa.ogg"
    Noname "阿狸萨！你过来，过来！"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_be74fa20:


    "他的朋友恶笑了。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_f660b5e7:


    "如利卡竖起耳朵，舔了一下自己的嘴唇，开始小心翼翼地走过来。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_8cd365bd:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/14 Idi sud.ogg"
    Noname "过来，过来，我给你个东西吃……"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_9bfa657e:


    "如利卡没嗅到他的恶谋。罗马抓住了它的耳朵，用力踢了狗，踢得很远，可怜的狗就凄凉地吠叫起来。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_b584050e:


    "他们都发出一阵狂笑，而我惊惶失色。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_88b5544d:


    "连站在树枝上的几只鸟儿都吓得发出一鸣叫。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_b584050e_1:


    "他们都发出一阵狂笑，而我惊惶失色。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_88b5544d_1:


    "连站在树枝上的几只鸟儿都吓得发出一鸣叫。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_f50ab7e8:


    "我看了波琳娜一眼，就发现她的表情有点奇怪。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_487ea73e:


    "波琳娜强忍住不笑。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_5e166d6c:


    "难道她真的那么讨厌狗吗？难道这流氓对如利卡的残忍行为让她开心吗？"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_a83d3c3c:


    "我们的目光相遇时，波琳娜脸上的满意的微笑就消失了，变成了忧虑的表情。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_58a1ae21:


