translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_6983eae7:


    "这副面具显得越来越恶心了，不过……"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_23d7ef21:


    "它好像会救我的。"


translate chinese bunny_day2_gop_stop_9fef170b:


