    "他用力握了握我的手，我的手指就疼了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_29c4b1cf:


    "他手掌上的干茧子证明他穿运动服是有原因的。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_899f6c73:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/83 Eto vot.ogg"
    Rom "他叫拜莎。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_c1f18472:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/84 Ty ne o.ogg"
    Rom "你别担心。我们俩来处理猪头的这件事。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_1dd6d534:


    "他朝我呼出了烟雾，我就咳嗽了起来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_cef43606:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/177. Aga.ogg"
    Ant "好的……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_097617f1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/178. Poidu poka.ogg"
    Ant "天快要黑了，我去捡东西。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_e4a45acc:


    "我弯下腰去捡起自己的书包，希望我转过来的时候新的朋友会消失。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_f5fcdb80:


    "不过，他们还在附近，互相递烟。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_bd53cfdc:


    "他们俩在松树的背景下十分小，一点小火在他们之间慢慢飞行。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_bf28edab:


    "他们等着我把所有的课本放在书包里，而且互相窃窃私语着。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b6b061c6:


    "说话的主要是罗马，而拜莎只是抽了抽鼻子，赞同地咕哝着。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_0556e651:


    "被薄薄的雪覆盖的笔记本旁边，我突然又看到了破烂的兔子面具。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_f64b1a50:


    "其面上的两个小孔可以用任何眼睛来代替，不过……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_41569510:


    "……这幅面具好像想要的眼睛就是我的。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_a8213903:


    "它到底是怎么出现在我的书包里呢？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_3198c0bc:


    "我把面具小心翼翼地捡起来了，仿佛害怕它会咬我的指头。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_2ed24492:


    "这不过是一幅普通的新年面具，背面有冻结的唾液。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_cc06ee58:


    "但是这幅面具好像有点奇怪。仿佛在一层破烂的纸里面蠕动着什么东西……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_5eb4cad8:


    "我能听一千微小的身体在里面沙沙作响。我感到面具毛不停地微颤。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_a498dfdd:


    "仿佛里面有什么东西努力咬出一个洞……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_e4de1e7d:


    "蛆虫！"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_c7c98b72:


    Rom "托哈，你怎么了？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_fe0caa39:


    "罗马的声音把我从可怕的幻觉中拉出来了，我就把面具扔到远处。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_bf3a9288:


    "我感到十分厌恶，但是我不露声色。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_d1cc3366:


    "我不管那些蛆虫是真实的还是虚幻的。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_316549bd:


    "一天之内发生了太多事。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_58668889:


    "我只是想尽快回家。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_23706aa1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/179. Ladno pacani.ogg"
    Ant "好了，伙计们，我该走了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b1a1f097:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/179. Do svidania.ogg"
    Ant "明天见。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_98f6883b:


    "我举起手，朝两个身影挥挥手。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_71349d61:


    "隐约的身影在我面前微微发抖。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_91e7911f:


    "什么都没说，只是盯着我看。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_008ed2d1:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/91 S kedra.ogg"
    Rom "你是想和树木交朋友吧？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b210712d:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/92 My zdes.ogg"
    Rom "我们就在这里啊。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_ec84b7fb:


    "罗马的声音从我背后传来，我就转过来，感觉十分尴尬。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_61db9672:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/93 Derevja.ogg"
    Rom "树木不会是好哥们儿吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_42ab2d94:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/94 Ty ne s.ogg"
    Rom "别担心，小瞎子，我们送你回家。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_a2e8ec02:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/95 Tak zde.ogg"
    Rom "不然你就会在这里迷路的。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b712ac22:


    "罗马把烟头扔到树墩上，一股小火花落在我脚下，就在雪地上发出嘶嘶声。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_6652a67c:


    "同学虚伪地笑了笑，扶着我的胳膊肘带我走。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_c0b726b4:


    "我转过身来，希望看到阿狸萨。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_5f44799f:


    "至少希望看到红色的身影。不过……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_644c9f5b:


    "我只是在远处看到了一辆轰隆隆的拖拉机。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_7b48e87b:


    "突然一个人影从我们面前的薄雾中走出来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_c827a860:


    "我们闪开了， 给他让路。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_233df09d:


    "因为这时候天色已经接近黄昏，还有我的视力不好了，所以我以为我看到了一个在空气中漂浮着的幽灵。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_38b15fc7:


    "可是人影靠近时，我就看出来了那是一个男人。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_672c12e2:


    "他的结实身材看起来很熟悉。我早上见过他，他那时在学校庭院里吸烟。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_dbce75d4:


    "男人用冷静的眼神看了我们一眼，便继续向前走，进了阴暗中。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_6af86d3c:



    voice "voice/byasha/62 Net gorba.ogg"
    Bya "没有驼峰，有兔唇。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b2c94e30:


    "我恐怕陌生人会听到拜莎嘲弄他，可是他已经走了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_7120b42b:


    "我们继续向前走。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_f7e38210:


    "我们默默地在静静的路上走。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_c451acd0:


    "沉默和部分失明使我感到难受，所以我开始说话了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_f5f5e69c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/180. A pochemu tebya Byasha.ogg"
    Ant "拜莎，你为什么叫这个名字呢？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_43a68335:


    "布里亚特人傻笑了一下。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_6010c708:



    voice "voice/byasha/63 Potomu chto.ogg"
    Bya "因为我是个披着羊皮的狼。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_6be5f1e4:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/96 Breshesh.ogg"
    Rom "胡说！"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_8d033f1a:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/97 Purgu g.ogg"
    Rom "他只不过是个骗子。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_f799a7f3:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/98 A zvat.ogg"
    Rom "他叫拜莎因为他总是像羊一样咩咩叫。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_93f7816c:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/99  vse po.ogg"
    Rom "他从黑色车库里活着逃出来了，就变成这个样子了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_ae4e5891:


    "拜莎一听罗马的话，就紧张极了；连视力差的我都注意到了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_69e63210:


    "拜莎往后一躲。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_9cf7b284:


    "发出一阵含糊不清的呻吟。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_a14a1419:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/100 Vidish.ogg"
    Rom "明白了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_964d308d:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/101 S nim.ogg"
    Rom "一说这件事，他就这样。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_07facfd8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/180. Ti seichas o chem.ogg"
    Ant "什么事？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_489212b3:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/102 Ty ser.ogg"
    Rom "这个鬼故事你没听过吗？那我来讲。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_185210ca:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/103 Na czer.ogg"
    Rom "黑黑的路上……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b3225d1c:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/104 V czern.ogg"
    Rom "……黑黑的角落里……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_2869adaf:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/105 Stoit.ogg"
    Rom "有一个黑黑的车库。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_cbd773d1:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/106 I on z.ogg"
    Rom "它知道你的一切。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_fdd6e51f:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/107 Gde ty.ogg"
    Rom "你住在哪儿，你喜欢什么，你的朋友是谁，它都知道。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_756281a4:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/108 Navern.ogg"
    Rom "你可能听说过失踪孩子的事情。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_c3eefdb2:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/109 Eto tu.ogg"
    Rom "这也不是第一次了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_60de5a2a:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/110 Vse me.ogg"
    Rom "本地人都知道是谁干的。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_545054cb:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/111 Dazhe v.ogg"
    Rom "连大人都知道。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_4904bfaa:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/112 Voobscze.ogg"
    Rom "你住在森林附近，算是幸运。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_2c206a21:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/113 On k t.ogg"
    Rom "它不会直接去找你。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_7f9e7b83:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/114 Tupo s.ogg"
    Rom "因为它知道，森林里它不会伪装起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_8b79d365:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/115 A u na.ogg"
    Rom "可是在我们的村子里它哪儿都可以等着，有的时候它在路的尽头，有的时候它在房子附近。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_69041d24:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/116 A escze.ogg"
    Rom "还有……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_14e83af4:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/117 Idesh.ogg"
    Rom "晚上一个人会走路，突然发现……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b4c366c3:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/119 On sto.ogg"
    Rom "它就在面前，不过那个地方几秒前什么都没有。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_ad69d281:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/120 Dver.ogg"
    Rom "门打开了，里面都是黑暗……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b8f30a65:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/121 I tut.ogg"
    Rom "然后呢……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_a3239fa3:


    "拜莎把自己藏在兜帽底下，为了淹没罗马说话声他绝望地嗥叫起来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_212a4d2e:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/122 Ladno.ogg"
    Rom "好，不说了，不说了……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_3f27bb64:


    "罗马讲的故事把我搞糊涂了、使我困惑不解。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_8e180c07:


    "虽然我在这个落后的地方住的时间还不长，有一点我深信不疑：不少本地人见过难以解释的东西。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_9245ac65:


    "我看了发抖的拜莎一眼。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_6e5c4e92:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/123 Toha.ogg"
    Rom "托哈，你家干嘛搬到这里来了？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_692ceb69:


    "我叹气了，眼睛向下看。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_6bff22dd:


    "我的鞋头在下方远处戳着薄雾。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_ed274b63:


    "我以已经准备好的话来回答他的问题了："


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_8371c138:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/182 U otca tut.ogg"
    Ant "我的父亲在这里有了新的工作。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_7250502b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/182.2 I mama v poselke.ogg"
    Ant "还有我妈曾经在这里住过。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_e3e7713d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/182.3 Davno eshe.ogg"
    Ant "就是苏联的时候。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_45e818b1:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/124 Zdes.ogg"
    Rom "这个地方没有什么好玩儿的，人人在这里只会腐烂。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_6e2047eb:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/125 Nu ili.ogg"
    Rom "或者跟拜莎一样在树林里荡来荡去。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_8f021e81:


    "拜莎像蜗牛一样小心地从兜帽里探出头来，开始听。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_11501faf:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/126 On u n.ogg"
    Rom "他是个旅行者。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_be1bc299:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/127 Letom.ogg"
    Rom "暑假的时候他一个星期都住在帐篷里。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_72d4a879:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/128 Zdes.ogg"
    Rom "离这里不远。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_bcef23dc:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/129 Prikin.ogg"
    Rom "你信不信？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_92c13077:


    Rom "……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_01791731:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/130 Hotja o.ogg"
    Rom "不过他妈真是一个疯子，要是我是他，我也会逃到森林去。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_bb82fa86:


    "我们继续走，不过在我的眼睛中是森林从我们身边走过的。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_ae9985ad:


    "整个森林看起来是一个钢琴键盘似的：松树是黑键，树木之间的雪景是白键。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_8a4b5b0a:


    "树林用树根、洞穴、荒地都在弹奏着其古老的吱吱呀呀的音乐。 "


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_cbac9c4b:


    "漂浮的雪花造成一种可怕的错觉。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_6f52ec50:


    "似乎有人在森林里游荡着……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_1ff52176:


    "似乎那个人很高，神出鬼没，也随时准备装扮成树木或者雪堆。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_cfd8f59c:


    "然后他会等一会儿便继续沿着路走。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_06a9c40c:


    "但是这只不过是明暗效果。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_a5353a12:


    "至少我这么想。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_184b781e:


    "罗马突然停下来了，说道：" with hpunch


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_1c3d60f6:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/131 Slyshte.ogg"
    Rom "你们听见了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_d1a91e5c:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/132 V lesu.ogg"
    Rom "好像有人……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_25cbe576:


    "我就觉得浑身痒、肚子疼。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_fad29874:


    "我们朝罗马指的方向看去"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_06c2021e:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/133 Vysocze.ogg"
    Rom "他很高，好像跟着我们走……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b1dbda19:


    "松树后没有什么高达的人。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_14104841:


    "只有躲在暮色中的影子。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_1d523daa:


    "有的影子很慢。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b69aff44:


    "有的影子很快。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_25d7293d:


    "它们都是饥饿的。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_9bfe9d35:


    "一团雪从树枝上掉了下来，我不禁打了个哆嗦，咬住嘴唇。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_f7fa7b28:


    "仿佛巨大的东西从树枝上飞走了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b84a43be:


    "也许它飞到我们这里……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_873b97e3:


    "罗马从地上捡起来了一个球果，把它扔到树林里。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_99f231e0:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/135 Ei A.ogg"
    Rom "喂！"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_eac1aec3:


    "罗马的叫声仿佛敲了一下硬鼓。回声捉弄了罗马。然后森林里又变得鸦雀无声了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_072c35c8:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/136 Ktoni.ogg"
    Rom "看见了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_a035379b:


    "我摇了摇头。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_62e6f95b:


    "除了模糊中的高树、黑暗、雪地和同学，我什么都没看见。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_db2f5211:


    "我不知不觉地想到了粗糙的树干、海绵似的地衣、沟底上的碎冰。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_8dd176a9:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/183. Poiemte skoree.ogg"
    Ant "时间不早了，咱们走吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_87005117:


    "他们又扶着我的胳膊肘带我走，突出来的树枝出现在我们的前面。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_cb5c6cf8:


    "太阳逐渐落山了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_73d98c4f:


    "黑暗开始移动，像烟一样弥漫起来了，挺直了肩膀。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_3d62359b:


    "开始下雪了：粘乎乎的雪花像白色的苍蝇一样飞行。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_533ab923:


    "我的视野变成了一个以黑水为界的小岛。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b6838310:


    "我心里又不安了，真像这天早上一样。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_c6ba3fb9:


    "我有一种感觉，仿佛在我知觉的边界上传来了媚惑的笛声。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_1d087d00:


    "那个笛声如早春湖面上的冰一样脆弱。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_f2414aa4:


    "我把手指塞进耳朵里，以消除幻听。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_40636bdb:


    "森林里都是很安静。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_ff4b1c55:


    "我想到了一个男孩走在黑暗的路上，有窟窿的松树看着他。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_f4410d0e:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/184 A vi znali Vovu.ogg"
    Ant "你们认知沃瓦·马秋金吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_d5a5576b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/184.2 Malchika.ogg"
    Ant "那个迷踪的男孩？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_0f524bc3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/170 A razve mi.ogg"
    Alis "我们不是在找他吗，宝贝？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_44bc6438:


    "我打了个哆嗦，看了身边的人。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_ab2cea12:


    "那就是阿狸萨，依然戴着狐狸面具。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_c5a620c9:


    "她小心翼翼地抓住我的胳膊肘。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_505e3dea:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/185 Chto ti zdes.ogg"
    Ant "你怎么在这里……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_8e6d0bc7:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/185.2 A ved ya tebya.ogg"
    Ant "我以为我丢了你！"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_a48cf966:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/171 Poteryal.ogg"
    Alis "你出神了，怪不得丢了我。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_aa8e4c81:


    "我怀疑地挑起眉头。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_eefd0830:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/186. I davno ti.ogg"
    Ant "那你在我们的后面走了多久？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_d43d298f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/172 Chto znachit.ogg"
    Alis "什么“多久”啊？我一直在你身边。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_3064b6a3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/173 Da i za kem.ogg"
    Alis "谁是“我们”呢？这里不是只有咱们两个人吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_51b47db5:


    "我困惑地看了看四周，不过没看到了罗马或者拜莎。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_b6332857:


    "我突然感到了阿狸萨冰冷的手指碰到了我的手腕上。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_06d34b14:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/175 Poidem ze.ogg"
    Alis "咱们走吧！"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_ec61eda0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/176 Mi sobiralis.ogg"
    Alis "我们要去找沃瓦。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_ae43ff29:


    "我还没反应过来，她就拉我去森林。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_bea472f0:


    "空气中弥漫着桔子、咖啡和鞭炮的气味。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_9f002560:


    "我觉得自己是一个驶向未知的小孩子。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_1cad1652:


    "面前的树干发黑。冰冻的灌木丛像生气的豪猪一样竖起枝尖。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_d69826cb:


    "在我们的前面出现了一个直角的东西，看起来和一个巨大的盒子很像。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_43e61e33:


    "我发呆了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_0f211cbe:


    "我摸到了眼睛，把眼皮拉开来调整视力。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_bc576b5b:


    "一个金属车库直接从枯枝断树里长起来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_952696a2:


    "这个车库又重又大，肯定不会容易被运到的。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_e8587be8:


    "它的外墙涂成黑色，比周围的一片黑暗还黑。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_e0b2c667:


    "狐狸闻了闻空气，她的面具好像皱起了眉头。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_2053d623:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/178 Eto zdes.ogg"
    Alis "就在这里。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_8eac20d9:


    "她听起来好像是被什么吓到的，这比那个可怕的大铁盒子更让我害怕。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_e2412f53:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/187. Zdes.ogg"
    Ant "你什么意思？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_0a8397b2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/179 Ya slishu.ogg"
    Alis "我闻到他的气味……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_39a5a7de:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/180 Mozet Vova.ogg"
    Alis "可能沃瓦和我们捉迷藏，而且决定躲在……"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_7266f5fb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/181 Vnutri.ogg"
    Alis "……里面吧？"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_d0695642:


    "我好像看见车库挺直了轻烟的触须，用那些触须开始在腐烂的树叶中摸索寻找什么。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_182847f0:


    "烟雾过了雪地，在我们的脚下蔓延。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_480ca195:


    "车库黑色的大门后传来了可怕的金属般的摩擦声。"


translate chinese bunny2_skip_mask_c88f0415:


    "某个人还是某个东西显然在里面等着我们。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_950579da:


    "也许，我从外面看起来像一个被操控的提线木偶一样。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_e7c0e990:


    "我靠近了车库，屏住呼吸……"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_b5a3da3d:


    "……轻轻地敲了敲铁板门。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f1dda148:


    "敲一敲……"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_831ee8f2:


    "然后我就吓得往后跳了回来。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_64dbadc6:


    "一瞬间内，我好像听见车库里面有某个东西或者某个人痛苦地呻吟着。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_6a706cf2:


    "我听到了生锈的肉钩响了起来。仿佛某个巨大的东西醒来了，来开黑门。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_3e56b6ec:


    "什么都没发生。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_d79a6686:


    "我的心跳开始加快。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f5b87a6f:


    "什么都没有。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_42c1b8f5:


    "扑通扑通。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_e14ce0c4:


    "我害怕转过来，所以盯着车库慢慢地往后退了一步。我很想叫阿狸萨过来……{w=2.5}{nw}"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_9e89f1d7:


    "{i}“快跑！”{/i} 内心的声音胆怯地说。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_bbd21498:


    "我跌跌撞撞地穿过充满影子的黑暗猛跑。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_11f76479:


    "我跑过折断的落叶松时，还以为阿狸萨跟着我跑。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f4b36938:


    "不过，很快我就发现，她消失了。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_e81c15df:


    "森林一直在低声重复着其古代的祈祷。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_06a5aa43:


    "森林不停地发出嘎吱、滴答、沙沙声音。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_c6c99ca7:


    "我呆住了。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_3e5c2a3d:


    "不知道过了多长时间，我才意识到了，在一片漆黑和耸立的大树中只有我一个人。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f4abafc0:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/165. Moi ochki (Polina).ogg"
    Ant "我的眼镜……"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_743d3052:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/99 CZto.ogg"
    Sem "没有眼镜就是瞎子吧？"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_bc454ad6:


    "他拿着我的眼镜举起手，举得那么高我就够不到。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_111e2c6f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/166. Otdai seychas.ogg"
    Ant "还给我！把眼镜还给……"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_97c49d61:


    "他的拳不让我说完，尖形的戒指撞在我的眉毛上，使我掉在冰冷地上。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f674a3f6:


    "我感到头晕目眩，他们的模糊的面子，幸灾乐祸的笑声让我觉得恶心。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f57bf705:


    "我一苏醒过来，模糊的人影就开始快速走近我……"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_4613151b:


    "……但是这人影没打我，而是向我伸出手。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_687e0004:


    "我希望那只手是波琳娜的，所以像落水者抓到一根稻草一样抓住它，可是就明白了自己错了，因为那手掌上有很多老趼。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_53af4e0a:


    "那是罗马。他帮我站起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_ebdcca3f:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/137 Pravda.ogg"
    Rom "你的视力真有那么不好吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_1a5ef9fe:


    "他的声音好像充满同情感，我就觉得很奇怪。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_b8795d3c:


    "我眯缝眼睛，试着在这片模糊中看到波琳娜。她从地上拣起我的本子，把它们放在我的书包里。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_ca5c339e:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/138 A slysh.ogg"
    Rom "你的听力呢？"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_0e71eb80:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/167. A.ogg"
    Ant "啊？"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_427dbd0a:


    "他丢掉假的友善，俯身问了我："


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_840258df:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/139 Slyshish.ogg"
    Rom "安托沙，你的听力好吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_91e569b8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/168. Da.ogg"
    Ant "是的……"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_abe52c88:


    "我摸不着头脑，眨了一次眼睛。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_051f43b6:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/140 Nu tak.ogg"
    Rom "那你听我说。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_5a9fe47f:


    "他抖掉了我大衣上的雪。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_454b3747:


    "然后一下子打了我的颧骨。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_8cab7c2c:


    "我的下巴磕了一下，要是舌头被牙齿咬伤，那我不仅视力不好，而且说话说得比拜莎还不清楚。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_1c9a17df:


    "这世界又像一个陀螺一样，一切都在眼前旋转起来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_c6a466c4:


    "我听见波琳娜尖叫了一声。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_8ee978df:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/139 Anton (gde-to).ogg"
    Pol "安东！"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_27a40414:


    "拜莎从她背后紧紧地抱住她，不让她向我跑来。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_3d07a8c3:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/142 Eto te.ogg"
    Rom "这只是一个警告。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_cfa452ad:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/143 Escze ra.ogg"
    Rom "要是我再见到你在波琳娜身边，那你就死定了。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_86ff8c63:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/144 Ty pon.ogg"
    Rom "懂了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_2056bb64:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/170. D-da.ogg"
    Ant "懂了……"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_b00d226a:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/145 CZisto.ogg"
    Rom "这是复习。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_ad51b1a0:


    "他一拳打到我太阳穴上了。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_ce6a2458:


    "世界翻倒了。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_7c9f0285:


    "我好像掉了在腐烂肉色的天上。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_dd0e1f8e:


    "为了不翻一个跟头，我抓住了树根。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_907d4984:


    "我的知觉仿佛是一个放气的气球在深渊面上晃来晃去，逐渐沉入水底。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_a79a0681:


    "我试图站起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_df1125e6:


    "波琳娜的模糊人神影推开着两个人，可是他们牵着她的双手把她领走。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_d12dae17:



    voice "voice/byasha/Mi domoi.ogg"
    Bya "你别怕，我们送你回家啊。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_7b91bab2:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/100 Mal.ogg"
    Sem "对啊，一个人在森林里太危险了。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_1de1a736:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/146 A Tosha.ogg"
    Rom "安托沙他休息一会儿……"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_aa4f5c26:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/171. Polina (Tosha).ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜！"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_eb22fe14:


    "罗马踢了我的额头上一脚。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_e6f47010:


    "我的手一滑，后脑碰到地上了。眼珠子往上翻了。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_21b04505:


    "黑暗从灌木丛中跳出来，就僵住了。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_fa3cbbdf:


    "然后把我吃掉了。"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_a20cefa7:


    "……"


translate chinese bunny2_fox_garage_dev_a1266d00:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/142. Semen.ogg"
    Ant "哎呦……哎呦……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9bf61907:


    "我翻了一下身，在枕头上蹭鼻子。眼皮困得睁不开。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_aebc9ab4:


    "墙上挂着画儿。屋里有一些书。还有一摞漫画书。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5c8173b8:


    "我用手摸了摸自己的下巴，怕下巴会疼。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_281a6b55:


    "然后我触及太阳穴。我头上连一个包都没长，也没有疼痛感。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_11b18b13:


    "我觉得奇怪，慢悠悠地从床上站了起来。我整理了眼镜。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e9b0b5c2:


    "我看了看自己的手。我的手比较干净，指甲里面也没有血迹。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2f658558:


    "书包在桌子旁边的地板上休息。门外传来谈话声。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1fc526ce:


    "我在自己的卧室里。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e28c8691:


    "我是自己回来的吗？眼镜呢？难道是谢苗把眼镜拿回来吗？或是波琳娜？或是一个陌生人？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_df8657a1:


    "我决定自己不去想这件事，走到窗前，看了看窗外。森林有很多不想告诉别人的秘密。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6567e101:


    "床头柜上的闹钟指着上午10点。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_03fb36a0:


    "初升的太阳照射着田野，可是阳光温暖不了雪地。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c2dd439e:


    "老树枝在风中哼哼着摇摆。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_37640ae5:


    "我从卧室里出去，谈话声就变大了。一阵爽朗的笑声传来了……我好久没听过我妈笑了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8272c84d:


    "这房子本来很安静，充满隐藏的影子。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c10a4a34:


    "不过这笑声听起来很熟悉。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1bf9b043:


    "我偷偷地下楼，仿佛恐怕这一时刻会消失。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3f29a478:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/13 A ya emu.ogg"
    Pap "我对人家说：有没有漫画？我想给我的兔子买几本。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_fd0a8c08:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/13 A on vash.ogg"
    Pap "人家说：你的兔子会看漫画吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2d79b9bc:


    "母亲大声笑起来。奥利娅也笑了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_167996b2:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/14 Nu da govoru.ogg"
    Pap "我说：没错！我的那个兔子是杂技演员！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c865214e:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/108 Bozhe ty.ogg"
    Mam "天哪，你是个天才！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1cdfe4d4:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/15A ti somnevalas.ogg"
    Pap "那可不是啊，你还怀疑我吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e6e64303:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/109 Ni na.ogg"
    Mam "怎么可能啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a9c44229:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/48 Zenih.ogg"
    Oly "新郎新娘！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6378598d:


    "我进厨房的时候，母亲在父亲的头顶亲了一下，而他轻轻抚摩着母亲的肩膀。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d7545b4c:


    "奥利娅坐在他们俩之间，手里拿着一把叉子。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_fcef2c19:


    "带花纹的锅被盖子盖住了，却发出诱人的香味。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2fd6d415:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/16_a_vot.ogg"
    Pap "他来了！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a883f4b4:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/111 Privet.ogg"
    Mam "早上好，贪睡者！你和你爸爸一样都爱睡觉。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_bc44d30b:


    "母亲背后的窗口好像是一快白色的油画布，而我妈好像是在这块油画布上被画的。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_185c48aa:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/17_sadis.ogg"
    Pap "你快坐下，坐下吧，干吗站着呢！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e3c65cc6:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/18_zavtrak.ogg"
    Pap "对一个健康的人，早餐是最重要的一顿饭！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b37715f9:


    "我坐了下来，满意地微笑了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e9cd923c:


    "奥利娅对我眨了眨眼，同时灯闪一下就灭了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_63ec4378:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/112 Zaspanny.ogg"
    Mam "他好困啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_053efa6b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/19_kakoy_yest.ogg"
    Pap "他是咱们的亲儿子！现在把他送进孤儿院已经太晚了！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_01865e0a:


    "父亲笑了一声，表示自己在开玩笑。母亲轻拍了一下他的肩膀。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_336fbb8f:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/49 Oi ya.ogg"
    Oly "哎哟，我饿死了！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d4eefa7d:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/113 A my.ogg"
    Mam "你真的以为只有你一个人饿死了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3ec6fe67:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/50 Bratik.ogg"
    Oly "哥哥，你就这个样子吃饭吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d9edb2e7:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/204. Kak.ogg"
    Ant "什么样子？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3e456c16:


    "父母高兴得不得了，他们用开心的眼神看了我。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1c24d550:


    "假如我身边有一个照相机，我就拍几张照片，这样一来我的家人永远会从照片上笑着看我。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e7109bf0:


    "这样一来，这个美好的瞬间永远都不会消失。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4e8d6ebe:


    "灯又闪了一下就亮了。窗户玻璃稍微抖动，发出响声。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3c114aa4:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/114 Snimy.ogg"
    Mam "儿子，你把面具摘下来吧，吃饭不便。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ad28b04a:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/205. Kakyu masku.ogg"
    Ant "什么面具？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_35b06650:


    "蠢蠢的笑容粘在我嘴唇上。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_cd1547c2:


    "父亲的双唇间露出了两排像琴键一样洁白坚固的牙齿，他说："


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d6179239:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/20_snimay.ogg"
    Pap "兔子，你快把面具摘下来吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_7f0fec2a:


    "我用手抚了一下自己的面颊，笑了起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5d91b50b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/207. Vi o chem.ogg"
    Ant "你们都是什么意思？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_48f24f39:


    "他们都大声笑起来，指着我，拍着自己的膝盖和桌布。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b420b78a:


    "父亲用手指抹去了一滴眼泪说："


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_acd4624b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/21_nasmeshil.ogg"
    Pap "你真的让我们笑掉大牙！真好啊。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5e1cc284:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/22_a_teper_masky.ogg"
    Pap "可是你把这个面具摘下来好不好？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3a997966:


    "我又摸了一下自己的脸。我感到自己的皮肤麻木起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_78a8d323:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/208. No na mne.ogg"
    Ant "可是我没有面具……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_0bd63a9d:


    "母亲在椅子上坐立不安。她把头向一侧歪，瞇起眼睛了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_0046a5c7:


    "窗口的“油画布”已经不是白色的，它越来越黑。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_27792774:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/117 Poka ne.ogg"
    Mam "你不摘，我们不吃。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_7777a3bc:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/52 No ya.ogg"
    Oly "我忍不住想吃！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_fc418571:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/23_snimi_masky.ogg"
    Pap "把它摘下来。别装糊涂。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_98ffe476:


    "他的声音虽然温柔，却很严厉。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b7e98c19:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/53 Mam.ogg"
    Oly "妈……安托沙吓到我了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_010930dd:


    "椅子在地板上滑得发出刺耳声。是奥利娅从我身边挪开了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ced9ab11:


    "她不再笑了。他们都不笑了，也许只有墙上的裂纹在笑。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b94b359e:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/25_chto_nadelal.ogg"
    Pap "你干了什么？你的妹妹在哭呀！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5c673ff6:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/209. No.ogg"
    Ant "可是……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f1803adc:


    "奥利娅低头哭着，皱着眉头小心地看我。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c1b3c838:


    "母亲用拳头敲了一下桌子，我被吓得几乎从椅子上摔在地板上。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e1629be7:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/118 Syn.ogg"
    Mam "这还算是亲儿子吗？你不在，我们那么开心！你把一切都毁了！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_12dde6af:


    "她说话喷口水了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9c37f22b:


    "我转向父亲，求他解释这是怎么回事。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_33b3f3ca:


    "父亲的口里流着糖浆，滴在他的衬衫上。父亲的眼睛同时向两边看。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c6381d2c:


    "我听到了屋顶里有东西咕咚一声坠下来了。从走廊里传来了沙沙声响。自来水管发出啸叫声。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_fe895238:


    "房子活了起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_53ee7734:


    "某物在每个房间里都乱窜着、爬行着、呼吸着。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4944ba59:


    "灯闪得跟频闪观测器一样快。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d108f975:


    "父母的脸一会儿潜入黑暗，一会儿又出现。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e0ff1448:


    "一个很长的影子在窗外走过去了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f30b3310:


    "我本想霍地站起来，跑开，但是身不由己，我的手麻木得厉害。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_65406e71:


    "我只能默默地看着。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_185be18a:


    "灯灭了。在这片漆黑我的心跳了三次。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4d9fc5b6:


    "灯又亮了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a39e0de4:


    "三副面具用自己的孔眼盯着我看。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_650ee620:


    "一个女狐狸坐在母亲的椅子上。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f6b3f8ef:


    "一个男狼站在桌子的前头。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_bb732d6d:


    "还有一个女孩兔子。我的奥利娅。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c1e89823:


    "他们为什么戴上这些奇怪可怕的面具，我不敢问。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9e9759d6:


    "为什么面具上的毛颤动着，仿佛面具里面是活的，我也不敢问。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_59d4bce0:


    "我的舌头不服从大脑的指令。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_bc84e118:


    "我只能看一个接一个的面具。看我家人背后的弯曲的长影子。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_bd23655b:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/119 Kyashat.ogg"
    Mam "晚餐准备好了！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c9af7ee6:


    "她把锅盖揭开了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_17132c22:


    "在血汁中放着的是我的头。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6f6160a9:


    "眼睛木然地盯着我。张开的嘴巴无声地号叫着。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_eca6f86e:


    "我的头正在锅底里。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_123b9a61:


    "血从被砍下的头里流在抽歪的脸上。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_95a1a9d5:


    "同时一股一股热的红色涓流从我鼻孔流出来，桌布就脏了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c89f7b23:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/120 Esh.ogg"
    Mam "吃吧！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_438cd1fe:


    "我喊叫起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a20cefa7:


    "……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8f536ff1:


    "我猛然挺起身。下巴疼如火焚。太阳穴上一阵阵地刺痛。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e6468b0d:


    "厨房、戴面具的怪物、死的脑袋都消失了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9979576f:


    "只有这副可恶的面具还在我身边，可能是那些流氓为了开玩笑给我戴它。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d1366b9a:


    "兔子面具冻了在我脸上，我把它撕掉了，扔到黑暗中，才明白了我是在森林里醒过来的，就在遭破坏的雪人旁边。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a4cfd7af:


    "雪和针叶都粘在我身上。我的眼镜不见了，我的脸被打肿了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_35839a79:


    "原来我昏过去了……还做了一场噩梦。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_867f0938:


    "与那场噩梦相比，抽痛真是一种恩赐。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_50055e48:


    "我站了起来，吐了些唾沫。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2fa60dd0:


    "森林中的树木仿佛是一片围栏把我圈起来。我不知道自己昏迷了多久。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9aa91c15:


    "我的手和脚都冻僵了。裤子都湿了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1a9f70b2:


    "在一片漆黑和耸立的大树中只有我一个人。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_cad5a8d7:


    "我周围的一切都在乱爬和颤动，沙沙声使我耳朵堵住了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a6534b63:


    "树冠在无限的黑暗中溶解。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2d8c53bd:


    "灌木丛变成多间空的囚室，其囚犯都被放出了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_0a5b2458:


    "我有一种感觉，仿佛一只大爪子会从黑暗中伸出，碰到我僵硬的脸。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_23dfdb57:


    "突然我听到外面一声叫喊。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d9f19e0a:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/Antooon.ogg"
    Noname "安东！安东！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_dc852f1f:


    "这声音在找我。仿佛我是……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a53e46a6:


    "仿佛我是那个迷踪的孩子。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_804140e0:


    "刚刚流出来的眼泪刺激我的眼睛。沉重的一滴泪从我睫毛上掉下来。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_eb122af1:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/Antooon2.ogg"
    Noname "安东！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1212bdb7:


    "这声音变大了，一个瞬间内我连相信自己会被救的。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_44afc908:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/188. Ya zes.ogg"
    Ant "我就在这儿！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8c56523c:


    "那一刻，光线就映照在我脸上。我用手掌遮住眼睛。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d6e9aeae:


    "一个树木般的身影向前走出来。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a3673dca:


    "这不是罗马。也不是拜莎。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d89c075a:


    "这大概是个大人。个子高，手臂长。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_25e9f2ca:


    "几个影子在他的后面蹑手蹑脚地往前慢慢移动，酷似几条狗，可是它们比如利卡更大。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b7e3b8bc:


    "森林不再隐瞒真相了，不再隐藏在虚伪的形象后。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5a9f3690:


    "我像站在车灯前的鹿一样呆住了，而那些怪物盯着我看。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4bd938b8:


    "黄昏时，没有眼镜我几乎什么都看不见，不过我所看到的足以吓坏我。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_441734fc:


    "巨人和他可怕的走狗向我迈步时，空气中散发着兽尿和湿毛的刺鼻气味。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_69e0d830:


    "我吓得两腿发软，我就瘫倒在雪地上，仿佛想要向那个身影、树木与黑暗祈祷。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_270e9931:


    "我不敢抬头看他。他靠近我时，一股臭味覆盖了我，一瞬间内我好像看见他的腿上长了灰色的毛发。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_17871447:


    "我把眼睛紧闭起来，很多红圈就开始在我的眼皮里面跳舞。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_cd9ca1c4:


    "我不愿意看！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f9a600e7:


    "但是我不得不听。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ef3a7497:


    "他呼出的气息像砂纸一样擦着我的耳朵。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6700d43b:


    "他的呼吸声嘶哑、深深的。他好像对我咆哮着。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_40253270:



    voice "voice/kozel/2day/02 Hrr A.ogg"
    Noname "吼……吼……啊……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_424bb012:


    "我从记忆中抽取了外婆的咒语："


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d0763be8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/190. Mertvoe.ogg"
    Ant "让死的死！让活的活！让死的……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2973654a:


    "他用吼叫和臭气来回答。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_82a514d4:


    "咒语不能保护我免受他的尖牙和爪子。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_01ca1ed4:


    "我突然听到了熟悉的温柔声音。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_29b0ff20:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/183 Nu ze.ogg"
    Alis "来吧！尝尝他吧！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e24ff65a:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/191. Ne nado.ogg"
    Ant "不要！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c61e0486:


    "一个热的东西碰到了我的脖子，它就像一条很重的、黏糊糊的绳子一样。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a15f81c7:


    "那是舌头。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f2d879ab:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/184 Ya ze.ogg"
    Alis "主人，我说对了！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9dc121d6:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/185 Eto nash.ogg"
    Alis "他就是我们的小兔子。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_562c3fea:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/186 O nem.ogg"
    Alis "好好照顾他吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a91a85bb:


    "在颤抖的手指后面，我瞇着眼睛看到了那个恐吓的身影俯身看着我。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d4b09ed5:


    "我闻到了猎犬、腐烂、青苔的气味。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2872a818:


    "一个有角的野兽在我面前居高临下。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_44e59605:


    "他看起来像一个威严的国王似的。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_25d949c0:


    "他的角支起天空，他睁圆的眼睛盯着我被恐怖而抽搐的脸看。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f9ecaada:


    "我突然发现自己抱着一大堆礼物。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_69597d23:


    "很多糖果掉了在雪地上，彩色的糖纸闪闪发光。巧克力棒的包装银光闪闪，珍宝珠棒棒糖落进雪堆上。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2988afe5:



    voice "voice/kozel/2day/03 Tebe.ogg"
    Master "都给你……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_0261f0ed:


    "无数的糖果在我的脚下倒了出来。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_817abbb0:


    "自动玩具枪落在冰上时，我想到了这个玩具最可能是沃瓦的，就吓得要死。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_bd6ed0a9:


    "一个娃娃落在旁边。像一阵冰雹一样下了别的玩具：陀螺、旧泰迪熊、没有螺旋桨的卡尔森、小锡士兵、消防车、双翼机……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e5afa70d:


    "玩具上面没有血迹，但在我的想象中，它们都沾有红色的流痕和污点。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_918fce23:


    "怪物的影子罩住了失踪孩子的宝物。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4f3c7ebe:



    voice "voice/kozel/2day/04 Beri.ogg"
    Master "拿着吧……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_df9f5b41:


    "毛茸茸的手从黑暗里掏出挥之不去的兔子面具。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_dfb0b180:


    "然后粗野地给我戴上了它。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a8a784eb:



    voice "voice/kozel/2day/05 Zaichick.ogg"
    Master "小兔子。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_25a20648:


    "其它野兽的影子用后腿慢慢地站了起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6b256c37:


    "那一刻，一条光线映照在我脸上，打碎了怪物的影子。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9353c0c1:


    "我用手掌遮住眼睛。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8ed2a454:


    "电筒发出的光从我身上滑落了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4cd4446e:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/32_anton_vot_ty_gde.ogg"
    Pap "安东！是你啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a563d76a:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/33_sovsem_sdyrel.ogg"
    Pap "你干嘛呀你？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3c98f818:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/32_Anton_Z.ogg"
    Pap "安东！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3bf86ee1:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/32_vot_ty_gde.ogg"
    Pap "是你啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_279897b7:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/33_sovsem_sdyrel.ogg"
    Pap "你干嘛呀你？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4b28ec0e:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/34_eto_voobshe_kak_ponimat.ogg"
    Pap "这是怎么一回事？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c6bf311d:


    "父亲从黑暗中走出来。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5bf3b80e:


    "我跑到他，希望他不会消失，希望他不是我的病态幻想产生的另一个幻影。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6c59c72a:


    "原来他是真的、暖和的、活的。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_fdc4907a:


    "我盯着父亲，一句话也说不出来。父亲站在一秒前怪物站的地方。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d8a72140:


    "黑暗覆盖了林中旷地，可是玩具和糖果还可见。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_38a0495d:


    "假如我有力气去看看灌木丛，在那里可能会看到爪印。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_60dc64e9:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/39_yazik_proglotil.ogg"
    Pap "你怎么不说话呀？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c016f605:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/39_ya_vstretil_odnoklassnicy.ogg"
    Pap "我路上遇到了一个女孩儿，你的同学。她说……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e76111d5:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/36_ondoklassniki_tvoi.ogg"
    Pap "你的同学到咱家里来过！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ee41755c:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/36_skazali_chto_sbezhal.ogg"
    Pap "他们说，你一个人跑进了森林深处……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8ff67639:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/36_chto_za_dryan_napyalil.ogg"
    Pap "你戴上了什么东西啊？……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_81a4bbfa:


    "我把面具从出汗的脸上摘下了，把它扔在一堆玩具中。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6118b9bb:


    "附近传来了树枝断裂声。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8a477d1d:


    "我吓得就靠在父亲的身上。他看起来也焦虑不安了，盯着一簇灌木丛看。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_db161afe:


    "他突然紧张起来说："


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_024b51ad:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/41_poydem_otsyda.ogg"
    Pap "咱们快走吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c1607f5b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/41_mat_yznaet_kakoy.ogg"
    Pap "要是你妈知道这件事，那麻烦就大了！"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_eaae37d3:


    "我还没安静下来，伸出手，抓住了父亲的手。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9b5b2bbe:


    "抓住了他的手，我就感到了他的脉搏跳得很快。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_383e5940:


    "我揺揺晃晃地随着父亲走，极力看出来他的脚印。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ea959f1e:


    "我们走着到人居、灯光、我爸路边停车的地方。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_dcf43bfb:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/43_doma_ni_slova.ogg"
    Pap "家里千万不可以提到这件事，懂了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9a65af9c:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/43_ni_edinogo_nameka.ogg"
    Pap "别告诉妈妈我在这里找到了你。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d30d8dd4:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/194. Da pap.ogg"
    Ant "爸，我懂了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_36991087:


    "他抓我的手抓得很紧，仿佛我是一个很珍贵的东西，此外他一直在说，自己特别害怕失去我和奥利娅。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_15ef5576:


    "我一边乖乖地走，一边点头表示明白了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a20cefa7_1:


    "……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4c7d9bde:


    "我们上车，父亲才发现我脸上有擦伤。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_55475c3c:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/45_tebya_bili.ogg"
    Pap "你是被打了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b594bcb1:


    "我摸了一下颧骨。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_70e75287:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/195. Podralsya.ogg"
    Ant "我打架了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a78db4eb:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/48_iz_za_chego.ogg"
    Pap "为什么？"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b1ef0239:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/196. Iz-za devushki.ogg"
    Ant "为一个女生打架了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_db92180f:


    "父亲默默地点了点头。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_16ca79b7:


    "发动机发出突突声。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3f49dcb5:


    "我看了父亲的表情，在他脸上看出来了一种恐惧。不过，这和我噩梦中的粘恐惧不同。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4f52993c:


    "父亲的恐惧是一颗珍贵纯洁的钻石。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_be29bd6c:


    "他打开了杂物箱，抽出了几张纸巾。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9e3cecc9:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/49_mama_by_seychas.ogg"
    Pap "你妈肯定不赞成我想说的话。不过，我告诉你，儿子……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_da62b406:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/49_dratsya_za_devushky.ogg"
    Pap "为一个女生去打架是对的。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9306c95f:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/51_nyzno_reshat.ogg"
    Pap "如果出了一些问题，当然先要用言语来解决。可是……有的时候言语没有什么用。”"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_7a1efd37:


    "父亲给了我一个鼓励的微笑。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2236e6a7:


    "当父亲关上杂物箱之前，我看到了被破布盖的枪把。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_71bf25b7:


    "父亲的车上放着一把手枪。我的有文化的父亲有手枪。就像动作片中的人物一样。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2e6d3f91:


    "{i}“或者像一个普通的强盗一样。”{/i}内心的小声说。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_47cba6b3:


    "汽车窗外的松树轮流出现。前灯克制黑暗。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4f2e56c5:


    "汽车带我回家。父亲通过后视镜警觉地观察着我。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5d1dee6b:


    "我想很多事：手枪、恶梦、装我爸妈的那些戴野兽面具的人。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3b09f86b:


    "他的恐惧没有那个野兽的舌头那么黏糊。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e8eb508b:


    "父亲的恐惧是一颗珍贵纯洁的钻石。我一边乖乖地走，一边点头表示明白了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_24b5ef79:


    "突然背后又传来了熟悉的声音："


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a0be3d3d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/187 Pomni.ogg"
    Alis "记住……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d9b462c6:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/188 Poka.ogg"
    Alis "只要我在你的身边，没有谁会伤害你。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a20cefa7_2:


    "……"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5a296b85:


    "汽车带我回家。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5872c97d:


    "我看了窗外就发现，树林中有一个比黑夜还黑的简陋的建筑物。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_70f5c86d:


    "那就是躲在森林里的车库。金属的墓穴。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1661c63c:


    "它好像一直在跟踪着我们。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ffef0761:


    "不过，很快它就在拐角处消失了。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_dd1cc902:


    "我咽了一下苦味。"


translate chinese bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_657be259:


    "白色的雪花继续在黑暗中漂浮。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_baeffe94:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/05 Tak ya ne.ogg"
    Mam "这是怎么回事啊？安东，你的眼镜呢？难道丢了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_abd546a8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Danumam.ogg"
    Ant "是的，妈。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_fb26fa52:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/06 I kak.ogg"
    Mam "你怎么这么丢三落四啊！你以为我会印钱吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_7c826de7:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/06 Кakze.ogg"
    Mam "可不是啊！你的老眼镜你戴到明年，懂了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_128338d7:


    "奥利娅跑到了我身边。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_e4e3ea29:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/53_a_vot_i_my.ogg"
    Pap "我们回来了！"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_06eeb0a9:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/Yavilis nezapililis.ogg"
    Mam "等你们半天了！"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_5d268b67:


    "妈妈下了楼，以她冷静的眼神看了看父亲。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_86e99377:


    "她脸上的表情从生气变为蔑视。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_d8eaedce:


    "她突然把目光投向了我身上。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_baeffe94_1:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/05 Tak ya ne.ogg"
    Mam "这是怎么回事啊？安东，你的眼镜呢？难道丢了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_e6bc098b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/Da v shkole.ogg"
    Pap "大概是忘在学校里。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_92ed087e:


    "有一个毒性的停顿。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_0dfe5346:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/04 Ves.ogg"
    Mam "他是跟你学的。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_cc623b33:


    "父亲不满意地看了母亲一眼，然后他给我丢了个眼色，提醒我不忘记我们的约定。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_c3f18f57:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/Nu nichego.ogg"
    Pap "没关系，他有另一副。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_92dac484:


    "父母沉默地站着一会，然后开始忙自己的事，彼此远离。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_c9668956:


    "我还没脱大衣，奥利娅就跑到了我身边。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_1357ba80:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/04 A ya.ogg"
    Oly "我今天见过一只狐狸！"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_449d9e9e:


    "我仿佛被子弹击中了。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_7f73c68f:


    "我的双唇默默地微动起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_b16cd6e7:


    "茶杯破碎的声音传来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_74bc3627:


    "它是从母亲的手里掉下去的。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_6a526f4a:


    "母亲的脸白苍苍的，她慌张地盯着碎片看。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_ea1564a6:


    "这个瞬间好像持续了到永远。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_c50f66cf:


    "然后母亲懊恼地说："


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_777bddaa:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/88 To sova to lisa.ogg"
    Mam "那时候是猫头鹰，现在是狐狸呀！"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_e0dfd3dd:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/89 Kogda zh.ogg"
    Mam "你还没厌倦说谎吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_a40999a9:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/05 Pravda-pravda.ogg"
    Oly "我说的都是实话！"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_fe3a47fa:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/06 Takaya.ogg"
    Oly "这狐狸毛茸茸的！"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_d38a15de:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/07 Ona u zabora.ogg"
    Oly "她在篱笆前两条腿站，真像一个人一样。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_c17db89b:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/08 Ona menya.ogg"
    Oly "她叫我的名字，但那时候妈妈出来了，狐狸就跑了。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_8f99ea53:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/90 Ne bilo tam.ogg"
    Mam "没有什么狐狸！"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_3f650de5:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/91 Ne vid.ogg"
    Mam "你别瞎编了！"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_d0642c18:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/212. Ne podhodi k nei.ogg"
    Ant "别靠近她！"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_f2f3942b:


    "如果需要，我会摇动妹妹，仿佛她是一个布娃娃似的。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_9ffaaf27:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/09 Ti chego.ogg"
    Oly "托沙，你怎么了？"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_6f6e2ff8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/213. Ne podhodi slish.ogg"
    Ant "别靠近她，你懂了没有？！"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_6763db01:


    "母亲从厨房走出来，惊奇地看了我一眼。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_b0277fbe:


    "我感到不好意思了。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_3035267b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/214. Nu lisa ved.ogg"
    Ant "我是在说……狐狸会咬人呢。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_ce4108af:


    "我想起来了一些神话，其中的狐狸会偷孩子。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_ca61f047:


    "我就想到我的野生的、自由自在的阿狸萨，想到她在漆黑中的森林里会跑得很快，还会抱一个颤动着的麻袋。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_23f1bd90:


    "我就想到野生的、自由自在的阿狸萨，想到她在漆黑中的森林里会跑得很快，还会抱一个颤动着的麻袋。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_4c12205d:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/92 Eto ze.ogg"
    Mam "这不是真正的狐狸呀。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_fb8c9c17:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/93 Rasskazi.ogg"
    Mam "奥利娅，你告诉他吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_953c4e04:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/10 Ona na.ogg"
    Oly "她两条腿走路，穿着连衣裙。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_332b747a:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/11 Tolko ona.ogg"
    Oly "就这样。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_4eb5229d:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/94 Vidish.ogg"
    Mam "明白了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_bde3724c:


    "母亲疲惫地笑了，仿佛说明了一切。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_1bdfe85d:


    "我也勉强地笑了一下。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_029da0b1:


    "我的笑容像一小块还没溶的肥皂一样可怜。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_17dc1c73:


    "爸妈走开了之后，我对奥利娅小声地说："


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_51d2c40c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/215. Eshe raz.ogg"
    Ant "要是再见到她，就跑吧。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_e296527c:


    "噩梦中戴着丑陋面具的家人记忆仿佛卑鄙的同学们恐吓我。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_5388e389:


    "我还记得他们脸上长出的一层毛、充满粘稠口水的嘴、毕露的獠牙。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_19d193f4:


    "我到底是怎么了？"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_6e7e4bc3:


    "我的脑子有什么毛病？"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_47c357bf:


    "兔子面具是真正的。虽然我扔了它，它却在我的书包里。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_6aab693b:


    "对森林怪物的回忆攻击着我，如糖果与玩具的雨。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_dfd32328:


    "树干背景下的毛茸茸的身影还清晰地站在我眼前。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_77813321:


    "他是谁？今天森林里发生了什么？"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_19d193f4_1:


    "我到底是怎么了？"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_7ae65de0:


    "我闭上眼睛，把维生素药片放在嘴里。然后用水把药送服下去。"


translate chinese bunny2_home_evening_0e705f7b:


    "我不想失去理智。够了吧……"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_d5dbc47c:


    "我强迫自己去做数学功课，不过连一道题都不会了。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_dc7bfe1f:


    "本子上的数字一边都混在一起，一边跳舞得从纸上跳出。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_c1a431a4:


    "这混乱使我头重了，使它坠入数字的海里。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_a6208c31:


    "我的眼皮也感觉很重，好像它们之下挂着小砝码。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_9417e8b6:


    "我放弃了，合上了本子，这一天的回忆就在我眼前乱跳起来。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_801ca47a:


    "星期五晚上我忙于做作业。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_2b4f1e9e:


    "最难的题我已经完成了。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_151d538e:


    "我只要做到美术作业。美术课就是我最喜欢的一节课。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_d5f7abe8:


    "那次作业是画一个神奇的动物。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_461bdffe:


    "我本来想画一只恐龙，可是画笔好像是主动地向橙色涂伸出去。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_322861da:


    "一笔接一笔，纸上逐渐出现了一只狐狸。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_f7447bc7:


    "它仿佛直接从那张雪白的纸上爬出来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_0a68415d:


    "狐狸站立，笑得非常狡猾。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_e83675a3:


    "最后一笔完成了毛茸茸的狐狸尾巴。然后画笔从我变弱的手里掉下来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_205d4b06:


    "画完后，我惊奇地看了看我的画，看了很久，仿佛自己不明白那个橙色的动物到底是从哪儿来的."


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_5671e505:


    "我看狐狸的笑容看得越久，越觉得它的笑容很可怕。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_ec62154c:


    "它的笑容又感性又虚伪，让我想到城市里售货亭可买的成人杂志封面女星的笑容。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_ef18976e:


    "那种笑容很诱惑人，却包含纯粹的恶意。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_f81f1ad6:


    "狐狸的眼睛是红色的，如充满血。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_a07d007e:


    "那些眼睛看起来似乎是动作片中的弹孔。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_e6e92568:


    "我从来没画过这样的眼睛。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_7e83ba8d:


    "我从桌子边移开了一下，台灯的灯光折射在还没干的水彩上。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_7524ce4e:


    "画儿发着亮光。有一会儿我觉得这狐狸盯着我看。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_f4ccc382:


    "仿佛等我……"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_650c389e:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/55_anton.ogg"
    Pap "安东！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_663ca060:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/56_ty_ogloh_B.ogg"
    Pap "你聋了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_c2761792:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/217. Ya zadumals.ogg"
    Ant "我……我只是在想其它的事。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_68143d59:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/57_tebya_sprashivau.ogg"
    Pap "我说，你的妹妹在哪儿，你知道吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_72f1e974:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/58_opyat_ona_gdeto.ogg"
    Pap "她又躲起来了。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_49a8276e:


    "我好像在床下看到了什么，就发呆了。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_c4c13261:


    "一瞬间内，奥利娅的脏脸闪了一下，我看到了她把手指放在唇边。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_762236ce:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/13 Tss.ogg"
    Oly "嘘！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_7c145aff:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/59_olya_ya_vizhu.ogg"
    Pap "奥利娅！我看见你了。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_9c2e8d4b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/59_vylezhai.ogg"
    Pap "快爬出来。床底下有这么多灰尘啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_6013a7a6:


    "奥利娅爬出来了，低下头开始抖掉裤袜上的灰尘。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_64d160b7:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/60_poydem_ol.ogg"
    Pap "走吧，奥利娅。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_2b271ae5:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/60_ya_tebe_skazky_pochitau.ogg"
    Pap "我给你读书。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_5068a23b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/60_posizhu_s_toboy_poka.ogg"
    Pap "我陪你到你睡觉。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_f4cd89d6:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/14 Ya s vami.ogg"
    Oly "我想在爸爸妈妈的房间里睡觉。不是在我的。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_963d0354:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/15 Tam.ogg"
    Oly "那里有……"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_2870c108:


    "母亲走进了房间。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_3547b730:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/102 Chto opyat.ogg"
    Mam "又是猫头鹰吧？"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_c7fb241f:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/61_a_kto_eshe.ogg"
    Pap "那可不！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_42f12ce4:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/61_ol_ona_ne_pridet.ogg"
    Pap "奥利娅，它不会再来。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_1cd31267:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/61_ya_ee_prognal.ogg"
    Pap "我把它赶走了。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_4ee58437:


    "奥利娅坚决地摇了摇头。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_148c1168:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Neprognal.1.ogg"
    Oly "你没有。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_e80c5929:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Onapridet.2.ogg"
    Oly "它会再来。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_ba9aa114:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Ona skazala.3.ogg"
    Oly "它说过，它每夜都会来。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_375607ad:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/62_o_tak_ona.ogg"
    Pap "噢，它还会说话呀？"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_d7c86999:


    "奥利娅没有回答那个问题，只是满脸恳求地说："


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_208cbe1f:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Moznoyasva.1.ogg"
    Oly "我和爸爸妈妈一起睡，好吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_41665d8d:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Mozno.2.ogg"
    Oly "可以吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_bff4ad70:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Vsamiposledni.3.ogg"
    Oly "我保证这就是最后一次了。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_47bf8998:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/103 Ty ze govorila.ogg"
    Mam "昨天你不是已经说过“最后一次”吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_43ff6005:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/63_olga_ty_yzhe_bolshaya.ogg"
    Pap "奥利娅，你已经长大了……"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_2b273d34:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Apust.ogg"
    Ant "她可以在我的房间里睡觉！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_b144830c:


    "我以为那是个好主意。但奥利娅只是摇了摇头。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_81b612f7:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/18 Net u tebya.ogg"
    Oly "不行。我不想在你的房间里睡觉。它不仅看我，还看你。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_21bc3017:


    "我背上起了鸡皮疙瘩。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_8cf1b1fc:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/104 Hvatit.ogg"
    Mam "得了吧！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_cf86e983:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/105 Net nikakoy.ogg"
    Mam "不要再提那个猫头鹰啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_1ae542ba:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/105 Ty segodnya.ogg"
    Mam "你赶紧去你的房间睡觉吧。懂了吗？"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_63e28d8d:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Nupozaluistamam.ogg"
    Oly "妈妈，不要！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_621ce3f2:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Pozaluista.ogg"
    Oly "我求求你！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_db6656c0:


    "母亲抓住了奥利娅的手，试图把她从房间里领走。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_ef053e5f:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/106 Poydem milaya.ogg"
    Mam "宝贝，咱们走吧，不要打扰你哥哥啦。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_4aa30553:


    "奥利娅用另一只手紧紧抓住了床头板。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_889077a3:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/PozaluistaPozaluista.ogg"
    Oly "不要！不要！不要啊！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_9ef7873d:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Nehochyknei.ogg"
    Oly "我不想看见它！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_44a0d149:


    "母亲开始拉奥利娅的手，可是奥利娅继续抓住床头板，床头板就发出哀嚎的吱吱声。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_304a07c4:


    "然后父亲走到了奥利娅的身边，把她抱在怀里、带走了，没有理会她的抗议。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_57328fbe:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Nenado.ogg"
    Oly "不要！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_1a61fb1c:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Nenadoknei.ogg"
    Oly "我不想去那里！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_88f9939e:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Onaopyatsmotret.ogg"
    Oly "它又要看我！"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_2899033f:


    "在我的房间里我能听到爸妈一直在试着哄奥利娅睡觉。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_a6df4a01:


    "结果他们放弃了，又允许奥利娅和他们一起睡。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_cd232cb9:


    "她又保证那是真正的最后一次。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_f30a2b77:


    "一切都安静了以后，我躺在黑暗里，一直在想奥利娅的话。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_a038bb74:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Ona.ogg"
    "“它不仅看我，还看你。”"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_0acea364:


    "这让我很不舒服。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_e208a4ad:


    "我拉上了窗帘，才安下心来。"


translate chinese bunny2_night_room_anton_table_55e88530:


    "不过，我一闭上了眼睛，我脑海中就充满了白天的回忆。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_c986b703:


    "我又出现在闷热的学校走廊里。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_f0227932:


    "从这里可以看见文学教室、已经去世的作家画像、班主任莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜的傲慢姿态。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_a6fe7ba9:


    "她心爱的女儿卡佳就在拐角处等候，大家都知道她是一个告密者、一个爱说闲话的女孩。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_7b25238d:



    voice "voice/kate/15 KA.ogg"
    Kate "嘿，新来的啊！安东！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_e01fce44:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/219. Chego tebe.ogg"
    Ant "你干嘛叫我？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_7a580114:


    "她踮起脚来，把手放在背后开始摆来摆去，带着假笑问了我："


translate chinese day2_nightmare_c9a2d820:



    voice "voice/kate/16 KA.ogg"
    Kate "我想问你一下，你为什么转到了我们的学校啊？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_ea980f9d:


    "要是问我这个问题的人是波琳娜，那我可能会说实话。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_15182214:


    "而这个卡佳，她肯定会把我的实话给别人贱卖，其实对她告诉一个秘密等同于把我的思想打印在纸上便悬挂在沃瓦的照片旁边，以让大家看看。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_232b9f9c:


    "我又用了一个现成的答案。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_6ea49044:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/220 Eto vse.ogg"
    Ant "这都是因为我的父母……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_faa9b193:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/220.2 U papi.ogg"
    Ant "父亲到了新的工作岗位，而母亲……她……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_66b3616b:


    "可是卡佳没在听，她走到了她的几个闺蜜，一边斜着眼睛看了我，一边对她们窃笑地说："


translate chinese day2_nightmare_f139ff72:



    voice "voice/kate/17 KA.ogg"
    Kate "可不是啊！都是撒谎啊！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_f0855326:



    voice "voice/kate/18 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他以为咱们都是傻子吧。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_a57da774:



    voice "voice/kate/19 KA.ogg"
    Kate "我听说，他全家因为他父亲的事搬到这里了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_55750c13:



    voice "voice/kate/20 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他的父亲骗了一个有钱有势的人，所以他们全家躲在我们的偏僻的村子里。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_391ded90:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/221. Nepravda.ogg"
    Ant "你这个骗子！你在撒谎！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_95e3f6b0:



    voice "voice/kate/21 KA.ogg"
    Kate "你们听没听过，他无缘无故地打了巴布林？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_ecc158fb:



    voice "voice/kate/22 KA.ogg"
    Kate "什么样的人会第一天就去打同学？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_056a4040:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/222. Prekrati on perviy.ogg"
    Ant "别说了！都是他先挑起的，你不会不知道的！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_95c2baf1:



    voice "voice/kate/23 KA.ogg"
    Kate "你们听没听过巴布林打了他一顿？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_73e4b8a7:



    voice "voice/kate/24 KA.ogg"
    Kate "这个安东连回击都不会了！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_319b2ee8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/223. Prekrati ne odin.ogg"
    Ant "别说了！他在那里不是一个人，你不会不知道的！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_f1976bd2:



    voice "voice/kate/25 KA.ogg"
    Kate "我听说……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_23c74b4e:



    voice "voice/kate/32 KA.ogg"
    Kate "这个怪人总是携带兔子面具。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0ec83e58:



    voice "voice/kate/33 KA.ogg"
    Kate "哎呀，难道一个没有神经病的人会这样吗？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_a256839c:



    voice "voice/kate/34 KA.ogg"
    Kate "咱们的安托沙当然有毛病。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_bbf15fa8:



    voice "voice/kate/35 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他可能只是一个小傻瓜……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_56ee0596:



    voice "voice/kate/36 KA.ogg"
    Kate "……也可能他是个狂人！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_52f64465:



    voice "voice/kate/38 KA.ogg"
    Kate "谁知道，他的书包了都藏了些什么，可能那里有斧子什么的！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_ada749bb:



    voice "voice/kate/26 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他和罗马·比亚蒂法诺夫那个贼人搞在一起了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0dfa5d19:



    voice "voice/kate/27 KA.ogg"
    Kate "哎呀，姑娘们，你们注意你们的东西吧！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_54aa5bf9:



    voice "voice/kate/28 KA.ogg"
    Kate "要是谁的东西不见了……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_ba6bc255:



    voice "voice/kate/29 KA.ogg"
    Kate "那我们就知道，是彼得罗夫和他的朋友干的！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_23c74b4e_1:



    voice "voice/kate/32 KA.ogg"
    Kate "这个怪人总是携带兔子面具。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0ec83e58_1:



    voice "voice/kate/33 KA.ogg"
    Kate "哎呀，难道一个没有神经病的人会这样吗？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_a256839c_1:



    voice "voice/kate/34 KA.ogg"
    Kate "咱们的安托沙当然有毛病。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_bbf15fa8_1:



    voice "voice/kate/35 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他可能只是一个小傻瓜……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_56ee0596_1:



    voice "voice/kate/36 KA.ogg"
    Kate "……也可能他是个狂人！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_52f64465_1:



    voice "voice/kate/38 KA.ogg"
    Kate "谁知道，他的书包了都藏了些什么，可能那里有斧子什么的！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_336404ad:



    voice "voice/kate/30 KA.ogg"
    Kate "是啊！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_be7ab16a:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/224. Zamolchi.ogg"
    Ant "你给我闭嘴！闭嘴！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_46f6df57:



    voice "voice/kate/39 KA.ogg"
    Kate "你们看他现在的样子啊！喊疯了！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_bb038898:



    voice "voice/kate/40 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他的瞳孔啊，那么大呀！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_ff1b6582:



    voice "voice/kate/41 KA.ogg"
    Kate "说不定他又要发疯便开始打人。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_570a784a:



    voice "voice/kate/42 KA.ogg"
    Kate "怪不得他妈总是让他吃药。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_ee0e1a52:


    "我就发呆了，弄不清楚了，她怎么会知道这件事？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_447f9b51:



    voice "voice/kate/43 KA.ogg"
    Kate "我告诉你们，"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_f4f6327c:



    voice "voice/kate/44 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他和他的妹妹都有神经病。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_341b4096:



    voice "voice/kate/45 KA.ogg"
    Kate "那个傻女孩说，一只巨大的猫头鹰每个晚上都飞来她家。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_76bc4623:



    voice "voice/kate/46 KA.ogg"
    Kate "是啊！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_a552ed46:



    voice "voice/kate/47 KA.ogg"
    Kate "可是神经没有问题的人都见不到这个怪物。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_14bab388:



    voice "voice/kate/48 KA.ogg"
    Kate "只有这个幼稚的安东相信她。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_7c983da9:



    voice "voice/kate/49 KA.ogg"
    Kate "太荒谬了吧！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_e662d987:


    "他们都在嘲笑我，这人群中只有一个关切的眼神。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_7838176c:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/45 Pravda.ogg"
    Pol "安东，她说实话吗？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_50b1f802:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/50 Kak ze tak.ogg"
    Pol "安东，这怎么可能呢？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_41d6ade2:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/46 Neuzeli.ogg"
    Pol "她说实话吗？你真的有困难吗？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_935f4557:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/225. Polina poslush.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜……你听我解释一下！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_7ab118c5:



    voice "voice/kate/50 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他会解释什么呀！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_3a63b508:



    voice "voice/kate/51 KA.ogg"
    Kate "波琳娜，你别听这个骗子吧！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_603a0eb2:



    voice "voice/kate/52 KA.ogg"
    Kate "你还不知道……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_9f436308:



    voice "voice/kate/53 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他和别的女孩在一起了！她不是咱学校的。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_de622090:



    voice "voice/kate/54 KA.ogg"
    Kate "她叫阿狸萨。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_81167d06:



    voice "voice/kate/61 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他说自己去过莫斯科，一定对你撒了个谎。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_59a86e32:



    voice "voice/kate/57 KA.ogg"
    Kate "这个废物连反击都不能……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_f0ed92c6:



    voice "voice/kate/58 KA.ogg"
    Kate "你要是出什么事，他不去救你。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_80db8870:



    voice "voice/kate/59 KA.ogg"
    Kate "为了自己安然无恙，他就会离弃你的。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_6f4ad66d:



    voice "voice/kate/60 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他是一个胆小鬼……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_2d2a8079:


    "波琳娜向下弯腰了，仿佛被踢到肚子似的，她倒在肮脏的地板上，哇哇大哭起来了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_75611b00:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/153 net.ogg"
    Pol "不会吧！不会吧！！！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_4a942b29:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/153  pochemu ona.ogg"
    Pol "你为什么选择她，安东？为什么？！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0a00ad11:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/159 Anton.ogg"
    Pol "怎么可能啊，安东？为什么？！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0d70ff2c:


    "不知不觉地，我冲过去帮波琳娜，可是卡佳粗暴地推开了我。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_25ce437d:



    voice "voice/kate/62 KA.ogg"
    Kate "你这个妖怪，别碰她！" with vpunch


translate chinese day2_nightmare_09e2fb1c:


    "怨恨在恐怖幕之下成长起来。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_1b034634:


    "怨恨慢慢地从一片阴霾里浮出来。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_67b72dc9:


    "我觉到了，自己的上嘴唇滑到牙龈上，露出牙齿。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_ad457bf3:



    voice "voice/kate/63 KA.ogg"
    Kate "即使你爸打你妈，你都没有权力打女生！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_09055aa6:


    "我的双拳变成像大锤一样沉重坚定。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_8e271cbf:


    "任何人都不可以这样说我家！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_415a47f1:


    "我扑向了恶毒的卡佳，才醒悟过来。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_9d956dd3:



    voice "voice/kate/64 KA.ogg"
    Kate "哎呀！疯了吧！他疯了！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_e91cdcb4:



    voice "voice/kate/65 KA.ogg"
    Kate "救命！救命！彼得罗夫发疯了！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_c85bb11d:


    "周围的学生突然都在吵嚷起来，他们又发出呸呸声又吹口哨。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_6a1c61f6:


    "这人群越来越大。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_71d194da:


    "同学们的娇弱的身躯变大变胖，长得越来越高，高到天花板了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_c53975cd:


    "他们都变成了一片阴暗的森林，其中的露出牙齿的怪物到处乱跑。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_6faa715a:


    "我蜷缩起来，仿佛是软软的一团似的；不像人也不像树的溃烂的躯干让我吓得发抖。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_bcc3cb81:



    voice "voice/kate/66 KA.ogg"
    Kate "你的兽性终于大发了！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0bd8efef:



    voice "voice/kate/67 KA.ogg"
    Kate "你这个胆小鬼！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_06ddb992:


    "卡佳的脸上绽放了恶心的喜悦。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_7c24c3c5:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/51 Anton.ogg"
    Pol "安东！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_75cc05b1:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/157  pochemu ona_net.ogg"
    Pol "你为什么要选择她？我不信！！！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_b8420e77:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/158 Chem ona.ogg"
    Pol "她那里比我好啊？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_93d7d584:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/155 Pochemu.ogg"
    Pol "为什么？我不信！！！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_75df694f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/156 Zachto.ogg"
    Pol "你怎么能这样对我呀？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_a0e93bb0:


    "可怜的波琳娜潸然泪下。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_866a8efe:



    voice "voice/kate/68 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他呀！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_f28d57ae:



    voice "voice/kate/69 KA.ogg"
    Kate "他是个野兽！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_846861d9:



    voice "voice/kate/70 KA.ogg"
    Kate "外人！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_dfef7ed6:


    "森林里传来了振翅恐吓的声音。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_3e10d2aa:


    "两个巨大的白色翅膀从天上落下来，我把自己埋在其中。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_c2e8ff82:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/148 Dva ogromnih.ogg"
    Pol "安东！安东！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_f0e0945a:



    voice "voice/kate/71 KA.ogg"
    Kate "就这样吧。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_18596436:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/24 Vstavai.ogg"
    Oly "快醒醒！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_1e891349:


    "我退缩一下，几乎从床上掉下来。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_84499192:


    "原来我在被汗水湿透的床单上做了几个小时的噩梦。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_a251d742:


    "奥利娅的叫声把我从噩梦的触手中拉出来了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_041ac0c3:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/25 Anton.ogg"
    Oly "安东！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_e816e94a:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/27 Pls.ogg"
    Oly "我求求你……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0ff9ef66:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/24 Vstavai_vstavai.ogg"
    Oly "快起来……快起来！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_bfc7486c:


    "站在窗户前的身影我看不太清楚。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_137b9971:


    "奥利娅说的话我也听不清，因为打架后听力有点下降。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_b1936b74:


    "声音出现失真。就像我的耳朵塞了棉花似的。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_e787bd06:


    "我的妹妹深感不安，呜咽着再三重复说："


translate chinese day2_nightmare_fee8623a:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/28 Sova.ogg"
    Oly "猫头鹰！猫头鹰！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_2075b80d:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/29 Pls2.ogg"
    Oly "我求求你……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_d9ba444c:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/30 Ya bouys.ogg"
    Oly "我害怕啊！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_269a017f:


    "她的眼泪如沸水烫伤我的心，但对这次猫头鹰来了我好像感恩。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_29d55105:


    "因为受惊吓的奥利娅把我惊醒了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_1a9ab8f3:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/227. Olya ya.ogg"
    Ant "奥利娅，别哭别哭……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_6d7ea1b6:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/228. Hochesh Murzilku.ogg"
    Ant "要不我给你读一下{u}《穆尔济尔卡》{/u}？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_e7f76792:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/229. Podozdi.ogg"
    Ant "等一下……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0ad3a4b1:


    "我光着脚踩在冷的地板上。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_53dc4da0:


    "开始摸索着找眼镜。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_d936fb27:


    "我想起了谢苗和他做的卑鄙的事情，哀叹一声。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_09c375c4:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/31 Anton.ogg"
    Oly "安东。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_d92dc6ae:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/31 Pls pls.ogg"
    Oly "我求求你……求求你！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_4e07d7e2:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/32 Posmotri.ogg"
    Oly "你去看看！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_1968b753:


    "她目不转睛地看窗口，仿佛害怕在瞪眼比赛中输给它。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_917d7f5e:


    "我摸到了电灯开关，那盏灯就发出耀眼的光。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_06472478:


    "我从床上站起来了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_6892d788:


    "我的眼睛误导我了：窗户时而近，时而远。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_57c49de7:


    "我的妹妹也是一个模糊的身影。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_5aff6b47:


    "我小心地向前迈了一步。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_115408df:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/231 Ol.ogg"
    Ant "奥利娅……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_b42c67c5:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/231.2 Chto tam.ogg"
    Ant "那里有什么呢？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_94403258:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/232 Chto-to sluch.ogg"
    Ant "你怎么了？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_d77e015c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/232.2 Ti hochshesh.ogg"
    Ant "你要我拉开窗帘吗？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_49064e7a:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/33 Net pls.ogg"
    Oly "不！不要！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_563f428a:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/34 Tam ze.ogg"
    Oly "猫头鹰它就在那儿！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_a7e7687e:


    "这个声音从我背后传来了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_a9725d16:


    "我转过来，就吓得发呆了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_bf600f29:


    "泪痕满面的奥利娅在门口站着。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0aef4c84:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/35 S kem.ogg"
    Oly "哥哥，你……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_47240916:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/36 S kem ti.ogg"
    Oly "哥哥，你在和谁说话呢？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0b86b563:


    "她的眼睛哭肿了，她抱着肩膀看了我，仿佛害怕知道答案。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_9d586105:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/234. Ya razgovarival.ogg"
    Ant "我和你说话……和装成你的生物……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_8e216edd:


    "窗外的屋檐发出威胁的吱吱声，仿佛有什么很重的坐在屋檐上。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_f3c33d99:


    "装成奥利娅的生物在不知足的月光下开始拉伸，伸展到吓人的大小。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_e53d5c1e:



    voice "voice/Owl/Owl_2day/02 Anton.ogg"
    Noname "安东！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0d0d7bdd:



    voice "voice/Owl/Owl_2day/04 Pozalsta.ogg"
    Noname "我求求你……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_b1abf34d:



    voice "voice/Owl/Owl_2day/05 Podoidi.ogg"
    Noname "过来……过来吧！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_a5d0dc7d:


    "那个声音已经不是妹妹的。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_39efd88e:


    "躲在窗帘后的生物厌倦了假装。厌倦了愚弄我。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_ee9f6adf:


    "我掐了掐自己，希望窗户前的身影只不过是噩梦的遗迹或者这闹鬼房子的幻象，希望不管怎样它都不会伤害人。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_49682bca:


    "身影在我面前的模糊中变大了……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_5e2f87a7:


    "忽然传来了一阵敲窗声，奥利娅就尖叫起来。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_f1dda148:


    "敲一敲……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_8c8031f1:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/38 Ona prishla.ogg"
    Oly "它来追我们了！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_1eea48aa:


    "敲窗声又传来了，我就往后退缩了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_8fe042f2:


    "仿佛在阴暗的角落里可以躲避所有的恐怖现象。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_f1dda148_1:


    "敲一敲……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_91f7405b:


    "它好像用金属尖锐物来撞击窗户。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_011f06f5:


    "灯光闪了几下，然后就像被大风吹灭的蜡烛一样熄灭了，灯丝啪的一声爆炸了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_789457a9:


    "黑暗好像一直在等待这个时刻来临，屋里陷入了一片漆黑。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_49fb88b6:


    "在这片漆黑中只有透过窗户的月光，月亮把外面的一切涂成陈旧的骨头颜色。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_d31e658e:


    "奥利娅在黑暗中尖声喊叫起来，紧偎着我，寻找保护。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_c7782c1d:


    "就在那时，一只里面有饿火的眼睛盯着我们看了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_92efc428:


    "笃笃！笃笃！笃笃！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_582b2930:


    "它并不是想敲碎玻璃窗。它大概是想玩一种游戏。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_80d20f58:


    "它继续敲窗户，把我们逼疯。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_92efc428_1:


    "笃笃！笃笃！笃笃！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_054ee0ba:


    "这声音仿佛一个大报时钟为我们的最后一刻倒计时似的，而钟摆来回地摆动在深渊上。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_8ea650a5:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/39 Uhodi.ogg"
    Oly "走开！滚出去！滚出去！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_880dc0ef:


    "奥利娅紧紧地抓住了我的手，一直在疯狂地叫。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_3516a48a:



    voice "voice/Owl/Owl_2day/06 Anton.ogg"
    Noname "安东！安东！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_1d67faff:



    voice "voice/Owl/Owl_2day/07 Podoidi.ogg"
    Noname "过来！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_cb9a3835:


    "我勉强看得清模糊的身影上出现了两只巨大的翅膀"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_0cefe2a9:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/40 Skazi.ogg"
    Oly "安东，告诉它！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_2a45d6ef:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/41 Skazi chto.ogg"
    Oly "告诉它，我以后会乖乖的！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_cc1779e1:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/42 Nikogda.ogg"
    Oly "我保证！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_836cb5fe:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/43 Tolko pust.ogg"
    Oly "我只要它飞走！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_8c9ce15c:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/44 Pls.ogg"
    Oly "我求求你！"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_9493d8c7:


    "忽然月光暗了下来，发光的眼睛也消失了，房间变黑了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_60783264:


    "我使劲地咽了一下唾沫，就像吃了苍耳子似的。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_87ce9218:


    "丑陋客人的呼唤把我吸引住了，我向窗帘迈了一步。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_19c692ba:


    "奥利娅在我后面一直在重复说：“我会乖乖的，我会乖乖的！”"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_36cbc57e:


    "暗淡的窗户越来越近。窗帘沙沙响着。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_4dd91d3d:


    "我伸出手去拉开窗帘、面对自己的恐惧。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_8c15bcf2:


    "就在那时，从父母的卧室里传来了声响。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_67c78d98:


    "我毫不犹豫地把窗帘一下子就拉开了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_4bb628cf:


    "没有人。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_e92e7cf6:


    "不过，窗外的屋檐上有一个东西在羽毛中闪着微光。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_eaa01684:


    "那就是我的眼镜。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_be6ab821:


    "谢苗拿走的那个。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_e7909e93:


    "它怎么会出现在这里呢？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_e88263aa:


    "难道是唧唧咕咕的黑夜给我送的礼物吗？难道是猫头鹰把我的眼镜带来的吗？"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_366e9cd3:


    "我看了窗外的院子、凶险的平地、齿状的阴沉森林……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_fc1cc08c:


    "没有人。不速之客的迹象也哪儿都没有。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_c4fd22f0:


    "老电杆如孤单的哨兵一样在被雪覆盖的沙漠上睡着。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_e3d48c2e:


    "破旧的窗板一直在吱吱作响。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_d1ac9215:


    "我把保温膜和{u}报纸条{/u}从窗框上撕了下来。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_46c562d6:


    "我使劲地把窗户打开了。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_74e37d7d:


    "我就感到了寒冷刺骨。一股寒气吹动了墙上的画儿。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_13dba34e:


    "我碰了碰眼镜，确信眼镜会在我的手里融化的。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_dc860464:


    "不过眼镜是真实的。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_32f6824d:


    "大脑开始为此寻找解释。说不定是谢苗和他的朋友搞了一场恶作剧，就这样。"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_9c797ad5:


    "就这样……"


translate chinese day2_nightmare_720c0ba4:


